<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id">- Ngoni Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">MVALANGU</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu cha Mvalangu Chiyandikwi na Musa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mvalangu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mva</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu cha Mvalangu chiyandikwi na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Musa</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Mvalangu chidandawula lugendu lwa miyaka alubaini ya vana va Isilaeli kupitila kulugangatu, pavavili vakona kuyingila kumulima wevahaidiwi, ndi mulima wa Kanaani. Chitabu chenichi chikemiwa Mvalangu muni chivi na pahala pavili zezidandawula mvalangu wa vagosi vavakomana ngondo vevavili mukila likabila la Isilaeli, musula ya 1 na 26. Vasomi visadika kuvya chitabu cha Mvalangu ndi chimonga ya vitabu vya mihilu, Mwanzu na kuwuka na Valawi na kumbukumbu la mihilu, vyayandikwi na mlota Musa. Uchakaka wenuwu uwonekana muchitabu chene cha mvalangu, pala pachitumbula kwa kujova jova Chapanga palongili na Musa, mvalangu 1:1. Yihotoleka mewa kuvya Musa ayandiki pandu pavaha pa chitabu chene cha Mvalangu, na vayandika va mayandiku vayonjokisi vipandi vingi mumiyaka yeyagelekili. Ndi yinonopa kujova kuvya Musa ngahotwili kuyandika kuvala ungolongondi na kujilumba mwene mumvalangu 12:3.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mulugendu lwavi kulugangatu, vana va Isileli vamuvembenikili na kumng'anamukila Chapanga pamahele. Ndava ya uhakau wavi wenuwo vabuniwi ndava ya matendu gavi. Luhumu lumonga wa lijambu lenili ndi lukumbi vana va Isilaeli pavayogwipi na kung'ung'uta kuvya Vakanaani vavili na makakala neju kuliku vene Mvalangu 14:1-4. Ndava ya lijambu lenilo Chapanga ajovili kuvya chiveleku chenichi choha cha vandu ava va Vaisilaeli yati viyingila lepi kumulima wevahadiwi. Yavi hati Musa mwene amyidakili lepi Chapanga, ndi ndava ya lijambu lenili hati Musa mwene ayingi lepi ku mulima wevahaidiwi. Pamonga na genago vandu vambelili chapanga nambu ayendelili kuvayunga. Lukumbi vamakoko va vandu va Isilaeli pavamtolili mlota wa chipagani mwaakemiwi Balaamu avapela likoto kwa vandu va Isilaeli, nambu Chapanga amkitli Balaamu ajovili avamotisa Vaisilaeli Malangu 22-24</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavili</para>
  <para style="io">1 Mambu gegivala mvalangu wa vana va Isilaeli, mewa kuvili na mpangililu wa kambi yavi cheuvili, mahengu ga vamteta, na teta zeziwusiwi kuhuma mukila likabila lukumbi pandu pa kuwusila teta na Lindanda pevyakitiwi kuvya vya Bambu Musula 1 na ya 10 na ya 11</para>
  <para style="io">2 Pa genago chitabu cha mvalangu chidandawula lugendu lwa vandu va Isilaeli kupitila kulugangatu, Musula ya 10:12 mbaka musula 25</para>
  <para style="io">3 Kuvalangiwa kwa mbili na madandaulo gangi kuvala vandu va Isilaeli. Yeniyi ndi pamonga na mahina ga mupandu mwevavikayi mandanda vana va Isilaeli pevavili mulugendu kuhamba kumulima wevahaidiwi, na chila mulima wenuwo cheugaviwa mumakabila goha pevivya vayingili mulima wenuwo. 26 mbaka 36.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NUM 1" />
  <para style="s">Utumbulanu wa mvalangu wa vandu va Isilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 1:1" />Pamwaka wa pili mumwehi wa pili ligono la kutumbula, vana va Isilaeli pevahumili ku Misili, Bambu Chapanga alongili na Musa mugati ya Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga kulugangatu ku Sinai, amjovili genaga. <verse eid="NUM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 1:2" />“Mvalanga vandu voha va Isilaeli, kulanda lukolo zavi na vandu va munyumba vavi kwa mvalangu wa mahina ga kila mgosi mmonga mmonga. <verse eid="NUM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 1:3" />Veve na Aloni yati mkuvavalanga kwa kulandana na lukolo lwavi vagosi voha va pa Isilaeli vevavi na miyaka ishilini na kuyendelela vevihotola kutovana ngondo. <verse eid="NUM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 1:4" />Kangi mgosi mmonga kuhuma mukila likabila, mweavi chilongosi wa vandu vaki yati akuvatangatila kuvavalanga vandu. <verse eid="NUM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 1:5" />Genaga ndi mahina ga vandu vevakukutangatila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 1:5">Kuhuma mu likabila la Leubeni ndi avili Elisuli, mwana waki Shedeuli, <verse eid="NUM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 1:6" />Kuhuma mu likabila la Simeoni, avili Shelumieli mwana wa Suli Shadai, <verse eid="NUM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 1:7" />Kuhuma mu likabila la Yuda, ndi avili Nashoni mwana wa Aminadabu, <verse eid="NUM 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 1:8" />Kuhuma mu likabila la Isakali, ndi avili Netaneli mwana wa Suali, <verse eid="NUM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 1:9" />Kuhuma mu likabila la Zebuluni, ndi avili Eliabu mwana wa Heloni. <verse eid="NUM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 1:10" />Kuhuma mu vana va Yosefu, kuhuma mulikabila la Efulaimu ndi avili Elishama wana wa Amihudi, va Manase ndi avili mwana waki Pedasuli; <verse eid="NUM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 1:11" />Kuhuma mu likabila la Benyamini, ndi avili Abidani mwana wa Gideoni, <verse eid="NUM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 1:12" />Kuhuma mu likabila la Dani, ndi avili Ahiezeli mwana wa Amishadai, <verse eid="NUM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 1:13" />Kuhuma mu likabila la Asheli, ndi avili Pegieli mwana wa Okilani, <verse eid="NUM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 1:14" />Kuhuma mu likabila la Gadi, ndi avili Eliasafu mwana wa Deueli, <verse eid="NUM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 1:15" />Kuhuma mu likabila la Nafutali, ndi avili Ahila mwana wa Enani.” <verse eid="NUM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 1:16" />Venava ndi vilongosi vevahaguliwi mu vandu voha va Isilaeli, ngati vavilongosi vakulu va makabila gavi na vilongosi va lukolo za Isilaeli.<verse eid="NUM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 1:17" />Hinu Musa na Aloni vakavatola vala vandu vagosi vevaluwuliwi mahina gavi, <verse eid="NUM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 1:18" />mu ligono lilolo la kutumbula la mwehi wa pili vakavakemela vandu voha vevavalangiwi kila mmonga kuwanangana na vandu va munyumba yaki na lukolo lwaki. Kangi vandu voha vevavi na ntanga ya miyaka ishilini amala neju vayandikiswi mahina gavi, <verse eid="NUM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 1:19" />ngati Bambu Chapanga cheamlagazi Musa. Ndi Musa avavalingi vandu venava kula kulugangatu lwa Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 1:20" />Kuhumu muuveleku wa Leubeni mwana wa kutumbula wa Yakobo, vandu voha vevavili na ntanga ya miyaka ishilini amala neju vevavili njwee kuhamba kungondo vevavalangiwi mahina gavi mmonga mmonga kuwanangana na lukolo zavi na vandu va munyumba zavi. <verse eid="NUM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 1:21" />Vevavalangiwi ndi vavi vandu elufu alobaini na sita na miya muhanu.<verse eid="NUM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 1:22" />Kuhuma mu likabila la Simeoni kulandana na viveleku vyavi, vagosi voha vevavili na ntanga ya miyaka ishilini amala neju vevahotwili kuhengela ku ngondo vavalangiwi na kuyandikwa kwa mahina, mmonga mmonga, kulandana na lukolo lwavi na vandu vavi.<verse eid="NUM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 1:23" />Vevavalangiwi kuhuma mulikabila la Simioni vavii vandu elufu hamusini na tisa na miya zidatu.<verse eid="NUM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 1:24" />Kuhuma mu likabila la Gadi, Vagosi voha vevavili na ntanga ya miyaka ishilini amala neju vevahotwili kuhengela ku ngondo vayandikwi kwa mahina, mmonga mmonga, kulandana na lukolo lwavi na vandu vavi.<verse eid="NUM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 1:25" />Vandu vevavalangiwi vavi vandu elufu alubaini na muhanu miya sita na hamusini. <verse eid="NUM 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 1:26" />Vevalandili ndi va likabila la Yuda, Vagosi voha vevavili na ntanga ya miyaka ishilini amala neju vevahotwili kuhengela ku ngondo vavalangiwi na kuyandikwa kwa mahina, kulandana na lukolo lwavi na vandu vavi.<verse eid="NUM 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 1:27" />Vevavalangiwi ndi vavi vandu elufu sabini na mcheche na miya sita.<verse eid="NUM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 1:28" />Vakalanda va likabila la Isakali, vagosi voha vevavili na ntanga ya miyaka ishilini amala neju vevahotwili kuhengela ku ngondo vavalangiwi na kuyandikwa kwa mahina, kulandana na lukolo lwavi na vandu vavi.<verse eid="NUM 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 1:29" />Vevavalangiwi vavi vandu elufu amsini na mcheche na miya mcheche. <verse eid="NUM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 1:30" />Kuhuma mu likaabila la Yosefu, vagosi voha vevavili na ntanga ya miyaka ishilini amala neju vevahotwili kuhengela ku ngondo vavalangiwi na kuyandikwa kwa mahina, kulandana na lukolo lwavi na vandu vavi.<verse eid="NUM 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 1:31" />Vevavalangiwi vavi vandu elufu hamusini na saba na miya mcheche. <verse eid="NUM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 1:32" />Kuhuma mu lukolo lwa Yosefu, mweavili mwana wa Eflaimu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 1:32">Vagosi voha vevavili na ntanga ya miyaka ishilini amala neju vevahotwili kuhengela ku ngondo vavalangiwi na kuyandikwa kwa mahina, kulandana na lukolo lwavi na vandu vavi.<verse eid="NUM 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 1:33" />Vevavalangiwi vavi vandu elufu alubaini na miya muhanu. <verse eid="NUM 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 1:34" />Vakalanda va likabila la Manase mweavili mwana wa Yusufu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 1:34">Vagosi voha vevavili na ntanga ya miyaka ishilini amala neju vevahotwili kuhengela ku ngondo vavalangiwi na kuyandikwa kwa mahina, kulandana na lukolo lwavi na vandu vavi.<verse eid="NUM 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 1:35" />Vevavalangiwi vavi vandu elufu selasini na hivili na miya hivili. <verse eid="NUM 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 1:36" />Kuhuma mu likabila la Benyamini, vagosi voha vevavili na ntanga ya miyaka ishilini amala neju vevahotwili kuhengela ku ngondo vavalangiwi na kuyandikwa kwa mahina, kulandana na lukolo lwavi na vandu vavi.<verse eid="NUM 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 1:37" />Vavi vandu elufu selasini na muhanu na miya mcheche. <verse eid="NUM 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 1:38" />Vakalanda va likabila la Dani, Vagosi voha vevavili na ntanga ya miyaka ishilini amala neju vevahotwili kuhengela ku ngondo vavalangiwi na kuyandikwa kwa mahina, kulandana na lukolo lwavi na vandu vavi.<verse eid="NUM 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 1:39" />Vevavalangiwi vavi vandu elufu sitini na hivili na miya saba. <verse eid="NUM 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 1:40" />Kuhuma mu likabila la Asheli, Vagosi voha vevavili na ntanga ya miyaka ishilini amala neju vevahotwili kuhengela ku ngondo vavalangiwi na kuyandikwa kwa mahina, kulandana na lukolo lwavi na vandu vavi.<verse eid="NUM 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 1:41" />Vevavalangiwi vavi vandu elufu alubaini na yimonga na miya mcheche. <verse eid="NUM 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 1:42" />Vakalanda va likabila la Nafutali, Vagosi voha vevavili na ntanga ya miyaka ishilini amala neju vevahotwili kuhengela ku ngondo vavalangiwi na kuyandikwa kwa mahina, kulandana na lukolo lwavi na vandu vavi.<verse eid="NUM 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 1:43" />Vevavalangiwi vavi vandu elufu hamusini na datu na miya mcheche. <verse eid="NUM 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 1:44" />Venava ndi vandu vevavalangiwi na Musa na Aloni kuni vitangatiliwa na vachilongosi kumi na vavili vala va Isilaeli, kila chilongosi avii pandu pa vandu va ukolo lwaki. <verse eid="NUM 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 1:45" />Hinu vagosi voha va Isilaeli vevavi na ntanga kutumbula miyaka ishilini amala neju, vevahotwili kuyingila na kuvya manjolinjoli pamulima wa Isilaeli, <verse eid="NUM 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 1:46" />jumula ya mvalangu wavi yavili vandu laki sita na elufu zidatu na miya muhanu na hamusini.<verse eid="NUM 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 1:47" />Nambu Valawi vavalangiwi lepi pamonga na vala vandu va makabila gangi, <verse eid="NUM 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 1:48" />Ndava Chapanga amjovili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 1:49" />“Ukoto kuvavalanga vandu va likabila la Lawi pamonga na vandu va likabila la Vaisilaeli vangi. <verse eid="NUM 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 1:50" />Pahali paki yati akuvahagula vavya vayangalila va Lindanda la Msopi, na vyombo vyaki vyoha na kila chindu chechivi mugati yaki, yati vigega Lindanda pamonga na vyombo vyaki vyoha. Yati vihengela mugati mula na kulitindila. <verse eid="NUM 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 1:51" />Kangi lukumbi lwa kuliwusa Lindanda ndava ya kuyendelela na lugendu Valawi ndi vevakuliwusa, mewa lukumbi lwa kutendekeha kavili pandu peviganikiwa kutama Valawi ndi vevihenga lihengu lenilo, mundu yungi yoyoha mweihegelela papipi na Lindanda lenilo yati ikomiwa. <verse eid="NUM 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 1:52" />Vaisilaeli vangi yati vivika kambi zavi chikundichikundi, kila mundu ivya pa kambi yaki pahi ya bendela yaki. <verse eid="NUM 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 1:53" />Nambu Valawi yati vivika kambi zavi kulitindila Lindanda la Musopi, kuni vakulikita ulonda muni mundu yeyoha akoto kulihegelela na kukita ligoga langu likayaka kwa va Isilaeli, kangi Valawi ndu ndi vevakuliyangalila na kukita mahengu goha ga mu Lindanda lenilo.” <verse eid="NUM 1:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 1:54" />Ndava yeniyo Vaisilaeli vahengili ngati Bambu Chapanga cheamlagazili Musa.<verse eid="NUM 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NUM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kupangilila mandanda ga Vaisilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 2:1" />Bambu Chapanga avapelili Musa na Aloni malagizu aga, <verse eid="NUM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 2:2" />“Vaisilaeli yati vivika kambi zavi, kila mmonga itama pepavi na Bendela yaki, pepavi na ulangisu wa vandu va munyumba yaki. Yati vitama penapo kulitindila Lindanda la Musopi.”<verse eid="NUM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 2:3" />Vala vevivika kambi upandi kwe lihumila lilanga kulola kwelihumila lilanga yati vivya va chikundi cha vandu vevavi pahi ya bendela ya Yuda na chilongosi wavi yati ivya Nashoni mwana wa Aminadabu, <verse eid="NUM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 2:4" />Likundi laki lina vandu vevavalangiwi vagosi elufu sabini na mcheche na miya sita. <verse eid="NUM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 2:5" />Vala vevigelekela kujenga kambi ndi vandu va likabila la Yuda yati vivya va likabila la Isakali, chilongosi wavi yati ivya Netaneli mwana wa Suali, <verse eid="NUM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 2:6" />Likundi laki yati livya na vandu vevavalangiwi vagosi elufu hamusini na mcheche na miya mcheche. <verse eid="NUM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 2:7" />Yati ligelekela likabila la Zebuluni, chilongosi wavi yati ivya Eliabu mwana wa Heloni, <verse eid="NUM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 2:8" />Likundi laki yati livya na vandu vevavalangiwi vagosi elufu hamusini na saba na miya mcheche. <verse eid="NUM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 2:9" />Jumula ya vandu voha vevivya pakambi ya Yuda kuwanangana na misambi yavi ndi vandu laki yimonga na elufu semanini na sita na miya mcheche. Venavo ndi vevilongolela mulugendu.<verse eid="NUM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 2:10" />Upandi wa kusini, vala vevavi pahi ya bendela ya chikundi cha Leubeni kuwanangana na misambi yavi, chilongosi wavi avi Elisuli mwana wa Shedeuli, <verse eid="NUM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 2:11" />likundi laki lavili na vandu vevavalangiwi vagosi elufu alobaini na sita na miya mhanu. <verse eid="NUM 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 2:12" />Kangi vala vevibwela kutama pamuhana na kambi ya vandu va Lubeni vene ndi vandu va likabila la Simeoni, chilongosi wavi yati ivya Shelumieli mwana wa Suli Shadai, <verse eid="NUM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 2:13" />likundi laki lavii na vandu vevavalangiwi vagosi elufu amusini na tisa na miya zidatu. <verse eid="NUM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 2:14" />Likabila la Gadi yati ligelekela. Chilongosi wa vandu va Gadi ndi Eliasafu mwana wa Deueli. <verse eid="NUM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 2:15" />Likundi laki lavili na vandu vevavalangiwi vagosi elufu alobaini na mhanu na miya sita na hamusini. <verse eid="NUM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 2:16" />Vagosi veviva pa Lindanda la Leubeni kuwanangana na hikundi yavi ndi vandu laki yimonga na hamusini na yimonga na miya mcheche na hamusini. Venava ndi vevagelakili mulugendu lwa pili.<verse eid="NUM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 2:17" />Kangi kambi ya Valawi na pa Lindanda la Musopi, lavi pagati ya kambi zoha, na kuni vagegili Lindanda lenilo la kukonganekela, yati viwuka, kila chikundi yati chigenda kulanda fwasi yaki pahi ya bendela yavi.<verse eid="NUM 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 2:18" />Kwa upandi welitipama lilanga, vala vevavi pahi ya bendela ya likundi la Efulaimu yati vitama kuwanangana na hikundi yavi, chilongosi wavi yati ivya Elishama mwana wa Amihudi, <verse eid="NUM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 2:19" />likundi lavi lavii na vandu vevavalangiwi vagosi elufu alubaini na miya muhanu. <verse eid="NUM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 2:20" />Likabila la Manase yati ligelekelea mumbele ya Efulaimu. Chilongosi wa vandu va Manase ndi Gamalieli mwana wa Pedasuli. <verse eid="NUM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 2:21" />Likundi laki lavii na vandu vevavalangiwi vagosi elufu selasini na zivili na miya zivili. <verse eid="NUM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 2:22" />likabila la Benyamini yati ligelekela mumbele ya Manase. Chilongosi wa vandu va Benyamini ndi Abidani mwana wa Gideoni, <verse eid="NUM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 2:23" />Likundi laki lavii na vandu vevavalangiwi vagosi elufu selasini na mhanu na miya mcheche. <verse eid="NUM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 2:24" />Jumula ya vandu vevivya pa kambi ya Efulaimu kuwanangana na hikundi yavi ndi vandu laki yimonga na elufu nane na miya yimonga. Likundi lenilo la Efulaimu yati livvya likundi la datu mukugenda.<verse eid="NUM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 2:25" />Kwa upandi wa kaskazini, yati kuvya ma misambi ya kambi ya Dani, chilongosi wavi yati ivya Ahiezeli, mwana wa Amishadai, <verse eid="NUM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 2:26" />Likundi laki lavii na vevavalangiwi vagosi elufu sitini na zivili na miya saba. <verse eid="NUM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 2:27" />Kangi vala vevigelekelela pahali pavi ndi vandu va likabila la Asheli, chilongosi wavi ndi Pagieli mwana wa Okilani. <verse eid="NUM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 2:28" />Likundi laki lavii na vevavalangiwi vagosi elufu alobaini na yimonga na miya mhanu. <verse eid="NUM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 2:29" />Likabila la Nafutali yati ligelekela. Chilongosi wa vandu va Nafutali ndi Ahila mwana wa Enani, <verse eid="NUM 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 2:30" />Likundi laki lavii na vevavalangiwi vagosi elufu hamusini na zidatu na miya mcheche. <verse eid="NUM 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 2:31" />Jumula ya vandu vevivya pa kambi ya Dani kuwanangana na hikundi yavi ndi vandu laki yimonga na elufu hamusini na saba na miya sita. Chikundi chenichi cha Dani yati chivya mulugendu lwa mwisho mulugendu.<verse eid="NUM 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 2:32" />Venavo ndi Vaisilaeli vevavalangiwi kuwanangana na vandu va mnyumba zavi, pakambi na hikundi hyavi, voha vavi vandu laki sita na elufu zidatu na miya mhanu na hamusini. <verse eid="NUM 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 2:33" />Nambu Valawi vavalangiwi lepi pamonga na Vaisilaeli vayavi ngati Bambu Chapanga cheamlagizili Musa.<verse eid="NUM 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 2:34" />Chenichi ndi Vaisilaeli chevakitili kila chindu ngati Bambu Chapanga cheamlagazili Musa. Vavikili kambi zavi kulandana na bendela zavi na vawukili kila mmonga kulongosana na lukolo lwaki na vandu vaki.<verse eid="NUM 2:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NUM 3" />
  <para style="s">Vana va Aloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 3:1" />Chenichi ndi chiveleku cha Aloni na Musa lukumbi Bambu Chapanga pealongili na Musa ku chidunnda Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 3:2" />Maina ga vana va Aloni gavi, Nadabu mtumbulanu na Abihu na Eleazali pamonga na Ithamali. <verse eid="NUM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 3:3" />Genaga ndi gavii mahina ga vana va Aloni, vevahaguliwi kwa kunyalwa mahuta vavya vamteta va Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 3:4" />Nambu Nadabu na Abihu vafwili palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga, lukumbi pevampelili teta kwa motu wewangayidakiliwa palongolo ya Chapanga kulugangatu la ku Sinai. Vene vavavi lepi na vana ndava yeniyo Eleazali na Ithamali vahengalili ngati vamteta va Chapanga lukumbi lwa wumi wa Aloni dadi wavi.<verse eid="NUM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Valawi vihaguliwa kuvahengela vamteta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 3:5" />Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 3:6" />“Valeta vandu va likabila la Lawi kwa mteta Aloni, muni vamuhengela. <verse eid="NUM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 3:7" />Yati vihenga lihengu ndava yaki na ya vandu voha pa Lindanda la kukonganekela lukumbi pevihenga pa Lindanda la kukonganekela, <verse eid="NUM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 3:8" />yati vakuvayangalila na kuvika bwina hyombo vyoha vya Lindanda la Musopi na kuvatangatila Vaisilaeli pevihenga mahengu gavi pa Lindanda la kukonganekela. <verse eid="NUM 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 3:9" />Uvagotola Valawi voha kwa Aloni na vana vaki, venavo ndi Vaisilaeli vevakumuhengela Aloni na vana vaki. <verse eid="NUM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 3:10" />Uvavika Aloni na vana vaki vavya na lihengu la unteta, nambu mundu yungi yoyoha mwaihegelela pandu papevaguliwi ndava ya nene yati ikomiwa.”<verse eid="NUM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 3:11" />Bambu Chapanga ayendalili kumjovela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 3:12" />“Nivahagwili Valawi kuhuma kwa Vaisilaeli, pahali pa kila mvelekwa wa kutumbula wa chigosi pagati ya kila vandu va munyumba. Valawi ndi vangu, <verse eid="NUM 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 3:13" />ndava muni vavelikwa voha va kutumbula ndi vangu. Penavakomili vavelekwa va kutumbula voha ku Misili kula, namvagwili kila mvelekwa wa kutumbula pagati ya Isilaeli avya wangu, avya mundu amala hinyama. Yati vivya vangu. Nene ndi Bambu Chapanga.”<verse eid="NUM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvalangiwa kwa Valawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 3:14" />Mwanakandahi Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa ku lugangatu lwa Sinai, <verse eid="NUM 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 3:15" />“Vavalanga vana va Lawi voha kulandana na lukolo zavi na vandu va munyumba zavi, kila mgosi kutumbula vevana ntanga ya mwehi umonga na neju.” <verse eid="NUM 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 3:16" />Ndava yeniyo Musa avavalingi, ngati chealagaziwi na Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 3:17" />Genaga ndi gavii maina ga vana va Lawi. Gelishoni na Kohati pamonga na Melali. <verse eid="NUM 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 3:18" />Na aga ndi mahina ga vana va Gelishoni kwa kulanda lukolo lwavi, Libini pamonga na Shimei. <verse eid="NUM 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 3:19" />Vana va Kohati kwa kulanda lukolo lwavi, Amlamu na Ishali na Hebuloni pamonga na Uzieli. <verse eid="NUM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 3:20" />Vana va Melali kwa kulanda lukolo lwavi ndi, Mahli na Mushi. Venava ndi vavi lukolo lwa Valawi kulandana na vandu va munyumba zavi.<verse eid="NUM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 3:21" />Kwavili na lukolo za Walibini na Washimei zezahumili kwa Gelishoni, venava ndi lukolo lwa Vagelishoni. <verse eid="NUM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 3:22" />Vagosi voha vevavalangiwi vevavi na ntanga ya mwehi umonga amala neju ndi elufu saba na miya muhanu. <verse eid="NUM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 3:23" />Lukolo lwa Vagelishoni, yavaganili kutama upandi welitipama lilanga, mumbele ya Lindanda la kukonganekela <verse eid="NUM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 3:24" />Chilongosi wa vandu va likabila la Vagelishoni avi Eliasafu mwana wa Laeli. <verse eid="NUM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 3:25" />Lihengu la vana va Gelishoni lavili kuyangalila Lindanda la kukonganekela na vigubiku vyaki, lipazia la mlyangu wa kuyingilila mu Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga, <verse eid="NUM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 3:26" />mapazia ga ua weuvii pagati ya Lindanda la kukonganekela na pandu pa kuwusila teta, na lipazia la mlyangu wa ua, na nyosi zaki. Kila chindu chahengiki kwa lihengu laki.<verse eid="NUM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 3:27" />Vaamlami na Vaishali na Vahebuloni pamonga na Vauzieli zenizo ndi lukolo zezahumili kwa Kohati, venava ndi valukolo va Vakohati. <verse eid="NUM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 3:28" />Mvalangu wa vagosi voha vevavii na mwehi umonga amala neju yavili vandu elufu nane na miya sita. Lihengu la Wakohati lavi kuyangalila pandu pa Msopi. <verse eid="NUM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 3:29" />Lukolo za Kohati zaganikiwi kutama upandi wa kusini wa Lindanda la kukonganekela, <verse eid="NUM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 3:30" />Chilongosi wa lukolo lwa Vakohati avili Elisafani mwana wa Uzieli. <verse eid="NUM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 3:31" />Lihengu lavi ndi lavili kuliyunga lisanduku la lilaganu na meza ya kuvikila mabumunda na chindu cha hahi na pandu pa kuwusila teta na vyombo vyevihengela Vamteta va Chapanga pandu pa Msopi pamonga na lipazia na mahengu goha gegivali vindu vyenivi zavili zavi.<verse eid="NUM 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 3:32" />Chilongosi mkulu wa Valawi avii Eleazali mwana wa, Aloni mweavi mteta wa Chapanga. Avikiwi kuvayimilila vala vevaganikiwi kuyangalila Lindanda la Musopi. <verse eid="NUM 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 3:33" />Lukolo lwa Vamaili na Vamushi zezahumili kwa Melali. <verse eid="NUM 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 3:34" />Lwenulu ndi lukolo lwa Melali. Jumula ya mvalangu wa vagosi voha kutumbula vevavi na ntanga ya mwehi umonga amala neju yavili vandu elufu sita na miya zivili. <verse eid="NUM 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 3:35" />Mkulu wa lukolo za Melali avi Sulieli mwana wa Abihaili, venava vaganikwi kutama upandi wa kasikazini wa Lindanda la kukonganekela. <verse eid="NUM 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 3:36" />Vamelali vavikiwi kuyangalila fulemu za Lindanda lamusopi na mbagalu zaki na lipanda na vitamilu na vindu vyaki vyoha na kila chindu chechivala mahengu gaki. <verse eid="NUM 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 3:37" />Mewa vaganikiwi kuyangalila mapanda ga ua gegitindila na vitamilu vyaki na vikongwani na nyosi.<verse eid="NUM 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 3:38" />Musa na Aloni na vana vavi vaganikiwi kuvika Lindanda palongolo ya Lindanda la kukonganekela upandi wa kwelihumila lilalanga kulola kwelihumila lilanga. Mahengu gavi gavili kuyimamila mahengu goha gegihengeka pa Lindanda la Musopi ndava ya Vaisilaeli voha. Mundu yungi yoyoha mwealingili kuhenga lihengu la vamteta mweangavya Mlawi aganikiwi kukomiwa. <verse eid="NUM 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 3:39" />Valawi voha vevavalangiwi na Musa pamonga na Aloni kwa amuli ya Bambu Chapanga, kulandana na lukolo zavi, pamonga na kila mgosi mweavi na mwehi umonga amala neju vavi vandu elufu ishilini na zivili.<verse eid="NUM 3:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Valawi vipewa pahala pa uchiveleku wa kutumbula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 3:40" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa, “Uvavalanga vachiveleku vatumbulanu vachigosi voha va Isilaeli kutumbula vevavi na ntanga ya mwehi umonga na neju. <verse eid="NUM 3:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 3:41" />Na veve yati ukuvabagula Valawi ndava yangu nene Bambu Chapanga, mewa yati ubagula mifuya yoha ya Valawi ndava ya nene pahala pa viveleku vya kutumbula ya vandu va Isilaeli. Nene ndi Bambu Chapanga.” <verse eid="NUM 3:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 3:42" />Musa akayidakila ndi avavalingi vachiveleku va kutumbula voha va vandu va Isilaeli ngati Bambu Chapanga cheamlagizi. <verse eid="NUM 3:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 3:43" />Vavelekwa voha vatumbulanu vagosi vevavalangiwi vevavi na ntanga ya mwehi umonga amala neju, vevayandikiswi kwa mahina gavi ndi elufu ishilini na vavili na miya zivili na sabini na datu.<verse eid="NUM 3:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 3:44" />Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 3:45" />“Hinu, uakita vavya va nene pahala pa vachiveleku va kutumbula va Vaisilaeli. Mewawa, ubagula ng'ombi za Valawi voha pahala pa viveleku vya kutumbula vya ng'ombi za Vaisilaeli. Valawi ndi vangu, Nene ndi Bambu. <verse eid="NUM 3:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 3:46" />Ndava ya kuvasangula vachiveleku va kutumbula vagosi va vandu va Isilaeli miya zivili na sabini na datu, veviyonjokeseka mvalangu wa Valawi vagosi, <verse eid="NUM 3:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 3:47" />yati wipokela kwa kila mgosi mashonga vipandi mhanu ya madini ga feza, kuwanangana na chipimu cha Lindanda la Musopi. <verse eid="NUM 3:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 3:48" />Mpela Aloni na vana vaki mashonga genago ndava ya usangula wa mvalangu wa Vaisilaeli vevayonjokisiki.” <verse eid="NUM 3:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 3:49" />Ndava yeniyo Musa akatola mashonga ga ugombozi kuhuma kwa vala vevayonjokisiki, kwa vala vevagomboliwi na Valawi. <verse eid="NUM 3:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 3:50" />apokili kuhuma kwa vachiveleku va kutumbula va Vaisilaeli vipandi vya madini ga feza elufu yimonga na miya zidatu na sitini na mhanu, kuwanangana na chipimu cha pandu pa Msopi, <verse eid="NUM 3:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 3:51" />Musa akampela Aloni na vana vaki mashonga ago ga ugombozi, ngati chealagizwi na Bambu Chapanga.<verse eid="NUM 3:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NUM 4" />
  <para style="s">Lihengu la Valawi va lukolo lwa Vakohati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 4:1" />Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa na Aloni, <verse eid="NUM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 4:2" />Uvavalanga Vakohati vevavi pandu pa lukolo lwa Valawi, kulandana na vandu va munyumba zavi na lukolo zavi, <verse eid="NUM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 4:3" />yati ukuvayandakisa vagosi voha vevavi na ntanga ya miaka selasini mbaka hamusini vevihotola kuhengela mu Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 4:4" />Lenili ndi lihengu la Vakohati pa Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga, yati viyangalila vindu vyevivi vya Msopi neju.<verse eid="NUM 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 4:5" />Lukumbi lwa kuhamisa likambi, Aloni na vana vaki yati viyingila mu Lindanda, na kuhelesa lipazia lelivi palongolo ya lisanduku la lilaganu, kangi valigubika lisanduku kwa lipazia lenilo. <verse eid="NUM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 4:6" />Panani yaki yati vivika chigubiku cha chikumba nyililili cha chinyama cha munyanja, kangi yati vidandasa chitambala cha langi ya buluu chachivi bwina. Kangi yati viyingisa mikongo ya kugegela lisanduku lenilo.<verse eid="NUM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 4:7" />Panani ya meza ya kuvikila mabumunda gegivikiwa palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga yati vidandasa chitambala cha buluu chene panani yaki yati vivika nkele na vimbani vya ubani, nkeve na ndeve, ndava ya kuwusila luteta lwa mnyweso. Lukumbi lwoha yati kwiva na libumunda panani ya meza. <verse eid="NUM 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 4:8" />Kangi, yati vigubika vindu vyenivi vyoha kwa chitambala chidung'u, na pananai yaki vivika chigubiku cha chikumba nyilili cha chinyama cha munyanja. Ndi yati viyingisa mikamulilu pandu paki.<verse eid="NUM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 4:9" />Yati vitola chitambala cha buluu na kugubika chindu cha kuvikila hahi na hahi zaki, mikasi, lisiniyal aki na vindu vyoha vyevihengeka kuvikila mahuta. <verse eid="NUM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 4:10" />Yati vivika pamonga na vindu vyaki vyoha mugati chikumba nyililili cha chinyama chamunyanja na kuvivika pandu pa kuvitolela.<verse eid="NUM 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 4:11" />“Kangi yati vidandasa chitambala cha buluu panani ya meza ya dhahabu na kuigubika kwa chikumba nyililili cha chinyama cha munyanja panani yaki. Ndi yati viyingisa mikongo ya kugegela pandu paki. <verse eid="NUM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 4:12" />Yati vitola vindu vyoha vyevihengeka pa Lindanda la kukonganekela, yati vikunga kwa chitambala cha buluu na kugubika kwa chikumba nyililili cha chinyama cha munyanja, kangi yati vivika panani ya mikongo ya kugegela. <verse eid="NUM 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 4:13" />Yati viwusa malyenge kuhuma mumeza ya shaba na panani yaki yati vidandasa chitambala cha zambalau. <verse eid="NUM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 4:14" />Panani yaki vivika vindu vyoha vyevihengeka kwa kumuyupila Chapanga papandu pa kuwusila teta, lumbani, hindu vya kuwusila motu na sepetu yeyinaminu na mikamulilu na nkele. Kangi, panani yaki yati vidandasa chigubiku cha chikumba nyililili cha chinyama cha munyanja chechikemiwa Pomboo na kuiyingisa mikongo ya kuligegela pandu paki. <verse eid="NUM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 4:15" />Aloni na vana vaki pevimala kugubika vindu Vya Msopi pamonga na vindu vyaki vyoha, lukumbi ndu vandu pevivya vajitendekihi ndava ya lugendu, vandu va lukolo lwa Kohati yati vibwela na kuvigega. Nambu vene, viyidakiliwa lepi kupamisa njee vindu vyenivyo vya Msopi, vakotoka kufwa. Yeniyo ndi lihengu la lukolo wa Kohati kila lukumbi Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Bambu. <verse eid="NUM 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 4:16" />Eleazali mwana wa Aloni mweavi mteta wa Chapanga yikumgana kuyunga mahuta ga zeituni ndava ya hahi, ubani wa kunungalila, luteta za mabenu za kila ligono, mahuta ga kunyambisa muni kuvika usopi na vindu vyoha vyevibaguliwi ndava ya Bambu mu Lindanda lenilo.”<verse eid="NUM 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 4:17" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa na Aloni, <verse eid="NUM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 4:18" />“Mkotoka kuleka vandu va lukolo lwa Vakohati vakomiwa pagati ya Valawi. <verse eid="NUM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 4:19" />Muni vahotola kulama vakotoka kufwa pevihegelela vindu vya Msopi neju, uvakitila naha, Aloni na vana vaki yati vihamba pandu pa Msopi na kumgavila kila mundu lihengu laki, ndi kyani yati igega. <verse eid="NUM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 4:20" />Nambu vachiveleku va Kohati katu yati viyingila lepi kuvilola vindu vyenivyo vya Msopi neju, vakakita chenicho ndi vifwa.”<verse eid="NUM 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihengu la Valawi va lukolo lwa Gelishoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 4:21" />Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 4:22" />Uvavalanga vandu va lukolo lwa Gelishoni, kulandana vandu va munyumba zavi na lukolo lwavi <verse eid="NUM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 4:23" />Uvavalanga vagosi voha vevavi na ntanga ya pagati ya miyaka selasini mbaka hamusini vevihotola kuhenge lihengu mu Lindanda kukonganekela. <verse eid="NUM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 4:24" />Lihengu lavi yati livya ili, Yati vigega mapazia ga Lindanda la kukonganekela pamonga na <verse eid="NUM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 4:25" />chigubiku chaki, chigubiku cha chikumba nyilili cha chinyama chechitama munyanja chechikemiwa Pomboo, lipazia la limlyangu, <verse eid="NUM 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 4:26" />mapazia ga luvanja lwelutindila pandu pa kuwusila teta na Lindanda la Msopi, mapazia ga limlyangu la kuyingilila na nyosi na pamonga na vindu vyoha vyevihengeka kulijenga Lindanda lenilo. Vene yati vikita mambu goha gegivala vindu ivi. <verse eid="NUM 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 4:27" />Aloni na vana vaki vamteta va Chapanga ndi vevilagiza mahengu goha ga Vagelishoni kuvala vindu vyevigega na mahengu gevihenga. Yati ukuvapangila vindu vyoha vila vyeviganikiwa kugega. <verse eid="NUM 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 4:28" />Lenili ndi lihengu la lukolo lwa Gelishoni pa Lindanda la kukonganekela, yati vikita lihengu kwa ulongosi wa Isamali mwana wa Aloni mweavi mteta wa Chapanga.<verse eid="NUM 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihengu la Valawi va lukolo lwa Melali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 4:29" />Kangi, Bambu Chapanga akamujovela Musa“Mewawa, yati uvavalanga Vamelali, kulandana na vandu va munyumba zavi na ukolo lwavi. <verse eid="NUM 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 4:30" />Yati ukuvavalanga vagosi voha vevavi na ntanga ya miyaka selasini mbaka hamusini, veviganikiwa kuhengela mu pa Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 4:31" />Vene, yati vivya na lihengu la kugega felemu, mbagalu na mapanda na vitamilu vya Lindanda la kukonganekela. <verse eid="NUM 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 4:32" />Mapanda ga luvanja weutindila pandi zoha za Lindanda na vitamilu vyaki na vikongwani vya Lindanda na nyosi pamonga na vindu vyaki vyoha na kila chindu chechivala mahengu gaki. Kila mundu mjovela vindu vila vyeiganikiwa kugega. <verse eid="NUM 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 4:33" />Yeniyi ndi yati yivya lihengu la lukolo lwa Melali mulihengu lavi loha ku Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga, kwa ulongosi wa Isamari mwana wa mteta wa Chapanga Aloni.”<verse eid="NUM 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Valawi vivalangiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 4:34" />Hinu, Musa na Aloni na vilongosi va vandu voha vakavavalanga vandu va lukolo lwa Kohati, kulandana na lukolo zavi na vandu va munyumba zavi, <verse eid="NUM 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 4:35" />vakavayandikisa vandu voha vevavi na ntanga ya miyaka selasini mbaka hamusini, kila mweaganikiwi kuhengela mu Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Bambu. <verse eid="NUM 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 4:36" />Mvalangu wavi kulandana na lukolo lwavi yavili vandu elufu zivili na miya saba hamusini. <verse eid="NUM 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 4:37" />Venava ndi vandu va lukolo lwa Kohati, vevahengili pa Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga, vevavalangiwi na Musa na Aloni ngati Bambu Chapanga cheamlagizi Musa. <verse eid="NUM 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 4:38" />Mvalangu wa vandu va lukolo lwa Gelishoni kulandana na lukolo zavi na vandu va munyumba zavi, <verse eid="NUM 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 4:39" />vevavi na ntanga ya miaka selasini mbaka hamusini, vevaganikiwi kuhenga pa Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Bambu, <verse eid="NUM 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 4:40" />vevavalangiwi vavi vandu elufu zivili miya sita na selasini. <verse eid="NUM 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 4:41" />Chenichi ndi cheyavili mvalangu wa vandu va lukolo lwa Gelishoni voha vevahengili ku Lindanda la mngonganu, vala Musa na Aloni vavalangi ngati Bambu Chapanga cheavalagizi. <verse eid="NUM 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 4:42" />vandu voha vevavalangiwi va lukolo lwa Melali kulandana na lukolo zavi na vandu va nyumba zavi <verse eid="NUM 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 4:43" />vevavi na ntanga ya miyaka selasini mbaka hamusini, vevaganikiwi kuhenga pa Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Bambu, <verse eid="NUM 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 4:44" />yavili vandu elufu zidatu na miya zivili. <verse eid="NUM 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 4:45" />Wenuwu ndi mvalangu wa vandu va lukolo lwa Melali vevavalangiwi na Musa na Aloni ngati Bambu Chapanga cheamlagizi Musa. <verse eid="NUM 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 4:46" />Ndi, Valawi voha vayandikiswi na Musa na Aloni na vachilongosi va vandu va munyumba zavi, kwa kulanda na lukolo zavi na vandu va munyumba zavi, <verse eid="NUM 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 4:47" />vagosi voha vevavii na ntanga ya miyaka selasini mbaka hamusini, vevabwelili kuhenga lihengu mu Lindanda la kukonganekela na kuligega Lindanda lenilo, <verse eid="NUM 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 4:48" />vandu voha vevavalangiwi vavi vandu elufu nane miya mhanu na semanini.<verse eid="NUM 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 4:49" />Kila mmonga apewili lihengu lakukita na ajoviwi chindu cha kugega, chenicho ndi chevavalangiwi ngati Bambu Chapanga cheamlagazili Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NUM 5" />
  <para style="s">Ubwina pakambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 5:1" />Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 5:2" />“Valagiza Vaisilaeli vamuwusa kuvala ya kambi kila mundu mweavi na utamu wa higa weuyambukisa na kila mundu mweiwusa mahila, na kila mwangayidakiwa na kumfugamila Chapanga ndava ya kupamisa mtuhi wamundu. <verse eid="NUM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 5:3" />Yati mukuvawusa kuvala ya kambi vandu voha, vagosi kwa vadala, muni vakotoka kukita kambi yavi yikoto kuyidakiwa muni nene nitama mwenumo.” <verse eid="NUM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 5:4" />Vaisilaeli vakitili chenicho, vakavavinga kuvala ya kambi. Vakakita ngati Bambu Chapanga cheamjovili Musa.<verse eid="NUM 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulipiswa kwa mundu mwabudili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 5:5" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 5:6" />“Uvajovela Vaisilaeli kuvya, mundu yeyoha mgosi amala mdala akambudila myaki kwa loloha, na akavya angasadikika kwa Bambu Chapanga, mundu mwenuyo ivya anihokili nene. <verse eid="NUM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 5:7" />Mundu mwenuyo yikumgana ayidakila kubuda kwaki kweabudili. Yikumgana alipiswa kulandana na kubuda kwaki, kuni ayongesa yimonga pagati ya muhanu, yati akumpela yeniyo yula mweambudili. <verse eid="NUM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 5:8" />Nambu ngati mundu mwenuyo afwili na angali mlongo wa papipi mweihotola kupokela malipu genago, ndi malipu yati givya ga Bambu Chapanga ndava ya vamteta, malipu genaga ndi pamoga na limbelele ligosi lelikitiwa kuvya utepulanisi ndava ya kubuda kwaki. <verse eid="NUM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 5:9" />Mawusilu goha geviwusa Vaisilaeli kwa Bambu yati chivya cha vamteta. <verse eid="NUM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 5:10" />Chindu chochoha cha mundu chechiwusiwi kwa Bambu na kupelekwa kwa mteta yati chivya cha mteta.”<verse eid="NUM 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhalu kwa vadala vangasadikika kwa vangana vavi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 5:11" />Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 5:12" />uvajovela Vaisilaeli, ngati mdala wa mundu yoyoha akitii gangaganikiwa na msadikika lepi kwa mgosi waki, <verse eid="NUM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 5:13" />akagona na mundu yungi changali mgosi amala mundu yungi kumanya, ajihakisi hati ngati kawaka mundu mweavawene. <verse eid="NUM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 5:14" />Ngati mugosi akavya na wihu kwa mdala waki na ngati akumuholalela gahakahu mdala waki na igana kumanya ngati ahakiswi amala lepi, <verse eid="NUM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 5:15" />mgosi iganikiwa amupeleka mdala waki kwa mteta wa Chapanga na kupeleka luteta lweluganikiwa, ndi pandu pa kumi pa uhembe wa shayili, nambu changali kusopa mahuta amala ubani, ndava muni luteta lwa uhembe lwa mugosi mweakumuholalela gahakahu mdala waki, luteta lweluwusiwa ndava ya kumanyisa kuvya mdala abudili amala lepi.<verse eid="NUM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 5:16" />Mteta wa Chapanga yati akumleta mdala mwenuyo, na kumyimika papipi na pandu pa kuwusila teta. <verse eid="NUM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 5:17" />Kangi, isopa manji ga Msopi muchombo cha ludaka na kutola lububu kuhuma pahi pepakilimwi pa Lindanda la Msopi na kusopa mumanji ago muni kugakita gavya gavavanu. <verse eid="NUM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 5:18" />Peimala mteta wa Chapanga mwenuyo kumyimika mdala papipi ya pandu pa kuwusila teta, yati akugawopola mayunju ga mdala mwenuyo na kumpela luteta lwa ukumbuso mumawoko gaki, luteta ulu lwa mabenu ndava ya wihu, kuni mteta wa Chapanga mwene akamulili manji gala gavavanu gegileta likoto. <verse eid="NUM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 5:19" />Ndi mteta wa Chapanga yati akumlapakisa mdala mwenuyo ijova, “Ngati ugonili lepi na mgosi yungi, na kujihakasa kuni wakona ugegiwi, hinu, yati wipata lepi likoto leliletwa na manji ago gavavanu. <verse eid="NUM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 5:20" />Nambu ngati uhokili kuni ugegiwi, ujihakisi kwa kugona na mgosi yungi mweangavya mgosi waku, <verse eid="NUM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 5:21" />Bambu Chapanga na akubunayi hati uvya likoto na vandu vaku vakupela likoto na kukubela, uvya ngaveleka na lutumbu lwaku lwinyala. <verse eid="NUM 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 5:22" />Manji ago gegileta likoto ndi gayingila mulutumbu lwako na kukukita uvya ngaveleka na lutumbu lwaku lunyalili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 5:22">Na mdala mwene yati iyidakila, ‘Ena, ena.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 5:23" />“Kangi Mteta wa Chapanga yati iyandika likoto lenilo muchitabu chechitenganizwi kwa chikumba na kujihungulisi mumanji gavavanu, <verse eid="NUM 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 5:24" />Mteta wa Chapanga yati akumnywisa mdala yula manji gavavanu gegileta likoto, na manji ago yati gakumyingila na kumkita avya na uvinisu neju mulutumbu. <verse eid="NUM 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 5:25" />kangi mteta wa Chapanga yati itola luteta lula lwa uhembe wa wihu mumawoko ga mdala mwenuyo na kuyiyinula palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga, na kuyipeleka papandu pa kuwusila teta. <verse eid="NUM 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 5:26" />Kangi mteta wa Chapanga yati ihapula luteta lwa uhembe kumema chiwoko kuvya luteta lwa ukumbuso na kuyitinyisa panani ya pandu pa kuwusila teta, peimala genago yati akumjovela mdala yula, anywa manji gala. <verse eid="NUM 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 5:27" />Akamala kunywa, ngati ajihakasi na avi lepi msadikika kwa mngana waki, manji gala gegileta likoto yati gakumletela mvinisu neju, lutumbu lwaki yati lwinyala na kuvya ngaveleka. Na vandu voha yati vimanya kuvya mdala mwenuyo apewi likoto. <verse eid="NUM 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 5:28" />Nambu ngati mdala yula ajihakisi lepi na ahokili lepi, ivya lepi na likoto na ihotola kuveleka vana.”<verse eid="NUM 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 5:29" />“Hinu, wenuwu ndi muhilu kuvala wihu, mdala peihoka na kujihakasa kuni akona agegiwi, peiwuka na kujipela uhakahu. <verse eid="NUM 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 5:30" />amala maholo ga wihu pegakumbwelela mgosi ndava ya kuuholalela mdala waki gahakahu. Mteta wa Bambu Chapanga yati akumkita mdala mwenuyo kuyima palongolo ya Bambu na kuhengela muhilu uwu woha kwa mdala mwenyo. <verse eid="NUM 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 5:31" />Mgosi waki yati ihoka lepi chochoa, nambu mdala yati ihamuliwa ndava ya kuhoka kwaki.”<verse eid="NUM 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NUM 6" />
  <para style="s">Malagizu kuvala nazili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 6:1" />Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 6:2" />“Uvapela Vaisilaeli malagizu ago, ngati mgosi amala mdala avi chilapu maalumu, nazili ya kujiwusa mwene ndava ya Bambu, akajibagula ndava ya Bambu Chapanga, <verse eid="NUM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 6:3" />ndi, akoto kunywa divayi amala ugimbi, akoto kunywa kawoli ya divayi amala mnyweso wungi weuchuchuta, akotoko kunywa manji ga zabibu amala kulya zabibu zezihundili amala zivisi. <verse eid="NUM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 6:4" />Lukumbi lwoha peivya muchilapu akotoka kulya chindu chochoha chechihuma mumzabibu, kuhumila mbeyu hati makava gaki.”<verse eid="NUM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 6:5" />“Magono goha ga nazili yaki ya kujibagula, akotoka kuketa mayunju gaki mbaka lukumbi lwa nazili yaki ya kujibagula yati ivya wa Bambu Chapanga palumalika, yati akugaleka mayunju gaki gavya gatali. <verse eid="NUM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 6:6" />Magono goha gakujinyambisa ndava ya Bambu Chapanga, mundu mwenuyo akotoka kuhegelela mtuhi wa mundu, <verse eid="NUM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 6:7" />hati ngati ya dadi amala mau amala mlongo, amala mlumbu waki vafwili, akoto kujihakasa kwa kuhegelela ndava muni ajibagwili ndava ya Bambu Chapanga kwa nazili. <verse eid="NUM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 6:8" />Magono goha ga nazili zaki mwene yati ivya wa Bambu Chapanga.”<verse eid="NUM 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 6:9" />“Ngati mundu akafwayi chigafula papipi na mwene, na kugakita mayunju gaki gavya gangayidakiliwa na Chapanga, ndi yati iganikiwa aketa ligono la saba la kunyambiswa kwaki. <verse eid="NUM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 6:10" />Kangi ligono la nane yikumgana kuleta majiva gavili amala mawela gavili ga ngunda kwa Mteta wa Chapanga pamlyangu wa Lindanda la Kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 6:11" />Mteta wa Chapanga yati akuliwusa limonga la liwela lenilo kuvya luteta lwa kulekekesa kubuda na lingi kuvya luteta lwa kutinyiswa njwee, na mwene yati akumkitila utepulanisi, ndava muni abudili kwa kuvya papipi na mundu mweafwili. Ligono lilolo, yati akuunyambisa mutu waki ndava ya Bambu, <verse eid="NUM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 6:12" />na kujivika kavili palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga kulandana na magono gala geajivikili pa kutumbula. Magono ago geajivikili pa kutumbula yati givalangiwa lepi ndava mayunju gaki geagavikili ndava ya Bambu gahakiswi. Ndava ya kujiwusa kavili palongolo ya Bambu yati iwusa mwanalimbelele ligosi la mwaka umonga kuvya luteta ndava ya kubuda kwa kulola mundu mweafwili.”<verse eid="NUM 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 6:13" />“Yeniyi ndi nazili ya chilapu lukumbi amali kutimalisa lukumbi lwaki lwa kujinyambisa, yati iletwa pamlyangu wa kuyingilila wa Lindanda kukonganekela ndava ya Bambu, <verse eid="NUM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 6:14" />na kumuwusila Bambu Chapanga vinyama ivi vyangali chilema kuvya luteta, ndi mwanalimbelele ligosi limonga la mwaka umonga ndava ya luteta lwa kutinyiswa na mwanalimbelele lidala limonga la mwaka umonga ndava ya luteta lwa kuwusa kumbudila na limbelele limonga ligosi ndava ya luteta lwa uteke. <verse eid="NUM 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 6:15" />Mewa yati iwusa chidengu chechina mabumunda gangali ngemeku; Maandazi gegatengenizwi kwa uhembe nyililili weuhangisiwi na mahuta, na mabumunda ngalingasi geganyaliwi mahuta pamonga na luteta lwa uhembe na luteta lwa mnyeso.”<verse eid="NUM 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 6:16" />“Mteta yati akumuwusila Chapanga vindu vyoha ivi pamonga na luteta zaki za kumbudila Bambu Chapanga na luteta lwa kutinyiswa. <verse eid="NUM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 6:17" />Yati akumuwusila Bambu Chapanga limbelele lenilo ngati luteta lwa uteke, yati akuliwusa pamonga na lidengu lelina mabumunda gangasopewa ngemeke, luteta lwa uhembe na mnyweso. <verse eid="NUM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 6:18" />Kangi pamlyangu wa kuyingilila pa Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Bambu, yula mweavikii nazili yati iketa mayunju gaki na kugasopa pamoto weuvili pahi ya luteta lwa uteke.”<verse eid="NUM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 6:19" />“Akamala kuketa mayunju gaki mweaviki nazili yula, mteta wa Chapanga yati itola na kumupela livega la limbelele ligosi lelitutumwiswi pamonga na liandazi na libumunda ngalingasi kuhuma muchidengu. Vyoha vyenivyo vitengenizwi changali kusopewa ngemeku. <verse eid="NUM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 6:20" />Kangi mteta wa Chapanga yati akuviyinula vindu vyenivyo ngati luteta lwa kuyinuliwa palongolo ya Bambu, ndi vya Msopi na ndi vindu vya mteta, pamonga na chidali chechiyinuliwi na liwondo lelawusiwi. Pagenago mweaviki nazili ihotola kunywa divayi.”<verse eid="NUM 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 6:21" />“Wenuw ndi wavii muhilu ndava ya mundu mwaviki nazili, mwalapili kuwusa mawusilu kwa Bambu. Ihotola kuwusa mawusilu gegayonjokisi ngati ihotola, nambu iganikiwa kuwusa kila chaalapili kuwusa lukumbi pavikili nazili.”<verse eid="NUM 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mota ya chimteta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 6:22" />Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 6:23" />“Mjovela Aloni na vana vaki kuvya chenichi ndi chemkuvamotisa Vaisilaeli, Muvajovela, <verse eid="NUM 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 6:24" />Bambu Chapanga avamotisa na kuvayangalila;<verse eid="NUM 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 6:25" />Bambu Chapanga avalola kwa wema waki na kuvakitila gegavii gabwina;<verse eid="NUM 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 6:26" />Bambu Chapanga avalangisa lipyana laki na kuvapela uteke.”<verse eid="NUM 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 6:27" />“Ngati Aloni na vana vaki vakaniyupayi nivamotisa Vaisilaeli kwa liina langu, yati nikuvamotisa.”<verse eid="NUM 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NUM 7" />
  <para style="s">Teta va vilongosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 7:1" />Musa peamali kuliyimika Lindanda la kukonganekela, ayitalili mahuta pa Lindanda pamonga na vindu vyaki vyoha muni vivya vya Chapanga. Mewa asopili mahuta papandu pa kuwusila teta pamonga na vindu vyaki vyoha muni vivya vya Bambu. <verse eid="NUM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 7:2" />Vachilongosi va Isilaeli na vakulu va lukolo na vachilongosi va makabila vevavayimalili vandu vevavalangiwi, <verse eid="NUM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 7:3" />vamletili Bambu Chapanga mawusilu gavi, mutuka sita zezigubikwi za kuhutwa na ng'ombi zigosi kumi na zivili, na Mutuka yimonga ya kuhutwa kuhuma kwa kila vilongosi vavili na ng'ombi yigosi yimonga kwa kila chilongosi. Vyenivi vaviletili palongolo ya Lindanda la Msopi, <verse eid="NUM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 7:4" />Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 7:5" />“Pokela mawusilu ago muni gatumiwayi kulihengu lelikitika ndava ya Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga, uvapela Valawi, kila mmonga kwa kulandana na lihengu laki.” <verse eid="NUM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 7:6" />Hinu Musa akatola mutuka za kuhutwa zila pamonga na ng'ombi zigosi, na kuvapela Valawi. <verse eid="NUM 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 7:7" />Avapeli Vagelishoni mutuka zivili za kuhutwa na ng'ombi zigosi mcheche, ngati chevaganili kwa lihengu lavi, <verse eid="NUM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 7:8" />na Vamelali vapewili mutuka mcheche za kuhutwa na ngombi zigosi nane, na mahengu gavi goha gaganikiwi kuhengeka pahi ya uyimilila wa ulongosi wa Isamali mwana wa Aloni mweavi mteta wa Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 7:9" />Nambu Musa avapeli lepi chochoha Vakohati ndava muni vaganikiwi kugega vindu vya Msopi mumavega gavi, muni yavili lihenga lavi.<verse eid="NUM 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 7:10" />Vachilongosi voha kumi na vavili vakaleta luteta palongolo ya pandu pa kuwusila teta ligono lila pelwanyaliwi mahuta, vavikili luteta zavi palongolo ya pandu pa kuwusila teta. <verse eid="NUM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 7:11" />Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa, “Kila ligono chilongosi mmonga yati iwusa luteta ndava ya kulikita livya ndava ya Bambu.”<verse eid="NUM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 7:12" />Hinu, yula mweavikili luteta ligono la kutumbula, avi Nashoni mwana wa Aminadabu, wa likabila la Yuda <verse eid="NUM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 7:13" />Luteta lwaki lwavi, sahani yimonga ya madini ga feza zezinautopa wa kilo yimonga na yapinga na nkeve umonga la madini ga feza lelitopa gilamu miya nane kuwanangana na vipimu vya Lindanda la Msopi, sahani na nkeve zenizo kuni vimemiswi uhembe nyililili weuhangisini na mahuta ga zeituni ndava ya luteta lwa uhembe, <verse eid="NUM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 7:14" />kakalai kamonga ka zahabu kekito gilamu miya yimonga na kumi kuni kamemiswi ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 7:15" />mpapakasi umonga wa ng'ombi yigosi, limbelele limonga ligosi na mpapakasi umonga wa limbelele ugosi wa mwaka umonga, ndava ya teta ya kutinyiswa, <verse eid="NUM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 7:16" />lipongo limonga ndava ya teta ya kulekekesa kumbudila Chapanga, <verse eid="NUM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 7:17" />na ng'ombi higosi hivili, mambelele mhanu gagosi, mapongo muhanu na vanalimbelele muhanu va mwaka umonga ndava ya kuteta ya luteta lwa uteke. Lwenulo ndi lwavili luteta lwa Nashoni mwana wa Aminadabu. <verse eid="NUM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 7:18" />Ligono la pili, Netaneli mwana wa Suali, chilongosi wa likabila la Isakali aletili teta yaki. <verse eid="NUM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 7:19" />Netaneli awusili, sahani yimonga ya madini ga feza zezinautopa wa kilo yimonga na yapinga na nkeve umonga la madini ga feza lelitopa gilamu miya nane kuwanangana na vipimu vya Lindanda la Msopi, sahani na nkeve lenilo kuni vimemiswi uhembe nyililili weuhangisini na mahuta ndava ya luteta lwa mabenu, <verse eid="NUM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 7:20" />kakalai limonga la zahabu chechitopa gilamu miya yimonga na kumi kuni chimemiswi ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 7:21" />mpapakasi umonga wa ng'ombi yigosi, limbelele limonga ligosi na mpapakasi umonga wa limbelele ugosi wa mwaka umonga, ndava ya teta ya kutinyiswa, <verse eid="NUM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 7:22" />lipongo limonga ndava ya teta ya kulekekesa kumbudila Chapanga, <verse eid="NUM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 7:23" />na ng'ombi higosi hivili, mambelele mhanu gagosi, mapongo muhanu na vanalimbelele vagosi muhanu va mwaka umonga ndava ya kuteta ya luteta lwa uteke. Lwenulo ndi lwavili luteta lwa Netanyeli mwana wa Suali. <verse eid="NUM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 7:24" />Ligono la datu likavya zamu ya Eliabu mwana wa Heloni, chilongosi wa likabila la Zebuluni. <verse eid="NUM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 7:25" />Luteta lwaki lwavi lwavii, sahani yimonga ya madini ga feza zezinautopa wa kilo yimonga na yapinga na nkeve umonga la madini ga feza lelitopa gilamu miya nane kuwanangana na vipimu vya Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava Chapanga, sahani na nkeve zenizo kuni vimemiswi uhembe nyililili weuhangisini na mahuta ndava ya luteta lwa uhembe, <verse eid="NUM 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 7:26" />kakalai kamonga ka zahabu kekitopa gilamu miya yimonga na kumi kuni chimemiswi ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 7:27" />mpapakasi umonga wa ng'ombi yigosi, limbelele limonga ligosi na mpapakasi umonga wa limbelele ugosi wa mwaka umonga, ndava ya teta ya kutinyiswa, <verse eid="NUM 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 7:28" />lipongo limonga ndava ya teta ya kulekekesa kumbudila Chapanga, <verse eid="NUM 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 7:29" />na ng'ombi higosi hivili, mambelele mhanu gagosi, mapongo muhanu na vanalimbelele vagosi muhanu va mwaka umonga ndava ya luteta lwa uteke. lwenulo ndi lwavili luteta lwa Eliabu mwana wa Heloni. <verse eid="NUM 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 7:30" />Ligono la nne likavya zamu ya Elisuli mwana wa Shedeuli, chilongosi wa likabila la Leubeni. <verse eid="NUM 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 7:31" />Luteta lwaki lwavi, sahani yimonga ya madini ga feza zezinautopa wa kilo yimonga na yapinga na nkeve umonga la madini ga feza lelitopa gilamu miya nane kuwanangana na vipimu vya Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga, sahani na nkeve lenilo kuni vimemiswi uhembe nyililili weuhangisini na mahuta ndava ya luteta lwa mabenu, <verse eid="NUM 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 7:32" />kasahani kamonga ka zahabu kekanautopa gilamu miya yimonga na kumi kuni kamemiswi ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 7:33" />mpapakasi umonga wa ng'ombi yigosi, limbelele limonga ligosi na mpapakasi umonga wa limbelele ugosi wa mwaka umonga, ndava ya teta ya kutinyiswa, <verse eid="NUM 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 7:34" />lipongo limonga ndava ya teta ya kulekekesa kumbudila Chapanga, <verse eid="NUM 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 7:35" />na ng'ombi higosi hivili, mambelele mhanu gagosi, mapongo muhanu na vanalimbelele vagosi muhanu va mwaka umonga ndava ya luteta lwa uteke. lwenulo lwavili luteta lwa Elisuli mwana wa Shedeuli. <verse eid="NUM 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 7:36" />Mweawusili luteta ligono la muhanu avii Shelumieli mwana wa Suli Shadai, chilongosi wa likabila la Simeoni. <verse eid="NUM 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 7:37" />Luteta lwaki lwavi, sahani yimonga ya madini ga feza zezinautopa wa kilo yimonga na yapinga na nkeve umonga la madini ga feza lelitopa gilamu miya nane kuwanangana na vipimu vya Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga, sahani na nkeve lenilo kuni vimemiswi uhembe nyililili weuhangisini na mahuta ga zeituni ndava ya luteta lwa uhembe, <verse eid="NUM 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 7:38" />kasahani kamonga ka zahabu kekanautopa wa gilamu miya yimonga na kumi kuni kekamemiswi ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 7:39" />mpapakasi umonga wa ng'ombi yigosi na limbelele limonga ligosi na mpapakasi umonga ugosi wa limbelele wa mwaka umonga, ndava ya luteta ya kutinyiswa, <verse eid="NUM 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 7:40" />lipongo limonga ndava ya luteta ya kulekekesa kumbudila Chapanga, <verse eid="NUM 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 7:41" />na ng'ombi higosi hivili, mambelele mhanu gagosi, mapongo muhanu na vanalimbelele vagosi muhanu va mwaka umonga ndava ya luteta lwa uteke. Lwenulo lwavili luteta lwa Shelumieli mwana wa Suli Shadai. <verse eid="NUM 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 7:42" />Ligono la sita likavya zamu ya kulet luteta Eliasafu mwana wa Deuli, chilongosi wa likabila la Gadi. <verse eid="NUM 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 7:43" />Luteta lwaki lwavi, sahani yimonga ya madini ga feza zezinautopa wa kilo yimonga na yapinga na nkeve umonga la madini ga feza lelitopa gilamu miya nane kuwanangana na vipimu vya Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga, sahani na nkeve zenizo kuni vimemiswi uhembe nyililili weuhangisini na mahuta ga zeituni ndava ya luteta lwa uhembe, <verse eid="NUM 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 7:44" />kasahani kamonga ka zahabu kekanautopa wa gilamu miya yimonga na kumi kuni kamemiswi ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 7:45" />mpapakasi umonga wa ng'ombi yigosi, limbelele limonga ligosi na mpapakasi umonga wa limbelele ugosi wa mwaka umonga, ndava ya teta ya kutinyiswa, <verse eid="NUM 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 7:46" />lipongo limonga ndava ya luteta ya kulekekesa kumbudila Chapanga, <verse eid="NUM 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 7:47" />na ng'ombi higosi hivili, mambelele mhanu gagosi, mapongo muhanu na vanalimbelele vagosi muhanu va mwaka umonga ndava ya luteta lwa uteke. Lwenulo ndi lwavii luteta lwa Eliasafu mwana wa Deueli. <verse eid="NUM 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 7:48" />Ligono la saba likavya zamu ya kuleta luteta Elishama mwana wa Amihudi, chilongosi wa likabila la Efulaimu. <verse eid="NUM 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 7:49" />Luteta lwaki lwavi, sahani yimonga ya madini ga feza zezinautopa wa kilo yimonga na yapinga na nkeve umonga la madini ga feza lelitopa gilamu miya nane kuwanangana na vipimu vya Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga, sahani na nkeve lenilo kuni vimemiswi uhembe nyililili weuhangisini na mahuta ndava ya luteta lwa uhembe, <verse eid="NUM 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 7:50" />kasahani kamonga ka zahabu kekanautopa gilamu miya yimonga na kumi kuni chimemiswi ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 7:51" />mpapakasi umonga wa ng'ombi yigosi, limbelele limonga ligosi na mpapakasi umonga wa limbelele ugosi wa mwaka umonga, ndava ya teta ya kutinyiswa, <verse eid="NUM 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 7:52" />lipongo limonga ndava ya luteta lwa kulekekesa kumbudila Chapanga, <verse eid="NUM 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 7:53" />na ng'ombi higosi hivili, mambelele mhanu gagosi, mapongo muhanu na vanalimbelele vagosi muhanu va mwaka umonga ndava ya luteta lwa uteke. Lwenulo ndi lwavili luteta lwa Elishama mwana wa Amihudi. <verse eid="NUM 7:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 7:54" />Ligono la nane likavya zamu ya kuleta luteta Gamalieli mwana wa Pedasuli, chilongosi wa likabila la Manase. <verse eid="NUM 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 7:55" />Luteta lwaki lwavi, sahani yimonga ya madini ga feza zezinautopa wa kilo yimonga na yapinga na nkeve umonga wa madini ga feza lelitopa gilamu miya nane kuwanangana na vipimu vya Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga, sahani na nkeve zenizo kuni vimemiswi uhembe nyililili weuhangisini na mahuta ndava ya luteta lwa mabenu, <verse eid="NUM 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 7:56" />kasahani kamonga ka zahabu kekanautopa gilamu miya yimonga na kumi kuni chimemiswi ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 7:57" />mpapakasi umonga wa ng'ombi yigosi, limbelele limonga ligosi na mpapakasi umonga ugosi wa limbelele la mwaka umonga, ndava ya teta ya kutinyiswa, <verse eid="NUM 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 7:58" />lipongo limonga ndava ya teta ya kulekekesa kumbudila Chapanga, <verse eid="NUM 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 7:59" />na ng'ombi higosi hivili, mambelele mhanu gagosi, mapongo muhanu na vanalimbelele vagosi muhanu va mwaka umonga ndava ya kuteta ya luteta lwa uteke. Lwenulo lwavili luteta lwa Gamalieli mwana wa Padasuli. <verse eid="NUM 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 7:60" />ligono la tisa likavya zamu ya kuleta luteta Abidani mwana wa Gideoni, chilongosi wa likabila la Benyamini. <verse eid="NUM 7:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 7:61" />Luteta lwaki lwavi, sahani yimonga ya madini ga feza zezinautopa wa kilo yimonga na yapinga na nkeve umonga la madini ga feza lelitopa gilamu miya nane kuwanangana na vipimu vya Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga. Na sahani na nkeve zenizo kuni vimemiswi uhembe nyililili weuhangisini na mahuta ndava ya luteta lwa mabenu, <verse eid="NUM 7:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 7:62" />kasahani kamonga ka zahabu kekanautopa wa gilamu miya yimonga na kumi kuni chimemiswi ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 7:63" />mpapakasi umonga wa ng'ombi yigosi, limbelele limonga ligosi na mpapakasi umonga wa limbelele ugosi wa mwaka umonga, ndava ya teta ya kutinyiswa, <verse eid="NUM 7:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 7:64" />lipongo limonga ndava ya teta ya kulekekesa kumbudila Chapanga, <verse eid="NUM 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 7:65" />na ng'ombi higosi hivili, mambelele mhanu gagosi, mapongo muhanu na vanalimbelele vagosi muhanu va mwaka umonga ndava ya kuteta ya luteta lwa uteke. Lwenulo ndi lwelwavii luteta lwa Abidani mwana wa Gideoni. <verse eid="NUM 7:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="NUM 7:66" />Ligono la kumi likavya zamu ya kuwusa luteta Ahiezeli mwana wa Amishadai, chilongosi wa likabila la Dani. <verse eid="NUM 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NUM 7:67" />Luteta lwaki lwavi, sahani yimonga ya madini ga feza zezinautopa wa kilo yimonga na yapinga na nkeve umonga la madini ga feza lelitopa gilamu miya nane kuwanangana na vipimu vya Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga. Na sahani na nkeve lenilo kuni vimemiswi uhembe nyililili weuhangisini na mahuta ndava ya luteta lwa mabenu, <verse eid="NUM 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NUM 7:68" />kasahani kamonga ka zahabu kekanautopa wa gilamu miya yimonga na kumi kuni kamemiswi ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NUM 7:69" />mpapakasi umonga wa ng'ombi yigosi, limbelele limonga ligosi na mpapakasi umonga wa limbelele ugosi wa mwaka umonga, ndava ya teta ya kutinyiswa, <verse eid="NUM 7:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NUM 7:70" />lipongo limonga ndava ya luteta lwa kulekekesa kumbudila Chapanga, <verse eid="NUM 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NUM 7:71" />na ng'ombi higosi hivili, mambelele mhanu gagosi, mapongo muhanu na vanalimbelele vagosi muhanu va mwaka umonga ndava ya luteta lwa uteke. lwenulo ndi lwavii luteta lwa Ahiezeli mwana wa Amishadai. <verse eid="NUM 7:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="NUM 7:72" />Ligono la kumi na limonga likavya zamu ya kuleta teta Pagieli mwana wa Okilani, chilongosi wa likabila la Asheli. <verse eid="NUM 7:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="NUM 7:73" />Luteta lwaki lwavii, sahani yimonga ya madini ga feza zezinautopa wa kilo yimonga na yapinga na nkeve umonga wa madini ga feza lelitopa gilamu miya nane kuwanangana na vipimu vya Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga, sahani na nkeve zenizo kuni zimemiswi uhembe nyililili weuhangisini na mahuta ga zeituni ndava ya luteta lwa uhembe, <verse eid="NUM 7:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="NUM 7:74" />Kasahani kamonga ka zahabu kekanautopa gilamu miya yimonga na kumi kuni kamemiswi ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="NUM 7:75" />mpapakasi umonga wa ng'ombi yigosi, limbelele limonga ligosi na mpapakasi umonga wa limbelele ugosi wa mwaka umonga, ndava ya teta ya kutinyiswa, <verse eid="NUM 7:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="NUM 7:76" />lipongo limonga ndava ya luteta lwa kulekekesa kumbudila Chapanga, <verse eid="NUM 7:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="NUM 7:77" />na ng'ombi higosi hivili, mambelele mhanu gagosi, mapongo muhanu na vanalimbelele vagosi muhanu va mwaka umonga ndava ya luteta lwa uteke. lwenulo ndi lwavii luteta lwa Pagieli mwana wa Okilani. <verse eid="NUM 7:77" /><verse number="78" style="v" sid="NUM 7:78" />Na ligono la kumi na mbili lavili zamu ya kuleta teta Ahila mwana wa Enani, chilongosi wa likabila la Nafutali. <verse eid="NUM 7:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="NUM 7:79" />Luteta lwaki lwavi, sahani yimonga ya madini ga feza zezinautopa wa kilo yimonga na yapinga na nkeve umonga la madini ga feza lelitopa gilamu miya nane kuwanangana na vipimu vya Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava Chapanga. Na sahani na nkeve zenizo kuni vimemiswi uhembe nyililili weuhangisini na mahuta ga zeituni ndava ya luteta lwa uhembe, <verse eid="NUM 7:79" /><verse number="80" style="v" sid="NUM 7:80" />kasahani kamonga ka zahabu kekanautopa wa gilamu miya yimonga na kumi kuni kamemiswi ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:80" /><verse number="81" style="v" sid="NUM 7:81" />mpapakasi umonga wa ng'ombi yigosi, limbelele limonga ligosi na mpapakasi umonga wa limbelele ugosi wa mwaka umonga, ndava ya teta ya kutinyiswa, <verse eid="NUM 7:81" /><verse number="82" style="v" sid="NUM 7:82" />lipongo limonga ndava ya teta ya kulekekesa kumbudila Chapanga, <verse eid="NUM 7:82" /><verse number="83" style="v" sid="NUM 7:83" />na ng'ombi higosi hivili, mambelele mhanu gagosi, mapongo muhanu na vanalimbelele vagosi muhanu va mwaka umonga ndava ya luteta lwa uteke. lwenulo ndi lwavii luteta lwa Ahila mwana wa Enani.<verse eid="NUM 7:83" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="NUM 7:84" />Jumula ya mawusilu ga luteta za vilongosi va Isilaeli ndava ya pandu pa kuwusila teta paligono la kuwusiwa ndava ya Bambu kwa kunyalwa mahuta, zavili sahani kumi na hivili vya madini ga feza, nkeve za madini ga feza kumi na zivili, na visahani vya zahabu kumi na viwili. <verse eid="NUM 7:84" /><verse number="85" style="v" sid="NUM 7:85" />Kila sahani yeyitenganizwi kwa madini ga feza, yavili na kutopa kwa kilo yimonga na wapinga na kila nkeve wavi na kutopa kwa gilamu miya nane. Vindu vyenivyo vyoha vyavi na kutopa kwa kilo ishilini na saba na gilamu miya sita kulandana na vipimu vya Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 7:85" /><verse number="86" style="v" sid="NUM 7:86" />Visahani vila vya zahabu kumi na vivili vyevyamemili ubani, kila chimonga chatopa kwa utopo wa gilamu miya yimonga na kumi ngati vipimu vyeviamuliwi ku Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga. Vyoha kwa pamonga vyavii na utopo wa kilo yimonga na gilamu miya zidatu na isilini. <verse eid="NUM 7:86" /><verse number="87" style="v" sid="NUM 7:87" />Jumula ya hinyama hyoha ya luteta lwa kutinyiswa yavii mpapakasi wa ng'ombi kumi na vavili, mambelele gagosi kumi na gavili, na vanalimbelele vagosi va mwaka umonga kumi na gavili, pamonga na luteta lwa uhembe. Na mapongo kumi na gavili ndava ya luteta lwa kuwusa kumbudila Chapanga, <verse eid="NUM 7:87" /><verse number="88" style="v" sid="NUM 7:88" />na ndava ya luteta lwa uteke, jumula ya hinyama vevawusiwi yavili ng'ombi higosi ishilini na mcheche, mambelele magosi sitini, mapongo sitini, na vanalimbelele vagosi va mwaka umonga sitini. Yeniyo ndi yavili luteta yeyawusiwu ndava ya kunyambisa pandu pa kuwusila teta.<verse eid="NUM 7:88" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="NUM 7:89" />Lukumbi Musa peayingili mugati ya Lindanda la kukonganekela na Chapanga, ayuwini lwami lujova kuhuma panani ya chigubiku cha lisanduku la lilaganu, chechikemiwa chigoda cha lipyana, kuhuma pagati ya vala viumbi vavili vevavi na magwaba.<verse eid="NUM 7:89" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NUM 8" />
  <para style="s">Kuvikwa kwa hahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 8:1" />Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 8:2" />“Umjovela Aloni kuvya lukumbi peivika hahi saba zila pachituvilu, azipanga muni zilangasa upandi wa kulongolo pa chindu cha kuvikila hahi chenicho.” <verse eid="NUM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 8:3" />Aloni akayidakila malagizo genago, akazivika hahi zenizo muni zilangasa upandi wa kulongolo wa chituvilu, ngati Bambu Chapanga cheamlagizi Musa. <verse eid="NUM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 8:4" />Chendu chenicha cha kuvikila hahi chechatenganizwi, chatenganizwi kwa zahabu yeyakitiwi lufumbu, kutumbula kuchitamilu chaki mbaka ku maluva gaki. Chindu cha kuvikila hahi chatenganizwi kulandana na malagizu ga Bambu geampelili Musa.<verse eid="NUM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Valawi vibaguliwa ndava ya Bambu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 8:5" />Kavili Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 8:6" />“Uvabagula Valawi kuhuma kwa Vaisilaeli, vayidakiliwa kwa lihengu la kufugama. <verse eid="NUM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 8:7" />Chenichi ndi cheukitayi, vanyunyuzila manji ga kuvanyambisa kangi uvajovela vajikete higa hyoha, vachapa nyula zavi na vene yati vivya bwina. <verse eid="NUM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 8:8" />Kangi vamtola mpapakasi mmonga pamonga na luteta lwaki lwa uhembe nyililili weuhangisini na mahuta ga zeituni, kangi na veve yati utola ng'ombi yngi mgosi ndava ya luteta lwa kuwusa kumbudila Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 8:9" />Kangi uvaleta pamonga vandu voha va Islaeli na uvajovela Valawi vayima palongolo ya Lindanda la kuonganekela ndva ya Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 8:10" />Peukuvaleta Valawi palongolo yangu, va Isilaeli yati vakuvavikila mawoko Valawi mumituyavi, <verse eid="NUM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 8:11" />kangi Aloni yati akuvavika venavo palongolo yangu ngati luteta lwa kuyinuliwa kuhuma kwa Vaislaeli muni vajitendekela vanihengela. <verse eid="NUM 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 8:12" />Pevimala, Valawi yati vivika mawoko gavi panani ya mitu ya ng'ombi zigosi, mmonga wavi yati ukumuwusa kuvya luteta lwa kuwusa kumbudila Chapanga, na yungi uyo yati ukumuwusa kuvya luteta lwa kutinyiswa yeyivikiwa kwangu ndava ya kuvavikila utepulanisi Valawi.”<verse eid="NUM 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 8:13" />“Ndi yati ukuvayimika Valawi palongolo ya Aloni na vana vaki na kuvavika palongolo yangu ngati luteta lwa kuyinuliwa. <verse eid="NUM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 8:14" />Munjila yeniyi ndi yati ukuvabagula Valawi kuhuma Vaisilaeli vangi, na vene Valawi yati vivya vangu. <verse eid="NUM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 8:15" />Peumala kuvabagula Valawi na kuvawusa ngati luteta lwa kupungila, yati vibwela kuhenge lihengu lavi pa Lindanda la kukonganekela. <verse eid="NUM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 8:16" />Vene ndi Vaisilaeli chakaka ndi veviwusiwa nene njwe. Venavo vawusiwi vavya vangu njweee pahala pa chiveleku vi Isilaeli, chiveleku cha kutumbula chigosi kuhuma kwa kila mdala wa Chiisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 8:17" />Kila chiveleku cha kutumbula chigosi pagati ya Vaisilaeli, avya mundu amala hinyama, ndi wangu. Lukumbi penavakomili viveleku vyoha vya kutumbula kula ku Misili, navavagwili vene ndava ya nene namwene. <verse eid="NUM 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 8:18" />Hinu nivatolili Valawi pahali pa viveleku vya kutumbula vya Vaisilaeli, <verse eid="NUM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 8:19" />na nimempeli venavo Aloni na vana vaki, ngati njombi kuhuma kwa Vaisilaeli, muni vakita lihengu pa Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga, ndava ya Vaislaeli na kuvakitila utepulatanisi muni avayunga gahakahu gegihotola kuvakomakesa.”<verse eid="NUM 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 8:20" />Musa, Aloni na vandu voha wa Vaisilaeli vakavakitila Valawi, ngati Bambu Chapanga cheamlagazili Musa. <verse eid="NUM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 8:21" />Valawi vakajinyambasa ndava vambudila Chapanga na kuchapa nyula zavi, na Aloni akavawusa ngati luteta lwa kuyinuliwa palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga. Mewa, Aloni akitili utepulanisi ndava yavi muni kuvanyambisa. <verse eid="NUM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 8:22" />Pegamaliki genago, Valawi vatubwili kuhenga lihengu lavi ku Lindanda la kukonganekela pahi ya uyimalila wa Aloni na vana vaki, ngati Bambu Chapanga cheamlagazili Musa.<verse eid="NUM 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 8:23" />Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 8:24" />“Kila Mlawi mweavi ntanga ya miaka ishilini na mhanu na neju, iganikiwa akahenga lihengu mu Lindanda la kukonganekela, <verse eid="NUM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 8:25" />nambu peyihika ntanga ya miyaka hamusini, akoto kuyendelela kuhenga lihengu. <verse eid="NUM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 8:26" />Pegimalika genago, ihotola kuvatangaila Valawi vayaki pevihenga lihengu mu Lindanda la kukonganekela, nambu yati ihenga lepi lihengu laki mwene. Ndi cheukuvapangila lihengu Valawi.”<verse eid="NUM 8:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NUM 9" />
  <para style="s">Pasaka ya pili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 9:1" />Bambu Chapanga akajova na Musa kulugangatu lwa ku Sinai mumwehi wa kutumbula wa mwaka wa pili Vaisilaeli pevamali kuhuma ku Misili. Akajova, <verse eid="NUM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 9:2" />“Uvahamula Vaisilaeli vaselebuka Pasaka mulukumbi lwelupangiwi. <verse eid="NUM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 9:3" />Yeniyi yati yivya ligono la kumi na mcheche la mwehi uwu, lukumbi lwa kimii yati vikita chenicho kulandana na malagizu gaki goha.” <verse eid="NUM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 9:4" />Ndava yeniyo, Musa akavajovela vandu kuvya viganikiwa kuselebukila mselebuko wa Pasaka. <verse eid="NUM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 9:5" />na vene vakakita chenicho Kulugangatu la ku Sinai lukumbi pelitumbula kutipama lilanga ligono la kumi na mcheche la mwehi wa kutumbula. Vaisilaeli vakakita kila chindu ngati Bambu Chapanga cheamulagizi Musa.<verse eid="NUM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 9:6" />Nambu vangi pagati yavi vahotwili lepi kuselebukila Pasaka ligono lila ndava vavi vangayidakiliwa palongolo ya Chapanga ndava ya kupamisa mundu mweafwili. Ndava yeniyo vamahambili Musa na Aloni ligono lila lila, <verse eid="NUM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 9:7" />vakamjovela Musa, “Tete tiyidakiwa lepi kuvya palongolo ya Bambu nda tipamisi higa ya mundu mweafwili, nambu ndava kyani tidivaliwa kumuwusila Bambu Chapanga luteta lwaki pamonga na Vaisilaeli vangi mulukumbi lweuhamuliwi?”<verse eid="NUM 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 9:8" />Musa akayangula, “Mlinda mbaka penapo penipata malagizu ndava yinu kuhuma kwa Bambu Chapanga.”<verse eid="NUM 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 9:9" />Ndi Bambu Chapanga akamjovela musa, <verse eid="NUM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 9:10" />uvajovela Vaisilaeli, “Lukumbi mmonga winu amala viveleku vinu akavya angayidakiliwa palongolo ya Chapanga ndava ya kupamisa mundu mwefwili amala vavi mulugendu, hati naha vihotola kuselebuka Pasaka ya Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 9:11" />Yati mwiselebuka lukumbi lwa kutipama lilanga ligono la kumi na mcheche la mwehi wa pili. Yati vilya mwanalimbelele, pamonga na libumunda langasopewa ngemeku, na likolo livavanu. <verse eid="NUM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 9:12" />Vakoto kusigalisa chakulya chochoha mbaka lukela, wala vakotoka kudenya hati lihupa limonga la hinyama. Yati viselebukila mselebuko wenuwu wa Pasaka kulandana na malagizu gaki goha. <verse eid="NUM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 9:13" />Nambu mundu yeyoha mweanyambili amala avii lepi mulugendu, na akakotoka kuselebukila Pasaka, yati ibaguwliwa na vandu vangu ndava muni anipeli lepi luteta kwa lukumbi lwelupangiwi. Ndi yikumgana abuniwa ndava ya kumbudila Chapanga uku.”<verse eid="NUM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 9:14" />“Ngati na kuvii myehe mweitama pamonga na nyenye igana kuselebukila mselebuko wa Pasaka, mundu mwenuyo iganikiwa akita chenicho kuwanangana na malagizu goha ga Pasaka. Kila mundu yati ilanda malagizu galagala, akavya myehe amala mkolonjinji.”<verse eid="NUM 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihundi la motu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 40:34-38">Kuw 40:34-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 9:15" />Ligono Lindanda la kukonganekela pelahimikwi, lihundi lahelilili na kugubika Lindanda lenilo. Lukumbi lwa kilu lihundi lenilo lawonikini ngati motu mbaka lukela. <verse eid="NUM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 9:16" />Chenicho ndi chayavili kila ligono, lihundi lagubiki Lindanda muhi, na kilu lawonikini ngati motu. <verse eid="NUM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 9:17" />Lukumbi lwoha lihundi palayinuliwi kunani ya Lindanda, Vaisilaeli vadenyili kambi na kujenga kavili pandu lihundi lenilo pelatulili. <verse eid="NUM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 9:18" />Vagendili kwa malagizu ga Chapanga, na kutama kavili pa Lindanda kwa maalagizu gaki. Lukumbi lwoha lihundi pelavili kunani ya Lindanda, vandu vatamili palikambi lenilo. <verse eid="NUM 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 9:19" />Hati ngati lihundi lenilo latamili kunani ya Lindanda kwa lukumbi lwa magono gamahele, Vaisilaeli vamyidikili Chapanga, vene vawukili lepi. <verse eid="NUM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 9:20" />Lukumbi lungi, lihundi lenilo latamili panani ya Lindanda kwa lukumbi lwa magono gadebe ndu, nambu lukumbi lwoha Vaisilaeli vasigalili pakambi, na vahamili pala ndu Chapanga peaganili vahama. <verse eid="NUM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 9:21" />Lukumbi lungi, lihundi latamili kunani ya Lindanda kutumbula kimii mbaka lukela ndu na mala ndu pelayinuliwi, mewa vandu venavo vawukili. Na ngati litamili kunani ya Lindanda muhi woha na kilu yoha, vene vawukili ndu lihundi pelayinuliwi. <verse eid="NUM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 9:22" />Yikavya lihundi latamili panani ya Lindanda magono gavili amala mwehi amala mwaka, lukumbi lwoha lihundi lenilo pelavili kunani ya Lindanda, Vaisilaeli vahamili lepi, nambu pelayinuliwi, na vene mewa vahamili. <verse eid="NUM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 9:23" />Kwa lilagizu la Bambu Chapanga vatamili, na kwa lilagizu la Bambu Chapanga vawukili, Vayidakili mihilu ya Bambu Chapanga kulandana malagizu gaki kupitila Musa.<verse eid="NUM 9:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NUM 10" />
  <para style="s">Mapenenga gegatenganizwi kwa madini ga feza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 10:1" />Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 10:2" />“Tengeneza mapenenga gavili kwa madini ga feza yeyikitiwi lufumbu. Ugahengela kwa kukemela vandu lukumbi lwa kudenya kambi ndava ya kuwuka. <verse eid="NUM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 10:3" />Mapenenga goha gavili pegipulwa pamonga, vandu voha yati vikonganeka pamonga papipi na veve palongolo ya mlyangu wa Lindanda la kukonganekela. <verse eid="NUM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 10:4" />Nambu ngati likapulwa limonga ndu, vachilongosi yaani vakulu va lukolo za Isilaeli, ndi vevihegelela palongolo yaku. <verse eid="NUM 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 10:5" />Lukumbi lwami lwa lipenenga lwa kumanyisa kuwuka likapuliwayi, makabila gegavii na makambi upandi welihumila lilanga yati vitumbula kuwuka. <verse eid="NUM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 10:6" />Lwami lwenulo lwa lipenenga yati luyuwanika lukumbi lwoha lwa kutumbula lugendu, vala va kambi za upandi wa kusini yati vitumbula kuwuka. Lwami lwa lipenenga lwa kumanyisa kuwuka yati luvya ulangisu wa kutumbula kuwuka. <verse eid="NUM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 10:7" />Lukumbi peukuvakemela vandu vakonganeka pamonga pula lipenenga, nambu kotoka kupula kwa lwami lwa kuwuka.” <verse eid="NUM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 10:8" />Vana wa Aroni, vevavi vamteta, ndi vevipula mapenenga genago.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 10:8">“Lenili yati livya lilagizu la magono goha ndava yinu na kwa viveleku vyevibwela. <verse eid="NUM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 10:9" />Lukumbi lwa ngondo pamulima wenu ndava ya vamakoko vevakuvawonela, yati mwiwusa ulangisu wa ngondo kwa kupula mapenenga genago muni Chapanga, Chapanga winu apatayi kuvakumbuka na kuvasangula kuhuma kwa makoko vinu. <verse eid="NUM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 10:10" />Mewa lusenje lwa luheku lwinu, miselebuko ya mwehi peuvandama na miselebuko hingi, yati mwipula lipenenga genaga pemwiwusa teta zinu za kutinyiswa na luteta zinu za uteke. Penapo nene Chapanga winu yati nikuvakumbuka nyenye. Nene ndi Bambu, Chapanga winu.”<verse eid="NUM 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vaisilaeli videnya kambi ndava ya kuwuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 10:11" />Paligono la ishilini la mwehi wa pili, mwaka wa pili, tangia Vaisilaeli pevahumili ku Misili, lihundi layinuliwi kuhuma kunani ya Lindanda la kukonganekela, <verse eid="NUM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 10:12" />na vene Vaisilaeli vakatumbula lugendu lwavi kuhuma lugangatu lwa ku Sinai. Lihundi lenilo lawukili na kuhamba kutula palugangatu la Palani.<verse eid="NUM 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 10:13" />Lwenulu ndi lwavili lugendu lwa kutumbula lwa vana va Isilaeli vawukili kwa mihilu ya Chapanga ngati cheyajoviwi na Musa. <verse eid="NUM 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 10:14" />Misambi ya kambi ya Yuda yalongolili hoti pahi ya bendela yavi. Chilongosi wavi ndi avii Nashoni mwana wa Aminadabu. <verse eid="NUM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 10:15" />Natanyeli mwana wa Suali, avili chilongosi wa msambi wa likabila la Isakali, <verse eid="NUM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 10:16" />na Eliabu mwana wa Heloni, avi chilongosi wa masambi wa likabila la Zebuluni.<verse eid="NUM 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 10:17" />Kangi, Lindanda validenyili, na vandu va lukolo lwa Gelishoni na wa Melali ndi vevagegili, vatumbwili kuwuka.<verse eid="NUM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 10:18" />Kangi misambi ya kambi ya lukolo lwa Leubeni yalandili pahi ya bendela zavi. Chilongosi wavi ndi avii Elishuli mwana wa Shedeuli. <verse eid="NUM 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 10:19" />Shelumieli mwana wa Sulishadai alongwisi msambi wa likabla la Simeoni, <verse eid="NUM 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 10:20" />na Eliasafu mwana wa Deueli alongwisi msambi wa likabila la Gadi.<verse eid="NUM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 10:21" />Kangi vagelekili vandu va lukolo lwa Kohati, kuni vagegili vindu vya Msopi. Yaganikiwi Lindanda liyimikwayi kwakona vene vangabwela.<verse eid="NUM 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 10:22" />Kangi misambi ya kambi ya likabila la Efulaimu vyalandili pahi ya bendela yavi. Chilongosi wavi ndi avii Elishama mwana wa Amihudi. <verse eid="NUM 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 10:23" />Gamalieli mwana wa Pedasuli alongwisi misambi ya likabila la Manase, <verse eid="NUM 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 10:24" />na Abidani mwana wa Gideoni, alongwisi likabila la Benyamini.<verse eid="NUM 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 10:25" />Pamwishu, vala vevavili pahi ya bendela ya msambi wewalongiswi na likabila la Dani vawukili pahi ya ulangisu wavi. chilongosi wavi ndi avii Ahiezeli mwana wa Amishadai. <verse eid="NUM 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 10:26" />Pagieli, mwana wa Oklani, alongwisi likabila la Asheli, <verse eid="NUM 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 10:27" />na Ahila mwana wa Enani, alongwisi likabila la Nafutali. <verse eid="NUM 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 10:28" />Lwenulo ndi lwavii luhumu lwa kuwuka misambi ya Vaisilaeli, ndava ya kuyendelela na lugendu. <verse eid="NUM 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 10:29" />Penapo Musa akamujovela Hobabu mweavii mlamu waki mwana wa Leueli mkohanu wa Musa, mundu wa ku Midiani, “Tiwuka kuhamba pandu peatijovili Bambu tihamba, ‘Yati nikuvapela nyenye pandu penapo.’ Tihamba pamonga, na tete yati tikukuhengela gabwina, muni Bambu atihaidili mambu gabwina kwa Vaisilaeli.” <verse eid="NUM 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 10:30" />Akayangula, “Pehe, yati nihamba lepi na nyenye, yati nikiliwuka kumulima wangu namwene, na kwa vandu vangu namwene.” <verse eid="NUM 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 10:31" />Nambu Musa akajova, “Chondi kotoka kutileka. Veve ulumanyili lugangatu ulu, na uhotola kutilangisa pandu pa kuvika kambi. <verse eid="NUM 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 10:32" />Ngati ukalongosana na tete chochoha chabwina cheakutihengela Bambu Chapanga, ndi chewihengewa mewa na veve.”<verse eid="NUM 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vandu viwuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 10:33" />Chenicho ndi vawukili kuhuma ku Sinai kuchitumbi cha Bambu Chapanga, navene vagendili kwa magono gadatu. Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga lavi palongo yavi kwa magono ago gadatu muni kuvalondela pandu pa kupumulila. <verse eid="NUM 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 10:34" />Lihundi la Bambu lavili panani yavi lukumbi lwa muhi kila ligono pevavii mulugendu.<verse eid="NUM 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 10:35" />Lukumbi lwolwoha lisanduku pelawukili, Musa ajovili, “Vee Bambu Chapanga, yinuka! Vang'aiswa vitu vapechenganayi, vamakoko vitu vatilayi palongolo yaku.” <verse eid="NUM 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 10:36" />Na kila lukumbi pelayimili, Musa ajovili, “Vawuyila, veve Bambu Chapanga, vawuyilayi Vaisilaeli ava vevavii vamahele neju.”<verse eid="NUM 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NUM 11" />
  <para style="s">Motu kuhuma kwa Bambu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 11:1" />Vandu vatumbwili kumng'ung'utila Bambu Chapanga ndava ya mtahu wavi. Bambu Chapanga peayuwini, akayoma akavapelekela motu. Motu wenuo wayakili pagati yavi na kuyocha upandi mmonga wa kambi. <verse eid="NUM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 11:2" />Vandu vakamvembela Musa, na mwene akamuyupa Bambu Chapanga na motu wenuo ukajimika. <verse eid="NUM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 11:3" />Ndava yeniyo pandu penapo pakemeliwi Tabela, ndava penapo motu wa Bambu Chapanga wayakili pagati yavi.<verse eid="NUM 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa akuvahagula vachilongosi sabini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 11:4" />Pagati yavi vavii vayehe vangali kuvya Vaisilaeli vanogili neju chakulya chingi na Vaisilaeli mewa vatumbwili kuvemba kavili na kujova, “Mbanga nga tivya na nyofu tilye! <verse eid="NUM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 11:5" />Tikumbuka, somba zetalili kula ku Misili changali malipu, matikiti na matangamanga na likolo na vitungulu na vitungulu swaumu! <verse eid="NUM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 11:6" />Nambu hinu tivi lepi na makakala, tivi lepi na mnogu wa chakulya muni kawaka chakulya chingi nga yiyi mana ndu!”<verse eid="NUM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 11:7" />Mana yawanangini ngati ngele za mapemba, langi yaki yavili ngati manjanu. <verse eid="NUM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 11:8" />Mana yeniyo yagwili lukumbi kilu pakambi pamonga na mbetu. <verse eid="NUM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 11:9" />Lukela vandu vahambili kuyola, kangi vayagili kwa maganga ga livala amala vapulili mulituli na kangi vakateleka muviviga. Mnogu waki wavili ngati mabumunda ga gegatelekwi kwa mahuta ga zeituni.<verse eid="NUM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 11:10" />Musa ayuwini vandu ving'ung'uta mukila munyumba, kila mundu pamlyangu wa Lindanda laki. Hinu Bambu Chapanga akayoma neju, na mwene Musa akavayomela. <verse eid="NUM 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 11:11" />Akamkota, Bambu Chapanga, “Ndava kyani uletili mtahu wenuwu kwa mtumisi waku? Nikukitili kyani cha kukuyomesa hati unipeli lihegu lenili lelinonopa la kuvayangalila vandu ava voha? <verse eid="NUM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 11:12" />Wu, nene ndi mwenivaveliki, hati ukanijovela nivagega panganga yangu ngati mweilela mwana mng'enya, na kuvapeleka mbaka pamulima yeulapili kuvapela vagogo vavi? <verse eid="NUM 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 11:13" />Yati nipata koki nyofu ya kuvapela vandu ava voha? Muni viyendelela kunivembela palongolo yangu vijova, ‘Tipela nyofu tilyayi!’ <verse eid="NUM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 11:14" />Nihotola lepi kuvayangalila vandu ava voha, lenilo ndi lihengu livaha neju kwangu! <verse eid="NUM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 11:15" />Ngati naha ndi cheukunikitila, mbaga unikoma, nambu ngati niganisiwi pamihu paku, ukoto kunileka nivya mumang'aiso.”<verse eid="NUM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 11:16" />Hinu, Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa, “Uvaleta vagogo sabini va Isilaeli, vala veve veukuvamanya vitopeswa na kuyidakiliwa na vandu ngati vachilongosi, uvaleta pa Lindanda la kukonganekela, vayima papipi na veve. <verse eid="NUM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 11:17" />Yati nihelela kwenuko na kujova na veve, yati nitola pandu pa makakala ga mtima wangu, na kuvika makakala ago vandu venavo. Vene yati vivya na lihengu la kukutangatila kuvayangalila vandu ava muni ukoto kulikita lihengu lenili wamwene. <verse eid="NUM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 11:18" />Hinu vajovela naha, mjinyambisa ndava ya chilau, yati mwilya nyama. Bambu Chapanga ayuwini mwiveba na kujova kuvya kawaka mundu wa kuvapela nyofu, na mwanekanili neju pamwavili ku Misili. Hinu Bambu Chapanga yati akuvapela nyama, na nyenye mganikiwa mlyayi. <verse eid="NUM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 11:19" />Nyama yeniyo yati mwilya lepi kwa lukumbi wa ligono limonga ndu, amala zivili, amala mahanu, amala kumi amala ishilini, <verse eid="NUM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 11:20" />ndi yati mwilya kwa lukumbi lwa mwehi woha! Yayi mwilya mbaka kukola na kuyivenga mnungalilu waki. Goha ago ni ndava mumbelili Bambu Chapanga mweavili bahapa pagati yinu, na kuvemba palongolo yaki mwijova, ‘Ndava kyani mwahumili ku Misili?’ ”<verse eid="NUM 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 11:21" />Nambu Musa amjovili Bambu Chapanga, “Mvalangu wa vandu venikuvalongosa ndi laki sita vevigenda kwa magendelu, na veve wijova. Yati nikuvapela nyama ya kukola mwehi woha? <verse eid="NUM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 11:22" />Wu, pihotola kuhinjwa mambelele na ng'ombi wa kuvakola? Wu, somba zoha za mnyanja valovayi ndava yavi?”<verse eid="NUM 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 11:23" />Bambu Chapanga akamyangula Musa, “Wu, uhotola wangu upungwili? Yati wilola hinu ngati linenu langu yati livya la uchakaka kwaku amala lepi.”<verse eid="NUM 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 11:24" />Ndava yeniyo Musa akahamba kuvamanyisa vandu gala geajovili Bambu Chapanga. Kangi akavakemela pamonga vagogo sabini vachilongosi pagati ya vagogo na vene akavavika pamuhana kutindila pa Lindanda. <verse eid="NUM 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 11:25" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga akahelela mumahundi na kulongela na Musa. Ndi akatola pandu pa makakala ga mpungu weampeli Musa, akavapela kila mmonga wa vagogo vala sabini. Pevayingilwi na mpungu wenuwo, vagogo vala vakatumbula kuwusa ulota, nambu vawuyili lepi kuhenga chenicho.<verse eid="NUM 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 11:26" />Nambu vagogo vavili pagati ya vala sabini vevahaguliwi, Elidadi na Medadi, vasigalili pakambi vayavi pavahambili ku Lindanda. Mpungu wavabwelili mwenumo mukambi, vakatumbula kuwusa ulota pandu pevavivili. <verse eid="NUM 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 11:27" />Msongolo mmonga ajumbili kumjovela Musa, “Elidadi na Medadi viwusa ulota pakambi.”<verse eid="NUM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 11:28" />Penapo, Yoshua, mwana wa Nuni, mweavi mtangatila wa Musa kuhumila musongolo waki, akamjovela Musa, “Bambu wangu, uvabesa.”<verse eid="NUM 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 11:29" />Nambu Musa akamyangula, “Wu, Uvii na wihu ndava yangu? Nganinogili vandu voha va Bambu Chapanga ngavavyai vamlota na kuvya Bambu Chapanga ngaaviki Mpungu waki panani yavi!” <verse eid="NUM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 11:30" />Kangi Musa awuyili kukambi pamonga na vagogo vala va Isilaeli.<verse eid="NUM 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bambu Chapanga ipeleka ngwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 11:31" />Kangi ukahumalila mpungu kuhuma kwa Bambu Chapanga na wene ukaleta ngwali kuhuma munyanja na kuzigwiha paluvanja lwoha kutindila kambi, vakalundana pahi utali wa ngati mita yimonga, utali wa kilomita zamahele pandi zoha kutindila kambi. <verse eid="NUM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 11:32" />Hinu, ligono lenilo loha, muhi woha na kilu yoha, na chilau yaki vandu vavi mukuhenga kunonga ngwali, kawaka mundu mweanongili pahi ya kilo elufu yimonga. Vakaziyanika kutindila kambi yoha. <verse eid="NUM 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 11:33" />Kwepavili kwakona kuvii na nyama yamahele na kwakona vandu vangamala kulya, Bambu Chapanga akavayomela, akavatova vandu venavo kwa litovelu livaha neju. <verse eid="NUM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 11:34" />Ndava yeniyo pandu penapo pakemiwi Kibiloti Hataava, ndava muni kwenuko ndi kwevazikili vandu vevavi vahutulu.<verse eid="NUM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 11:35" />Kuhuma penapo Kibiloti Hataava vandu vagendili na kuvika kambi Heseloti.<verse eid="NUM 11:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NUM 12" />
  <para style="s">Miliamu ibuniwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 12:1" />Kangi Miliamu na Aloni vatumbwili kumjova chihakau Musa ndava ya mdala wa ku Esiopia mweamgegili. <verse eid="NUM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 12:2" />Vakakota, “Wu, Bambu Chapanga ajovili kupitila Musa mwene ndu? Wu, ajovili lepi na tete mewa?” Na Bambu Chapanga ayuwini gavajovili. <verse eid="NUM 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 12:3" />Hinu Musa avii mundu mngolongondi neju, kuliku vandu vangi voha vevavili pamulima.<verse eid="NUM 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 12:4" />Balapala Bambu Chapanga akavajovela Musa na Aloni na Miliamu “Mubwela pa Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava yangu, nyenye vadatu.” Hinu, voha vadatu vakahamba ku Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 12:5" />Penapo Bambu Chapanga akahelela panguzo ya lihundi, akayima pamlyangu wa Lindanda, akavakemela Aloni na Miliamu. Voha vavili vakahegelela kulongolo. <verse eid="NUM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 12:6" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga akajova, “Myuwanila malovi gangu! Mlota wa Chapanga akavya pagati yinu yati nikujimanyisa kwaki mumaono na kulongela nayu mndoto. <verse eid="NUM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 12:7" />Nambu lepi kwa mhengaji wangu Musa, mwene ndi msadikika avalongosa vandu vangu va Isilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 12:8" />Nene nilongela nayu kuni tilolesana, kangi hotohoto changali miluhumu hati akuniwona chanivili, Ndava kyani, hinu mwayogwipi lepi kumjova gahakau kumvala mhengaji wangu Musa?”<verse eid="NUM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 12:9" />Chapanga akavayomela vene, ndi akavaleka akawuka. <verse eid="NUM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 12:10" />Lukumbi lihundi pelawukili pa Lindanda la kukonganekela, Miliamu awonikini avii na mabudi ga Msopi pee. Aloni peang'anamwiki kumlola Miliamu akamuwona ana mabudi. <verse eid="NUM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 12:11" />Kangi Aloni akamjovela Musa, “Veve mkulu wangu, ukotoka kutileka ting'ahika ndava muni tikiti mambu ga chiyimu na kumdila Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 12:12" />Nikuyupa neju kotoka kumleka avya ngati mwana mng'enya mweavelekiwi kuni afwili, mweawolili yainga ya higa yaki yiwolili.”<verse eid="NUM 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 12:13" />Ndi Musa akamvembela Bambu Chapanga, akajova, “Nikuyapa neju, veve Chapanga, umlamisa!”<verse eid="NUM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 12:14" />Nambu Bambu Chapanga akamyangula Musa, “Ngati dadi waki, ngaamuhunyili mata kumihu, wu, ngaakoli lepi soni magono saba? Hinu, mumuwusa kuvala ya kambi atama kwenuko lukumbi lwa magono saba, kangi wihotola kumyidakila awuyayi pakambi.” <verse eid="NUM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 12:15" />Ndava yeniyo, Miliamu akavingiwa kuvala ya kambi lukumbi lwa magono saba. Vandu vatumbili lepi lugendu mbaka Miliamu peawuyiswi kavili pakambi. <verse eid="NUM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 12:16" />Pegamaliki genago, vandu vawukili ku Hazeloti, vakavika kambi palugangatu lwa Palani.<verse eid="NUM 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13" />
  <para style="s">Vamang'omesi. Mvala 1:19-33</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1" />Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 13:2" />“Vatuma vandu chilongosi monga kuhuma mukila likabila vahamba vakakita umang'omesi kumulima wa Kaanani wenikuvapela vana va Isilaeli.” <verse eid="NUM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:3" />Hinu, kwa malagizu la Chapanga, Musa akatuma vandu kuhuma lugangatu lwa Palami. Vandu voha vevatumwili ndi vavi vachilongosi va makabila ndalindali ga va Isilaeli; <verse eid="NUM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 13:4" />Genaga ndi mahina ga vandu venavo, kuhuma likabila la Leubeni, Shamua mwana wa Zakuli. <verse eid="NUM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 13:5" />Kuhuma likabila la Simioni, Shafati mwana wa Holi. <verse eid="NUM 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 13:6" />Kuhuma likabila la Yuda, Kalebu mwana wa Yefune. <verse eid="NUM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 13:7" />Kuhuma likabila la Isakali, Igali mwana wa Yosefu. <verse eid="NUM 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 13:8" />Kuhuma likabila la Efulaimu, Hoshea mwana wa Nuni. <verse eid="NUM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 13:9" />Kuhuma likabila la Benyamini, Paliti mwana wa Lafu. <verse eid="NUM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 13:10" />Kuhuma likabila la Zebuluni, Gadieli mwana wa Sodi. <verse eid="NUM 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 13:11" />Kuhuma likabila la Yosefu ndi mewa likabila la Manase, Gadi mwana wa Susi. <verse eid="NUM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 13:12" />Kuhuma likabila la Dani, Amieli mwana wa Gemali. <verse eid="NUM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 13:13" />Kuhuma likabila la Asheli, Setuli mwana wa Mikaeli.<verse eid="NUM 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 13:14" />Kuhuma likabila la Nafutali, Nabi mwana wa Wofisi.<verse eid="NUM 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 13:15" />Kuhuma likabila la Gadi, Geueli mwana wa Maki.<verse eid="NUM 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 13:16" />Genago ndi mahina ga vandu Musa veavatumili kuhamba kukita umang'omesi ku mulima wa Kanaani. Musa ampelili Hoshea mwana wa Nuni lihina lingi Yoshua. <verse eid="NUM 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17" />Lukumbi peavatumili kuung'omesa mulima wa Kaanani, Musa avajovili, “Kuhuma penapa muhamaba kukasikazini na kuhika Negebu ndi upandi wa kusini wa Kanaani na kuyendelela mbaka ku mulima wa hitumbi, <verse eid="NUM 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18" />mkaung'omesa mulima cheuvili. Mewa mkotekesa ngati vandu vevitama penapo wu, vakekesi amala vayutiyuti, vadebedebe amala vamahele. <verse eid="NUM 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19" />Vitama pamulima wa namuna yoki? Wu, mulima wabwina amala uhakau? Wu, miji yevitama vatindisili luwumba amala ngomi? <verse eid="NUM 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20" />Mlolokesa mewa ngati ndima yeniyo yabwina kwa kulima amla lepi, wu, kuvi na mikongo amala kawaka? Mkangamala chemwihotola kuleta matunda kuhuma mulima wenuo.” Lwenulo lwavi lukumbi lwa kuhunda zabibu za kutumbula.<verse eid="NUM 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21" />Hinu, vandu avo vakahamba kuung'omesa mulima kuhuma kulugangatu la ku Sini mbaka Lehobu, papipi na pandu pa kuyingilila ku Hamati. <verse eid="NUM 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 13:22" />Vahambili mbaka ku Negebu ndi upandi wa kusini vakahika mbaka ku muji wa Hebuloni. Kwenuko vavakolili Vaahimani na Vasheshai na Vatalimai, chiveleku cha Anaki. Muji wa Hebuloni wamali kujengewa miaka saba kwakona muji wa Soani wewavili mulima wa Misili. <verse eid="NUM 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 13:23" />Pevahikili palikemba la Eshikoli, vandu avo vadumwili lipanyu la mzabibu lelitopa na matunda gamahele, lela gegiwi mzega. Vagegili mewa makomamanga na tini. <verse eid="NUM 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 13:24" />Pandu penapo pakemelewi likemba la Eshikoli ndava ya lipanyu Vaisilaeli vadenyili kuhuma pandu penapo.<verse eid="NUM 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25" />Pevamalili kuying'omesa mulima wenuwo kwa magono alobaini, vandu vala vawuyili. <verse eid="NUM 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26" />Vawuyili kwa Musa, Aloni na vandu voha va Isilaeli kwenuko Kadeshi kulugangatu la Palani. Penapo ndi pevavajovili mambu gala gevagawene na kuvalangisa matunda gevagaletili. <verse eid="NUM 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27" />Vamjovili Musa, “Tahikili pamulima wewatutumili tiying'omesa, mulima wabwina kwa kulimba na kuyunga mifuya, na lenili ndi lipanyu laki. <verse eid="NUM 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28" />Nambu, vakolonjinji va kwenuko vavii na makakala neju, na miji yavi ndi yivaha na yitindisiwi ngomi. Neju ya genago, kwenuko tawene vachiveleku va Anaki. <verse eid="NUM 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29" />Vaamaleki vitama ku Negebu, Vahiti na Vayebusi na Vaamoli vitama ku mulima wa hitumbi, na Vakaanani vitama papipi na nyanja Meditelenia na pamuhana ya mfuleni Yoludani.”<verse eid="NUM 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30" />Kangi Kalebu avagunisi vandu palongolo ya Musa akajova, “Yikutigana tihamba kanyata na kuutola mulima wenuo kuvya yitu. Ndava muni tivii na uhotola wa kukita chenicho.”<verse eid="NUM 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31" />Nambu vandu vala veaalandini nawu kuung'omesi mulima vakajova, “Tihotola lepi kutovana na vandu avo, vene vana makakala neju kuliko tete.” <verse eid="NUM 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32" />Vakatumbula kudandasa malovi ga udesi pagati ya Vaisilaeli kuuvala mulima wevaung'omisi. Vakajova, “Mulima wula ukuvakoma vandu vaki. Mewa vandu vetivawene kwenuko mavandu. <verse eid="NUM 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:33" />Tivawene mavandu, vachiveleku va Anaki. Tete tajiweni ngati mambalanguli palongolo yavi, na ndi chevatiwene tete.”<verse eid="NUM 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14" />
  <para style="s">Vandu vivembeneka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1" />Kilu yila vandu voha va Isilaeli vakavembeneka kwa lwami luvaha. <verse eid="NUM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2" />Vamvembenikili Musa na Aloni vakajova, “Nga yivii mbanga ngatifwilili ku mlima wa Misili! Amala palungatu ulu. <verse eid="NUM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3" />Ndava kyani Bambu Chapanga akutileta pamulima uwu? Yati vakutikoma kungondo, vadala vitu na vana vitu yati vikamuliwa kungondo! Wu, mbanga lepi tiwuya ku Misili?” <verse eid="NUM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4" />Hinu vakajovesana vene, “Hinu timuhagula chilongosi yungi, tiwuyayi ku Misili.”<verse eid="NUM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5" />Penapo ndi Musa na Aloni vakafugama palongolo ya Vaisilaeli voha. <verse eid="NUM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6" />Yoshua, mwana wa Nuni na Kalebu mwana wa Yefune vevavi pamonga na vandu vala vevahambali kuying'omesa ndima yila vakapapula nyula zavi zevawalili, <verse eid="NUM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:7" />na kuvajovela Vaisilaeli voha, “Ndima yetihamba kuying'omesa yabwina neju. <verse eid="NUM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8" />Ngati Bambu Chapanga iganiswa na tete, yati akutipeleka kwenuko na kutipela mulima wula wabwina kwa kugaba na kudimila mifuya. <verse eid="NUM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9" />Ndi mkoto kumbudila Chapanga mewa mkoto kuvayogopa vandu va mulima wenuwo. Muni yati tikuvahotala, vachapanga vavi vevakuvayunga vamali kuavaleka, nambu Chapanga avii pamonga na tete, mkoto kuyogopa. <verse eid="NUM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10" />Nambu vandu voha vaamwili kuvatova kwa maganga. lulanga lukahumila chighafula panani ya Lindanda la kukonganekela palongolo ya Vaisilaeli voha.”<verse eid="NUM 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa akuvayupila vandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 14:11" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa, “Ava vandu yati vakunivevesa mbaka ndali? Yati vibela kunisadika mbaka ndali, hati pamonga kuvya nihengili gachinamtiti pagati yavi. <verse eid="NUM 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 14:12" />Yati nikuvatova vene kwa matamu gahakahu na kuvayongomesa. Nambu veve yati nikukita kuvya mulima uvaha kuliku vene na kuvya na makakala kuliku vene.”<verse eid="NUM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 14:13" />Nambu Musa akamjovela Bambu Chapanga, “Wavawusili vandu ava kuhuma pamulima wa Misili kwa makakala gaku. Vamisili peviyuwana kuvya uvahengili genago vandu vaku, <verse eid="NUM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 14:14" />yati vakuvajovela vakolonjinji va mulima uwu. Vandu ava vamali kuyuwana kukuva veve, Bambu, uvi pamonga na tete, kangi Bambu ulolikini hotohoto lihundi laku peliyima panani. yitu, na veve ukutilongolela muhi kwa lipanda ya lihundi na kilu kwa lipanda ya lihundi la motu, <verse eid="NUM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 14:15" />Hinu ngati uvakomili vandu ava kwa mala monga, milima yeyiyuwini ulumba wa mambu gaku kukuvala veve yati vijova, <verse eid="NUM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 14:16" />‘Bambu mwene nakuhotola kuvapeleka vandu ava kumulima weavalagili kwa chilapu, ndi avakomili kulugangatu.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 14:17" />Hinu chondi nikuyupa, veve Bambu Chapanga, utilangisa uhotola waku kwa kuhenga ngati chila chewatilagazili pewajovili. <verse eid="NUM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 14:18" />‘Nene Bambu Chapanga nangali ligoga la kanyata, ndi mweavii na uganu na mweilekekesa mabudilu. Nambu ileka lepi kuvabuna vevahokili, akuvabuna vana ndava ya mabudilu ga vadadi vavi hati chiveleku cha datu na cha mcheche.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 14:19" />Chondi nikukuyupa uvalekekesa mabuidilu ga vandu ava, kuwanangana na uganu waku wangali mwishu ngati chila chewavalekekisi kutumbula pavahuma ku Misili mbaka hinu.”<verse eid="NUM 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 14:20" />Bambu akayangula, “Nivalekekekisi ngati cheuniyupili. <verse eid="NUM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 14:21" />Nambu chachakaka, ngati cheniyendelela kuvya, na ngati mulima woha chewimema ukulu wangu, <verse eid="NUM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 14:22" />kawaka hati mmonga mwisigalila, vandu venava vauwene ukulu wangu na gachinamtiti yenakili ku Misili kula nayanakitili kulugangatu, nambu vayendalili kunilinga kubela kuyidakila, <verse eid="NUM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 14:23" />yati viyingila lepi pamulima wenapili kuvapela vagogo vavi. Kawaka hati mmonga wavi vevanivevisi mwakuyiwona. <verse eid="NUM 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 14:24" />Nambu ndava mtumisi wangu Kalebu ana mtima wungi na akunilanda kwa mtima woha, yati nikumuyingisa mumlima wevihamba na chiveleku chaki yati vitalalila. <verse eid="NUM 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 14:25" />Ndava muni Vaamaleki na Vakanani vevitama ku makemba ga mulima wenuwo, chilau mun'ganamuka muhamba kulugangatu mbaka ku nyanja ya Shamu.”<verse eid="NUM 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bambu akuvabuna vandu ndava ya kuvembeneka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga akavakota Musa na Aloni, <verse eid="NUM 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27" />“Msambi uwu wa vandu vahakau yati viyendelela kunivembenekela mbaka ndali? Nitotokili kuyuwanila kuvembeneka kwa Vaisilaeli ndava yangu! <verse eid="NUM 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28" />Hinu uvayangula aga, ‘Ngati chenitama, nijova nene Bambu Chapanga, yati nikuvahengela galagala geniyuwini mukugajova. <verse eid="NUM 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29" />Kila mmonga winu mweavi na ntanga ya miyaka ishilini amala neju na mweavembeneki ndava yangu, higa zinu yati yitagwa palugangatu ulu, <verse eid="NUM 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30" />Kawaka hati mmonga winu mweiyingili pamulima wenilapili kuvya uvya winu, nga Kalebu mwana wa Yefune na Yoshua mwana wa Nuni ndu ndi veviyingila. <verse eid="NUM 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31" />Nambu vana vinu ndi mwmwajovili kuvya yati vikamuliwa kungondo, yati nikuvapeleka na kuvavika kwenuko muni vasangalukila mulima wula mwemwaubelili nyenye. <verse eid="NUM 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32" />Nyenye yati mwifwa mumumu mulugangatu. <verse eid="NUM 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 14:33" />Vana vinu ya vilyungalyunga na kung'aika kulugangatu lwenulu kwa miyaka alobaini, ndava ya kubela kusadika kwinu mbaka mundu winu wa mwishu peifwilila kulugangatu. <verse eid="NUM 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 14:34" />Ndava ya kubuda kwinu, yati mwing'aika kwa miyaka alobaini, kuwanangana na magono gala alobaini gemwahengili kuun'gomesa mulima wula, mwaka umonga kwa kila ligono limonga, yati mwimanya kuvya mniyomisi. <verse eid="NUM 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 14:35" />Nene Bambu Chapanga, chakaka yati nikuvahengela nyenye genago mwavoha mwemkonganiki penapa kunibela mwavoha yati mwifwilila mumu mulugagatu.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 14:36" />Kangi vandu voha Musa veavatumili kuhamba kuung'omesa mulima wula vavawuyili na kuvakita vandu vamng'ung'utila Bambu kwa kujova malovi gahakahuu kuuvala mulima wula, <verse eid="NUM 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 14:37" />vandu vala vevaletili malovi ga uhakau kuuvala mulima wula, vatoviwi kwa utamu na kufwa palongolo ya Bambu. <verse eid="NUM 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 14:38" />Nambu Yoshua mwana wa Nuni na Kalebu mwana wa Yefune, vene ndu ndi vevasigalili pagati ya vandu vala vevahambili kuung'omesa mulima wula.<verse eid="NUM 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utumbula wa Vaisilaeli kulinga kuuzangila mulima</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:41-46">Ukumb 1:41-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 14:39" />Musa peavajovili Vaisilaeli voha vene vakavembeneka kwa mvinisu wamahele. <verse eid="NUM 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 14:40" />Chilau yaki, vayumwiki lukela pehe vakahamba kuvitumbi, vakajova, “Tiyidakila kuvya tambudili Bambu.”<verse eid="NUM 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 14:41" />Nambu Musa akajova, “Ndava kyani mwangayidakila mihilu ya Bambu Chapanga? Lijambu lenili yati lihotoleka lepi! <verse eid="NUM 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 14:42" />Mkotoka kuhamba kuvitumbi ndava muni Bambu Chapanga avi lepi na nyenye. Yati mukuvahotola lepi makoko vinu, <verse eid="NUM 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 14:43" />Mukatovana navu Vaamaleki na Vakanaani, yati mwifwila kungondo, ndava muni mulekili kumlanda Bambu Chapanga, mwene yati ivya lepi pamonga na nyenye.”<verse eid="NUM 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 14:44" />Pamonga na ago, kwa ndindani yavi vakakwela kuhamba mulima wa vitumbi, nambu Musa awukili lepi pamonga na Lisanduku la Lilaganu la Bambu Chapanga lapelikwi lepi. <verse eid="NUM 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 14:45" />Kangi Vaamaleki na Vakanaani, vevatamayi kumulima wenuwo wa vidunda, vakahelela vakavazangila na kuvahotola. Vakavavingisana mbaka kumuji wa Holima.<verse eid="NUM 14:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="NUM 15" />
  <para style="s">Malagizu ndava ya luteta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 15:1" />Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 15:2" />“Uvajovela vana va Isilaeli kuvya pemuyingila kumulima wenikuvapela muni mutamayi mwenumo, <verse eid="NUM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 15:3" />mkaniwusila nene Bambu Chapanga luteta kuhuma mumifuya yinu, luteta lwa kutinyisa, zivya luteta lwa kukita unungalila bwina wa kuniganisa nene Bambu Chapanga. Muni mundu atimilisa nazili yaki amala kuwusa luteta kwa kugana mwene amala luteta lukumbi lwa miselebuko yinu yeyivikiwi, <verse eid="NUM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 15:4" />hinu mweiwusa luteta lwaki, mewa yati akumletela luteta lwa uhembe nyilili kilo yimonga weuhangisinwi na yimonga lita yimonga ga zeituni. <verse eid="NUM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 15:5" />Pamonga na divayi ya luteta lwa mnyweso lita yimonga, vindu vyenivyo yati viwusiwa pamonga na hinyama ya luteta lwa kutinyiswa, limbelele amala mene. <verse eid="NUM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 15:6" />Lukumbi lwa kuwusa luteta lwa limbelele ligosi, kilo zivili za uhembe weukandiwi na lita yimonga na yapinga ya mahuta ga zeituni yati viwusiwa muni luvya luteta lwa uhembe, <verse eid="NUM 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 15:7" />pamonga na luteta lwa mnyweso lita yimonga na ya yapinga ya divayi, na kuvya unungalila wa bwina wa kumganisa Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 15:8" />Lukumbi peukumuwusila Bambu Chapanga ng'ombi yigosi ndava ya luteta lwa kutinyiswa muni kutimilisa nazili amala ukumuwusa ndava ya luteta lwa uteke, <verse eid="NUM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 15:9" />mundu yati akuyiwusa ng'ombi yigosi kuvya luteta pamonga na uhembe kilo zidatu weuvi bwina na lita zivili za mahuta ga zeituni, <verse eid="NUM 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 15:10" />pamonga na luteta lwa mnyweso lita zivili za divayi. Luteta lwenulo lwa kutinyiswa yati lukita unungalila wa bwina wa kumganisa Bambu Chapanga.<verse eid="NUM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 15:11" />Vyenivyo ndi vyeviwusiwa pamonga na kila ng'ombi yigosi amala limbelele ligosi amala mene yigosi yati vitendekewa kwa namuna iyi. <verse eid="NUM 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 15:12" />Kila chinyama chechiwusiwa luteta, chiganikiwa chiwusiwayi pamonga na vindu vyenivyo vyevilagiswi. <verse eid="NUM 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 15:13" />Mkolonjinji yeyoha wa Isilaeli yati ilanda malagizu aga lukumbi peiwusa luteta lwa kutinyiswa kwa motu, kuvya unungalila wabwina lwelukumganisa Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 15:14" />Kwa viveleku vyevibwela, lukumbi lwolwoha myehe amala mundu yoyoha mweitama pamonga na nyenye peileta luteta lwa kutinyisa kwa motu ngati unungalila bwina lwa kumganisa Bambu Chapanga, ndi iganikiwa akitayi chilachila chemwikita nyenye. <verse eid="NUM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 15:15" />Vandu voha yati vivya na malagizu genago kwinu na kwa myehe mweitama pamonga na nyenye, yeniyi ndi muhilu ya kusindimala kwa viveleku vyevibwela. Palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga nyenye Vaisilaeli na vayehe yati mwilingana. <verse eid="NUM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 15:16" />Mhilu yeniyo na malagizu genago, yati gakuvavala nyenye pamonga na myehe mweitama pagati yinu.”<verse eid="NUM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 15:17" />Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 15:18" />“Vajovela, Vaisilaeli pemwiyingila pamulima wenukuvapeleka, <verse eid="NUM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 15:19" />kila pemwilya chakulya kuhuma mumlima wenuo, yati mwibagula lilundu la chakulya chenicho na kunipela nene Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 15:20" />Pemwiyocha mabumunda, libumunda la kutumbula la uhembe winu wa kutumbula yati liwusiwa kuvya luteta kuhuma pandu pa kubulila mabenu. <verse eid="NUM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 15:21" />Yati mukuniwusila nene Bambu Chapanga luteta ulu lwa kutumbula kwa viveleku vyinu vyoha vyevibwela.”<verse eid="NUM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 15:22" />Nambu ngati mmonga winu yati ihotola lepi kulanda goha nene Bambu Chapanga genimpelili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 15:23" />ngati magono gegibwela vandu yati vilanda lepi goha nene Bambu Chapanga genimlagizi Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 15:24" />hinu ngati libudili lenilo likitiki changali kumanya, changali vandu voha kumanya, ndi vandu voha yati viwusa ng'ombi yigosi yeyangakangala neju kuvya luteta lwa kutinyiswa, kuvya unungalila wabwina wa kumganisa Bambu Chapanga, pamonga na luteta lwaki lwa uhembe na ya mnyweso kulandana na malagizu gaki. Mewawa vandu vawusa lipongo limonga kuvya luteta lwa kuwusa kubuda. <verse eid="NUM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 15:25" />Mteta wa Chapanga yati ikita utepulanisa ndava ya vandu voha va Isilaeli na vene yati vilekekeswa ndava vamanyili lepi, na vene vamletili Bambu ndava ya kubuda kwavi luteta lwelutinyiswi kwa motu na luteta lwa kuwusa kubuda. <verse eid="NUM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 15:26" />Vandu voha wa Vaisilaeli, pamonga na vayehe vevitama nawu, yati vilekekeswa ndava voha vavalangiwi libudilu lenilo.<verse eid="NUM 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 15:27" />“Nambu mundu mmonga akabuda changali kumanya, yati iwusa mene yidala ya mwaka umonga kuvya luteta lwa kulekekesa kubumbudila Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 15:28" />Mteta wa Chapanga yati ikita utepulaniso palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga, ndava ya mundu mwenuyo mweabudili changali kumanya, mewa mwene yati ilekekeswa. <verse eid="NUM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 15:29" />Yati mwilanda malagizu gamonga kila mmonga winu mweibuda changamanya, avya mkolonjinji wa Isilaeli amala myehe mweitama pamonga na nyenye.”<verse eid="NUM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 15:30" />“Nambu mundu yeyoha mweabudili kwa kugana mwene, avya mkolonjinji wa Isilaeli amala myehe, mwenuyo akumliga Bambu Chapanga, ndi yiganikiwa mundu mwenuyo akomiwa. <verse eid="NUM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 15:31" />Ndava alivevisi linenu la Bambu Chapanga na kuleka kuliyidakila mihilu yaki, mundu mwenuyo chakaka yiganikiwa akomiwa na chechihumila chivya chaki.”<verse eid="NUM 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kube kuyidakila ligono la kupumulila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 15:32" />Ligono limonga, lukumbi Vaisilaeli pevavili kulugangatu, vamuwene mundu mmonga itinya sagala Ligono la Kupumulila. <verse eid="NUM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 15:33" />Vala vevamkolili itinya sagala vakamleta kwa Musa na Aloni na palongolo ya vandu voha, <verse eid="NUM 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 15:34" />vene vakamvika muchifungu, muni vamanyili lepi vamukitila kyani mundu mwenuyo. <verse eid="NUM 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 15:35" />Ndi Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa, “Mundu mwenuyo yiganikiwa akomiwa, mundu mwenuyo yati ikomiwa kwa maganga kuvala ya kambi. <verse eid="NUM 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 15:36" />Ndava ya chenicho vandu voha vakamuhumisa kuvala ya kambi na kumtova maganga mbaka kufwa.”<verse eid="NUM 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vihundu vya wuzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 15:37" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 15:38" />“Uvajovela Vaisilaeli, vajikitila vifundu vya wuzi vyevilembela muvigunyilu vya yula zavi, kila chifundu chivya na wuzi wa buluu panani ya kila chifundu. Uvajovela vakita chenicho muviveleku vyavi vyoha vyevibwela. <verse eid="NUM 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 15:39" />Vifundu vya wuzi vyenivyo yati vivya ukumbuso kwinu. Pala pemwikuvilola, yati mkuyikumbuka mihilu yangu yoha na kuzilanda, muni mkoto kulanda gemukugagana mwavene na gala gemkugalola kwa mihu ginu. <verse eid="NUM 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 15:40" />Ndi yati mukuyikumbuka mihilu yangu yoha na nyenye yati mwivya vandu vangu njwee. <verse eid="NUM 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 15:41" />Nene ndi Bambu Chapanga winu, mwenavawusili kuhuma ku Misili nivya Chapanga winu. Nene ndi Bambu Chapanga winu.”<verse eid="NUM 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="NUM 16" />
  <para style="s">Kola na Dasani na Abilamu vibela kuyidakila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 16:1" />Hinu Kola mwana wa Ishali, mwana wa Kohati kuhuma mulikabila la Lawi, pamonga na Valeubeni, yaani Dasani na Abilamu vana va Eliabu na Oni mwana wa Palesi vakavatola vandu ndalindali, <verse eid="NUM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 16:2" />vakabela kumyidakila Musa. Vachilongosi vevimanyikana neju miya zivili na hamusini vevahaguliwi na vandu voha na vene vakawungana na vakina Kola. <verse eid="NUM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 16:3" />Vakakonganeka palongolo ya Musa na Aloni, vakavajovela, “Nyenye mkujikwihili neju! Vandu voha ava ndi va Bambu, na Bambu Chapanga avii pamonga na tavoha. Ndava kyani nyenye muvya panani ya vandu va Bambu Chapanga?”<verse eid="NUM 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 16:4" />Musa peayuwini malovi ago, akafugama akayupa. <verse eid="NUM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 16:5" />Kangi akamjovela Kola na valanda vaki voha, “Chilau lukela, Bambu Chapanga yati ilangisa ndi yani mweavi waki na yani mweavi wa Msopi, yula mweakumhagula yati akumkita kuhegelela papipi na nene. <verse eid="NUM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 16:6" />Hinu, mkita aga, chilau lukela veve pamonga na valanda vaku voha, mtola lumbani, <verse eid="NUM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 16:7" />muvika makalakala ga motu na kusopa ubani panani yaki, kangi yati mukuvipeleka palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga. Ndi yati tilola kuvya yani mweahaguliwi na Bambu Chapanga ndi yati ivya mteta, nyenye Valawi mujikwihili neju!”<verse eid="NUM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 16:8" />Musa akamjovela Kola. “Myuwanila, nyenye vana va Lawi! <verse eid="NUM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 16:9" />Wu! Lijambu lenili kwinu mwilola kuvya lidebe, kuvya Chapanga wa Isilaeli avabagwili nyenye na vandu voha va Isilaeli, muni apata kuvahegelesa kwaki, muni mhenga utumisi wa Lindanda la Bambu Chapanga, na kuyima palongolo ya vandu voha na kuvahengela? <verse eid="NUM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 16:10" />Avapeli utopesa wa kumuhengela mu Lindanda laki, nyenye pamonga na Valawi vayinu voha. Hinu mwigana kutola na uteta wa Chapanga? <verse eid="NUM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 16:11" />Ndava yeniyo veve na msambi waku mukumbela Bambu Chapanga. Nyenye mukumvembenekela Aloni, nambu chakaka ndi kuvya mukumvembenekela Chapanga.”<verse eid="NUM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 16:12" />Kangi Musa avakemili Dasani na Abilamu, vana va Eliabu. Nambu vene vakajova, “Tete tibwela lepi! <verse eid="NUM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 16:13" />Wu, ndi lijambu lidebe, kuvya utiwusili ku Misili, mulima wabwina kwa kugana na kudimila mifuya, muni ubwela kutikoma kulugangatu? Kangi, ukujikita wamkulu witu! <verse eid="NUM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 16:14" />Neju ya ago, utiletili lepi ku mulima wabwina kwa kugaba na kudimila mifuya, mewa utipeli lepi uhali wa migunda na migunda ya mizabibu. wiholalela yati ukuvakita vandu ava kuvya ngalola? Pehe, tete tibwela lepi!”<verse eid="NUM 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 16:15" />Ndi Musa akayoma neju na kumjovela Bambu Chapanga, “Kotoka kuyidakila teta zavi. Nene natolili lepi chindu chochoa, hati lipunda limonga kuhuma kwavi, mewa nimbudili lepi hati mmonga wavi.”<verse eid="NUM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 16:16" />Musa amjovili Kola, “Chilau mbwela pamonga na valanda vaku voha palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga. Mewa Aloni yati ivya. <verse eid="NUM 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 16:17" />Kila mundu yati igega lumbani lwaki na kusopa ubani, lumbani zoha yati zivya jumula miya zivili na hamusini na kuleta palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga. Veve na Aloni mewa yati mwileta lumbani zinu.” <verse eid="NUM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 16:18" />Ndava yeniyo kila mundu yati ileta lumbani lwaki, yati isopa motu na ubani mugati yaki, na kuyima pamonga na Musa na Aloni pamlyangu wa Lindanda la mngonganu. <verse eid="NUM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 16:19" />Kangi Kola peavakonganisi pamonga valanda vaki voha kumbela Musa na Aloni pamlyangu wa Lindanda la mngonganu, lumuli lwa Bambu Chapanga ukahumila kwa vandu voha. <verse eid="NUM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 16:20" />Penapo Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa na Aloni, <verse eid="NUM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 16:21" />“Mjibagula na vandu venava muni nivayongomesa kanyata.”<verse eid="NUM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 16:22" />Nambu Musa na Aloni vakafugama na kuyinama mbaka pahi, vakajova, “Veve Chapanga, Chapanga mweukuvapela vandu wumi, yati wivya na ligoga na vandu ava voha lukumbi ndi mundu mmonga ndu mweakubudili?”<verse eid="NUM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 16:23" />Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 16:24" />“Muvajovela vandu vawuka papipi na mandanda ga Kola na Dasani na Abilamu.”<verse eid="NUM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 16:25" />Hinu, Musa akahamba kwa Datani na Abilamu, kuni alongosini na vachilongosi va Isilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 16:26" />Peahikili, akavajovela vandu, “Chondi muwuka pamandanda ga vandu ava vahakau na mkotoka kupamisa chindu chavi chochoa, muni mkoto kuyongomeswa pamonga navu ndava ya kubuda kwavi.” <verse eid="NUM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 16:27" />Vandu vawukili mumandanda ga Kola na Datani na Abilamu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 16:27">Datani na Abilamu vahumili mumandanda na kuyima pamlyangu kuni valongosini na vadala vavi na vana vavi voha hati vala vevinyong'a.<verse eid="NUM 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 16:28" />Ndi Musa akajova, “Chenichi ndi chemwimanya kuvya Bambu Chapanga ndi anitumili kukita mambu aga, wala gavi lepi maholo gangu. <verse eid="NUM 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 16:29" />Ngati vandu ava vakafwayi chifwa cha uyovelu ngati vandu vangi chevifwa amala kukolewa na gahakau gauyovelu gegakuvakolela vandu, ndi mumanya Bambu Chapanga anitumili lepi nene. <verse eid="NUM 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 16:30" />Nambu ngati Bambu Chapanga akakitayi lijambu lila lamupya njwee, ndima yikagubuka na kuvamila vandu ava pamonga na vindu vyavi vakahamba pandu pa vandu vevafwili kuni vakona mumi, hinu yati mwimanya kuvya vandu ava vamvevisi Bambu Chapanga.”<verse eid="NUM 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 16:31" />Bahapo ndu peamali kujova malovi ago goha, ndima yevayimili yila yikagubuka ngati mulomo, <verse eid="NUM 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 16:32" />na kuvamila vandu avo, valongo vavi pamonga na valanda voha va Kola na vindu vyavi vyoha. <verse eid="NUM 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 16:33" />Hinu, vene pamonga na vindu vyoha vakahelela mulitinda kuni vakona mumi. Ndima yikajigubika panani yavi, voha vakayaga. <verse eid="NUM 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 16:34" />Vaisilaeli vangi voha vevavi mumuhana pevayuwini chivembu chavi vatilili kuni vijova, “Titilayi, ndima yikoto kutimila mewa na tete.”<verse eid="NUM 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 16:35" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga apelikili motu wavatinyisi vala vandu miya zivili na hamusini vevahukisa ubani.<verse eid="NUM 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvala milumbani vya vandu vevabudili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 16:36" />Pegamaliki genago, Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 16:37" />“Mjovela Eliazali mwana wa Aloni mteta awusa lumbani pamasigalilu ga motu, na kudandasa kutali motu weuvili mugati, ndava milumbani zenizo ndi vya Msopi, <verse eid="NUM 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 16:38" />milumbani ya vandu vevabudili na kuyokisa wumi wavi. Kita lufumbu lumbani zenizo zivya ngalingasi muni vihotola kugubika pandu pa kuwusila teta, muni viletiwi palongolo ya Bambu na vivii vyamusopi. Na vyene vivyayi ulangisu kwa Vaisilaeli.” <verse eid="NUM 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 16:39" />Hinu Mteta Eliazali avitolili vimbani vyenivyo vya shaba vila vyevyaletiwi palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga, na vandu vala vevayongomiswi na vikitiwi lufumbu kugubika pandu pa kuwusila teta, <verse eid="NUM 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 16:40" />ngati chila Bambu cheamukokosili Eliazali kupitila Musa. Lenili lavii hakalilu kwa Vaisilaeli kuvya mundu yeyo mweangavya mteta, ndi angavya wa lukolo lwa Aloni akoto kuhamba kupandu pa kuwusila teta kumhukisila Bambu Chapanga ubani. Ngati lepi yati iyongomeswa ngati Kola na vamlanda vaki.<verse eid="NUM 16:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aloni akuvasangula vandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 16:41" />Lukela lwaki, Vaisilaeli voha vamuvembenikili Musa na Aloni kuni vijova, “Muvakomili vandu va Bambu Chapanga.” <verse eid="NUM 16:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 16:42" />Pevakonganiki palongolo ya Musa na Aloni ndava ya kujova mvembeneku wavi vakahamba ku Lindanda la kukonganekela, ndi vawene lihundi ligubiki Lindanda na lumuli lwa Bambu Chapanga wahumalili penapo. <verse eid="NUM 16:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 16:43" />Musa na Aloni vakahamba na kuyima palongolo ya Lindanda la kukonganekela, <verse eid="NUM 16:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 16:44" />kangi Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 16:45" />“Jivika kutali na vandu ava, nivayongomesa hinu naha!” Nambu vene vakafugama na kuyupa.<verse eid="NUM 16:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 16:46" />Musa amjovili Aloni, “Utola lumbani lwaku, sopa makalakala ga motu kuhuma pandu pa kuwusila teta, kangi usopa ubani na uhamba nachu kanyata kwa vandu na kuvakitala utepulanisi. Kita kanyata! Ligoga la Bambu Chapanga limali kuvahikila na utamu uhakahu umali kuvahikila.” <verse eid="NUM 16:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 16:47" />Hinu, Aloni ahengili ngati Musa cheamjovili. Atolili lumbani lwaki na kujumba mbaka pagati ya vandu. Peawene litovelu limali kutumbula, asopili ubani mulumbani na kuvakitila vandu utepulanisa. <verse eid="NUM 16:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 16:48" />Peakitili chenicho litovelu likaguna balapala na mwene akasigalila ayimipagati ya vevavii mumi na vevafwili, na litovelu likaguna. <verse eid="NUM 16:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 16:49" />Mvalangu wa vandu vevafwili kwa litovelu lila yavi elufu kumi na mcheche na miya saba changali kuvalanga vala vevafwili ku uhakahu wa Kola. <verse eid="NUM 16:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 16:50" />Litovelu pelakotwiki, Aloni awuyili kwa Musa kumlyangu wula wa Lindanda la Mngonganu.<verse eid="NUM 16:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="NUM 17" />
  <para style="s">Ndonga ya Aloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 17:1" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 17:2" />“Vajovela Vaisilaeli vakuletela ndonga kumi na zivili, kuhuma kwa kila chilongosi wa likabila ndonga yimonga. Uyandika liina la kila mundu mundonga yaki, <verse eid="NUM 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 17:3" />Pandonga ya likabila la Lawi yandika liina la Aloni, ndava muni ndi yiganikiwa kuvya na ndonga yimonga kwa kila chilongosi ndava ya kila chilongosi wa likabila. <verse eid="NUM 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 17:4" />Na veve uzitola ndonga zenizo na ukazivika ku Lindanda la mngonganu palongolo ya Lisanduku la Lilaganu, pandu pala nene panikonganeka navu. <verse eid="NUM 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 17:5" />Ndonga ya mundu mwenikumhagula yati yitupula mahamba. Ndava yeniyo yati nikuvakita Vaisilaeli valeka kuvembeneka ndava yinu.”<verse eid="NUM 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 17:6" />Hinu Musa akalongela na vandu va Isilaeli. Vachilongosi wavi woha vakampela kila mmonga ndonga kuwanangana na liakabila laki jumula zikavya ndonga kumi na zivili. Mewa ndonga ya Aloni yavikiwi pamonga na ndonga zenizo. <verse eid="NUM 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 17:7" />Kangi Musa akazivika ndonga zenizo palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga pa Lindanda la kukonganekela.<verse eid="NUM 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 17:8" />Chilau yaki lukela, Musa ahambili ku Lindanda la mngonganu. Mwenumo, akolili ndonga ya Aloni wa likabila la Lawi, yimelili na kuvika vimelesi vyevyahumisi maluva na kubaba matunda gegahundili ga mlozi. <verse eid="NUM 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 17:9" />Ndi Musa akazihumisa ndonga zoha. Akavalangisa Vaisilaeli voha, vakalola chechihumalili na kila chilongosi akatola ndonga yaki. <verse eid="NUM 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 17:10" />Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa “Wuyisa ndonga ya Aloni palongolo ya lisanduku la lilaganu. Yeniyo yati yivikiwa pandu apo, na ndi uhakalilu kwa vala vevakunibela ngati vileka lepi kunivembenekela yati vifwa.” <verse eid="NUM 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 17:11" />Musa akitili ngati Bambu Chapanga cheamulagizi.<verse eid="NUM 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 17:12" />Kangi vana va Isilaeli vakalongela na Musa, na kumjovela, “Lola tete tifwa, tiyongomela, tavoha timaliki. <verse eid="NUM 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 17:13" />Yoyoha mwaihegelela pa Lindanda la Bambu iganikiwa afwayi. Wu, tete tavoha yati tifwa!”<verse eid="NUM 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="NUM 18" />
  <para style="s">Lihengu la vamteta na Valawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 18:1" />Hinu Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Aloni, “mabudilu goha kuvala lihengu la Lindanda lakukonganekela yati zivya kukuvala veve na vana vaku na lukolo lwaku, mewawa mabudanu gegilandana na uteta waku veve gakukuvala wamwene na vana vaku. <verse eid="NUM 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 18:2" />Valeta Valawi vayako kuhuma mu likabila la vadadi vaku muni vawunganayi na nyenye na kuvatangatila lukumbi veve na vana vaku na viveleku vyaku vyoha pemuhengela Lindanda la kukonganekela. <verse eid="NUM 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 18:3" />Vene yati vihenga lihengu leukuvapela na kutimilisa mahengu gavi kuvala Lindanda. Nambu viganikiwa lepi kupamisa vindu vya Lindanda, amala kuhegelela pandu pa kuwusila teta, muni vene na nyenye mkoto kufwa. <verse eid="NUM 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 18:4" />Vene yati vivya pamonga na veve palihengu na kutimilisa mahengu gavi chikamilifu kuvala mahengu goha ga Lindanda, ndi pakoto kuvya na mundu yungi mweihegelela mwenumo. <verse eid="NUM 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 18:5" />Veve na vana vaku ndu ndi yati mwikita mahengu ga pandu pa Msopi na pa pandu pa kuwusila teta, muni ligoga langu likoto kuvahumila kangi Vaisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 18:6" />Ndi nene namwene nivahagwili valongo vinu Valawi pagati ya Vaisilaeli ngati njombi kwinu. Vene ndi vabaguliwi ndava yangu nene Bambu Chapanga, muni vahenga lihengu Pa Lindanda la Kukonganekela. <verse eid="NUM 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 18:7" />Nambu ndi veve na vana vaku ndu ndi yati mwihenga mahengu goha ga uteta ndava ya pandu pa kuwusila teta na goha gegavi pandu Pa Msopi neju. Genago ndi mahengu ginu, ndava nikuvapela chipanji cha uteta. Mundu yeyoha angaganikiwa kuhegelela vindu vya Lindanda, yati ikomiwa.”<verse eid="NUM 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gegiganikiwa kupewa vamteta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 18:8" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Aloni, “Nikukupela vindu vyoha vyevawusili Vaisilaeli kuvya luteta kwa nene, vindu vyoha vyevanipelili Vaisilaeli vivya vya nene ndi nikukupela veve na viveleku vyaku vivya vinu mu wumi winu woha. <verse eid="NUM 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 18:9" />Vindu vya Msopi neju vyeviwusiwa muni vikotoka kutinyiswa pamotu, vyenivi yati vivya vinu, Teta za uhembe, teta za kulekekesa kubuda na teta za kuwusa nazili na vilapu. Kila chindu vandu chevawusili ngati luteta lwa Msopi yati chivya chaku na vana vaku. <verse eid="NUM 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 18:10" />Yati mwilya vindu vyenivyo ngati vindu Vya Msopi neju, ndi vagosi ndu ndi vevilya, vindu vyenivyo vya Msopi yaani muvilola ngati vindu vyeviwusiwi kwa nene.”<verse eid="NUM 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 18:11" />“Mewa vindu vingi vyoha vyevakunipela Vaisilaeli ngati teta za kuyinuliwa, yati vivya vyaku. Yati nikupela veve na vana vaku na vasikana vaku kuvya vinu magono goha. Mundu yoyoha mulukolo lwaku angali kuvya mhakasa ihotola kulya.”<verse eid="NUM 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 18:12" />“Nikupela vindu vyoha vyabwina vyevihuma muluteta vya malimbuku vyevakuniwusila Vaisilaeli, Mahuta ga zeituni na divayi na uhembe. <verse eid="NUM 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 18:13" />Malimbuko goha ga pamulima ga migunda yavi gala gevakuniletela nene, yati givya gaku. Kila mundu angahakala mulukolo lwaku ihotola kulya.”<verse eid="NUM 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 18:14" />Neju ya genago chindu chochoa chechivikiwi ndava ya Bambu Chapanga pamulima wa Isilaeli yati chivya chinu.<verse eid="NUM 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 18:15" />“Mvelekewa yoyoha wa kutumbula wa Vaisilaeli yikavya mundu amala wa chinyama mwevaniwusili Bambu yati ivya waku. Nambu Vaisilaeli viganikiwa kuvagombola kila mvelekewa wa kutumbula wa mundu na kila mvelekewa wa kutumbula wa chinyama mweangayidakiliwa kwa Bambu. <verse eid="NUM 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 18:16" />Vavelekewa venavo va kutumbula yati vigombolewa kuni vavi na ntanga ya mwehi umonga kwa kulipiwa mashonga shekeli mhanu, kuwanangana na vipimu vya Lindanda la kukonganekela. <verse eid="NUM 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 18:17" />Nambu vavelekewa va kutumbula va ng'ombi na limbelele na mene vakoto kugombolewa, vyenivyo ndi vya Chapanga. Ngasi yavi yati unyunyusila pandu pa kuwusila teta na mahuta gavi yati ukugayocha kuvya luteta lwa kutinyiswa genago givya unungalila wabwina weukuniganisa nene Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 18:18" />Nyama zavi muhotola kulya, ngati chemuhotola kulya nganga na liwondo la chigendelu cha mumbele cha kulyela vyeviwusiwi ndava ya luteta lwa kuyinuliwa.”<verse eid="NUM 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 18:19" />“Nikukupela veve na vasongolo vaku na vasikana vaku, vindu vyoha vila vandu va Isilaeli vakuniwusila, vyenivyo ndi vinu magono goha. Lenili ndi lilaganu langu la magono goha ngali na mwisu lenivika ndava yaku na vachiveleku vaku.”<verse eid="NUM 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 18:20" />Bambu Chapanga amjovili Aloni, “Veve yati upewa lepi ndima yivya yaku pamulima wa Isilaeli, na ndi mwenikupela chewigana, nene ndi Bambu Chapanga.”<verse eid="NUM 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vyeviganikiwa kupewa Valawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 18:21" />“Bambu Chapanga akajova, ndava ya Valawi venevo nivapelili lilundu limonga pagati ya kumi goha gala Vaisilaeli vakuniwusila kuvya gavi. Genaga yati givya luhuna lwa mahengu gevihenga kuliyangalila Linanda langu la Mngonganu. <verse eid="NUM 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 18:22" />Tangia hinu, vandu va Isilaeli vakoto kulihegelela Lindanda ngati lepi yati vakunibudila na kujiletela lifwa. <verse eid="NUM 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 18:23" />Nambu Valawi vene ndi vevihenga lihengu ku Lindanda la kukonganekela, na kuliyangali bwina panani yaki na mambu gakahalibikayi vene yati vikotwa. lenili ndi lilagizu la magono goha muviveleku vyinu vyoha. Valawi yati vivya lepi na vindu vyevivya vyavi vene pamulima wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 18:24" />Ndava lilundu limonga pagati ya kumi zevakuniwusila Vaisilaeli nivapeli vene vivya vyavi. Ndi muni nijovili kuvya Valawi yati vya lepi na ndima yakwavi vene.”<verse eid="NUM 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilundu limonga pagati ya kumi ya Valawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 18:25" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 18:26" />“Kangi yati ukuvajovela Valawi malagizu aga, lukumbi pemwipokela lilundu limonga pagati ya kumi gala Bambu Chapanga geavapeli kuhuma kw Vaisilaeli gavya gavi, yati mukuiniwusila nene Bambu Chapanga pandu pamonga palilundu limonga pagati ya kumi. <verse eid="NUM 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 18:27" />Teta yeniyo yati yiyidakiliwa kuvya yiwanangana na malimbuku ga mabenu amala zabibu zeakuniwusila mlimaji. <verse eid="NUM 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 18:28" />Hinu ndi chemukuniwusila nene Bambu Chapanga teta za lilundu limonga pagati ya kumi zemupokela kuhuma kwa Vaisilaeli. Lilundu limonga pagati ya kumi zemukuniwusila nene Bambu Chapanga yati mukumpela mteta wa Aloni. <verse eid="NUM 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 18:29" />Mganikiwa kuwusa pandu pa Bambu Chapanga pepavi pabwina neju kavili lilundu limonga pagati ya kumi mukila chamupewa. <verse eid="NUM 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 18:30" />Ndava yeniyo yati ukuvajovela, Mkamala kuniwusila lilundu limonga pagati ya kumi lelivibwina kuliku zoha, lilundu lelisigalila yati pivya pinu ngati cheyivi kwa mlimaji yula mweitola chechisigalila peamali kuwusa luteta lwaki lwa mabenu ga kutumbula uhembe na divayi. <verse eid="NUM 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 18:31" />Nyenye na vandu va kunyumba yinu muhotola kulya pepasigalili pandu popoha pala, lwenulu ndi luhuna lwinu ndava ya mahengu ginu pa Lindanda la mngonganu. <verse eid="NUM 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 18:32" />Yati mwivya lepi na uhakau wowoha mwakalya vindu vyenivyo, ngati mumuwusili Bambu Chapanga lilundu lelivii labwina kuliku poha, nyenye yati mukita vindu vyenivyo vya Vaisilaeli nivabela na yati mwifwa lepi.”<verse eid="NUM 18:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="NUM 19" />
  <para style="s">Malyenge ga ng'ombi yidala yidung'u</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 19:1" />Bambu Chapanga ayendalili kuvajovela Musa na Aloni, <verse eid="NUM 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 19:2" />Mihilu yenikuvapela nene Bambu Chapanga yigana naha. Vajovela Vaisilaeli vavaletela ng'ombi yidala yidung'u mwangali chilema amala livamba loloha, na yula mweangahenga lihengu loloha. <verse eid="NUM 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 19:3" />Nyenye yati mukumpela mteta Eliazali ng'ombi yeniyo. Yati iwusiwa kuvala ya kambi na kuhijwa palongolo ya mwenuyo mteta wa Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 19:4" />Kangi mteta Eliazali yati itola ngasi na kunyunyusila kwa lung'onji lwaki mala saba, kuyelekela upandi wa kulongolo wa Lindanda la kukonganekela. <verse eid="NUM 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 19:5" />Ng'ombi yeniyo yati yitinyiswa yoha kwa motu palongolo ya Mteta wa Chapanga. Vindu vyaki vyoha yati vitinyiswa, chikumba na ngasi na nyama na matumbu gaki. <verse eid="NUM 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 19:6" />Kangi Mteta wa Chapanga yati itola sagala za mkongo wa mwelezi na husopo na nyuzi yidungu za manyoya ga limbelele na kuvivika pamotu wenuwo. <verse eid="NUM 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 19:7" />Pegimalika genago, ndi yikumgana Mteta mwenuyo kuchapa nyula zaki na kusamba higa, kangi ndi ihotola kuwuya pakambi, nambu yati ivya iyidakiliwa lepi na Bambu mbaka kimii. <verse eid="NUM 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 19:8" />Mundu mweakuyiyocha ng'ombi yula mewa yikumgana kuchapa nyula zaki na kusamba higa yaki, mewa mwene yati ivya angaganikiwa na Bambu mbaka kimii. <verse eid="NUM 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 19:9" />Mundu mweiyidakiliwa na Bambu ndi yati iyola malyenge ga ng'ombi yeniyo na kugapeleka pandu pepabaguliwi kuvala ya kambi yati givikiwa na kutumiwa na vandu voha va Isilaeli kutengenezela manji ga kuwusa kubela kuyidakiliwa kwavi, muni kuwusa kumbudila Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 19:10" />Mundu yula mweiyola malyenge yikumgana kuchapa nyula zaki, na mwene mewa yati ivya mweangaganikiwa nmukuyupa mbaka kimii. Lilagizu lenili ndi la magono goha ndi yati likuvavala Vaisilaeli na vandu vayehe vevitama pamonga nawu.<verse eid="NUM 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mihilu kuvala kupamisa mundu mweafwili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 19:11" />“Mundu akapamisa higa ya mundu yeyoha mweafwili yati ivya angayidakiliwa kwa kuyupa mu magono saba. <verse eid="NUM 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 19:12" />Ndi yikumgana ajinyambisa mwene kwa manji ga unyambiso paligono la datu na ligono la saba ndi yati iyidakiliwa mu kuyupa. Nambu ngati ajinyambisi lepi mwene paligono la datu na la saba ndi yati iyendelela kube kuyidakiliwa mukuyupa. <verse eid="NUM 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 19:13" />Mweipamisa higa ya mundu mweafwili ngati ajinyambisi lepi ndi ikita Bambu Chapanga alibela Lindanda lenilo, mwene mewa yati ibaguliwa na vandu va Isilaeli. Mundu mwenuyo yati iyendalela kubela kuyidakiliwa mu kuyupa muni ayitaliwi lepi manji ga unyambiso.”<verse eid="NUM 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 19:14" />“Wenuwu ndi muhilu kuvala mundu mweafwili mu Lindanda, mundu yeyoha mweiyingila mugati ya Lindanda lenilo, amala mweavi mugati ya Lindanda lenilo, yati ivya mweangayidakiliwa mu kuyupa kwa magono saba. <verse eid="NUM 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 19:15" />Chombo chochoha changagubikwa yati chivya changayidakiliwa. <verse eid="NUM 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 19:16" />Mundu yeyoha akapamisa higa ya mundu mweakomiwi amala mweafwili lifwa la uyovalela kumgunda, amala mundu yoyoha akapamisa lihupa la mundu mwafwili amala litinda yati ivya mweangayidakiliwa mu kuyupa kwa magono saba.”<verse eid="NUM 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 19:17" />“Ndava ya kuwusa uko kubelelewa mu kuyupa, yati vitola malyenge ga teta wa unyambiso wa kumbudila Chapanga gegatinyiswi, malyenge ago yati gihangisanwa na manji ga mfuleni muchiviga. <verse eid="NUM 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 19:18" />Kangi mundu mweiyidakiliwa mu kuyupa yati itola husopo, ndi yati ijwiga mumanji ago, kangi yati inyunyusila Lindanda na vindu vyoha vyevivili mugati ya Lindanda na vandu vevavi mugati. Yati akumnyunyusila mewa yula mweapamisi lihupa la mundu amala higa ya mundu mweakomiwi amala mweafwili lifwa la uyovela amala mweapamisi litinda. <verse eid="NUM 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 19:19" />Paligono la datu na saba, mundu mweiyidakiliwa mu kuyupa yati akumnyunyusila manji ago mundu yula mweangayidakiliwa mu kuyupa, paligono la saba yati akumnyambisa mundu mwenuyo, namwene yati ichapa nyula zaki na kusamba ndi kimii yati ivya ayidakiliwi mu kuyupa.”<verse eid="NUM 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 19:20" />Nambu yikavyayi mundu angayidakiliwa mu kuyupa akabelayi kujinyambisa yati ibelalewa na vandu voha, muni akulikita Lindanda la Bambu Chapanga likotoka kuyidakiliwa. Ndava muni anganyunyusiwa manji ga unyambiso mwene ndi mweangayidakiliwa mu kuyupa. <verse eid="NUM 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 19:21" />Genaga ndi malagizu ga magono goha kwavi, “Mundu yeyoha yula mweinyunyusila gala manji ga unyambiso iganikiwa mewa kuchapa nyula zaki, na yoyoha yula mweipamisa manji ago na mwene yati ivya angayidakiliwa mu kuyupa mbaka chimihi. <verse eid="NUM 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 19:22" />Chindu chocho cheipamisa mundu mweangayidakiliwa mu kuyupa yati chivya changayidakiliwa mewa yoyoha mweipamisa ivya mweangayidakiliwa mu kuyupa mbaka kimii.”<verse eid="NUM 19:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20" />
  <para style="s">Manji kuhuma mulitalau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">Kuw 17:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1" />Pa mwehi wa kutumbula Vandu voha va Vaisilaeli vahikili kulugangatu lwa Sini, na vene vakatama ku Kadeshi. Lukumbi pevavii kwenuko, Miliamu afwili na kuzikwa kukoko.<verse eid="NUM 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2" />Pandu pala pevavikili kambi pavi lepi na manji ndava ya vandu vala vanywa, vene vakakonganeka na kubela kumuyidakila Musa na Aloni. <verse eid="NUM 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3" />Vandu vakakomana kwa malovi na Musa, na kujova “Mbanga ngatifwa lukumbi valongo vitu pevafwili palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4" />Ndava kyani mwatiletili tete tavandu va Bambu Chapanga kulugangatu kuni? Wu mwatiletili muni tifwayi pamonga na mifuya yitu? <verse eid="NUM 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5" />Ndava kyani mutiwusili kuhuma ku Misili na kutileta pandu apa pa kuyogofya? Penapa lepi pandu pa mabenu amala tini amala zabibu amala makongamanga. Hati manji ga kunywa kawaka!” <verse eid="NUM 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6" />Hinu Musa na Aloni vakawuka pamsambi wa vandu wula vakahamba kuyima pamlyangu wa Lindanda la kukonganekela, vakafugama na kugundama mbaka pahi. Ndi lumuli lwa Bambu Chapanga ukahumila.<verse eid="NUM 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8" />“Tola ndonga yaku yila, kangi veve na mlongo waku Aloni, muvakonganisa vandu voha. Ndi palongolo ya mihu gavi, ulijovela litalahu lelivi palongolo ya mihu gavi lihumisa manji gaki. Ena yati wikita uhumisa manji, muni vandu voha pamonga na mifuya yavi vahotola kunywa.” <verse eid="NUM 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9" />Ndava yeniyo Musa akatola ndonga yeniyo pala peyavili palongolo ya Lisanduku la lilaganu, ngati chealagaziwi na Bambu Chapanga.<verse eid="NUM 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10" />Kangi musa na Aloni vakavakemela vandu voha palongolo ya Litalau, kangi Musa akavajovela, “Myuwanila hinu, nyenye mwemuhokili, Wu mwigana tivahumisila manji kuhuma palitalau lenili?” <verse eid="NUM 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11" />Kangi Musa akayinula chiwoko chaki, akatova litalau lila mala zivili kwa ndoga yaki. Maji gahumili gamahele, vandu vanywili pamonga na mifuya yavi.<verse eid="NUM 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12" />Nambu Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa na Aloni, “Ndava nyenye mwanisadiki lepi nene, amala kunitopesa palongolo ya mihu ga Vaisilaeli, hinu ndava yeniyo yati mwiyingisa lepi pamonga na vandu avo pamulima wula wenivapeli.”<verse eid="NUM 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13" />Genaga gavili manji ga Meliba, pandu pala Vaisilaeli pavamumembenikili Bambu Chapanga, na mwene ajilangisi kwenuko kuvya Msopi pagati yavi.<verse eid="NUM 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkosi wa ku Edomu akuvabelalela Vaisilaeli kupita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 20:14" />Musa atumili vajumbi kuhuma ku Kadeshi kuhamba kwa nkosi wa Edomu akamjovela. “Mlongo waku, Isilaeli, ijova naha, Veve ukugamanya mang'aiso goha gegatikolili. <verse eid="NUM 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 20:15" />Chila vagogo vitu chevahambili ku Misili, kwetatamili kwa lukumbi lutali na chila Vamisili chevavang'ahili vagogo vitu, vakating'aha na tete. <verse eid="NUM 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 20:16" />Tete tamvembili Bambu Chapanga, mwene ayuwini chivembu chitu, atiletili mtumu wa kunani kwa kunani mweatiwusili ku Misili hinu tivi apa pa Kadeshi, muji wewubakana na mulima waku. <verse eid="NUM 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 20:17" />Chondi utiyidakila tipita pamulima waku. Yati tikanyatila lepi migunda yinu amala migunda yila ya mizabibu, mewa yati tinywa lepi manji ga viliva vinu. Yati tikuyilanda njila yikulu na kuhamba lumonga changali kung'anamukila lepi kwokwoha, mbaka petihuma pamulima waku.”<verse eid="NUM 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 20:18" />Nambu nkosi wa Edomu akamuyangula, “Lepi! Yati mwipita lepi pamulima wangu, ngati mwakaliga kupita yati tihuma na kuvabuna.”<verse eid="NUM 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 20:19" />Vaisilaeli vakamvajovela, “Tete yati tilanda njila yikulu, ngati tete namifuya yitu takanywayi manji ginu, yati tilipa. Tiyupa chondi utiyidakila ndu tipita kwa magendelu tigana lepi linenu loloha lingi.”<verse eid="NUM 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 20:20" />Nambu nkosi wa ku Edomu akakangamisa, “Tikuvayidakila lepi.” Bahapo Vaedomu manjolinjoli vakekesi vakahuma na kutovana nawu. <verse eid="NUM 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 20:21" />Hinu ndava muni Vaedomu vabelili kuvayidakila Vaisilaeli kupita pamulima wavi. Ndi Vaisilaeli vakang'amuka na kuhamba njila yingi.<verse eid="NUM 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lifwa la Aloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22" />Vaisilaeli voha vagendili kuhuma ku Kadeshi, vakahika kula kuchitumbi cha Holi. <verse eid="NUM 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23" />Kula kuchitumbi cha Holi, papipi na mbaka wa Edomu, Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa na Aloni, <verse eid="NUM 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24" />“Aloni yati ifwa, iyingila lepi mumulima wula wenivapeli vandu va Isilaeli ndava nyenye mwavoha mwavavili mwagayidakili lepi malagizu gangu kula ku Meliba. <verse eid="NUM 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25" />Mtola Aloni pamonga na Eliazali mwana waki, uvaleta panani ya chitumbi Holi. <verse eid="NUM 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26" />Kangi muhula Aloni nyula zaki na umuwalika Eliazali. Aloni yati ifwa kuni kuchitumbi.” <verse eid="NUM 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27" />Musa akitili ngati chila Bambu Chapanga cheamlagazili, ndi vakakwela kuhamba kuchitumbi Holi kuni vandu voha vaku. <verse eid="NUM 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28" />Kangi Musa amuhuli Aloni nyula zaki za chimteta, akamuwalika Eliazali. Mwene Aloni afwili palapala pachitumbi. Hinu Musa na Eliazali vakahelela kuhuma kuchitumbi chila. <verse eid="NUM 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29" />Vaisilaeli voha pevayuwini kuvya Aloni afwili, ndi vakamuvembela magono selasini.<verse eid="NUM 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21" />
  <para style="s">Vaisilaeli vakuvahotola Vakanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 21:1" />Nkosi mmonga Mkanaani wa Aladi mweatamayi ku Negebu peayuwini kuvya Vaisilaeli vibwela kwa njila ya Athalimu, ahambili kuvazangila, na kuvakamula vangi vavi. <verse eid="NUM 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 21:2" />Penapo, Vaisilaeli vakungili chilapu na Bambu Chapanga kujova, “Ngati yati ukutikita tete tivahotola vandu ava, yati tikuyiyongomesa njwe miji yavi.” <verse eid="NUM 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 21:3" />Bambu Chapanga ayuwini luyupu lwa Vaisilaeli, na mwene akavakita vavahotola Vakanaani. Vaisilaeli vavayongomisi njwe Vakanaani pamonga na miji yavi. Ndava yeniyo pandu penapo pakemeliwi Holima.<verse eid="NUM 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liyoka la Shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4" />Vaisilaeli vatumbwili lugendu kuhuma kuchitumbi cha Holi kupitila njila yeyihamba nyanja ya Shamu, kutindila Edomu. Nambu munjila vandu vakadenyeka mtima. <verse eid="NUM 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:5" />Hinu vakatumbula kumvembenekela Chapanga na Musa, vijova, “Ndava kyani utiwusili ku Misili kula tibwelwa kufwilila kuni kulugangatu? Kuni kawaka chakulya mewa manji, titotokili kwa chakulya ichi changanoga.” <verse eid="NUM 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6" />Penapo ndi Bambu Chapanga apeliki mayoka gegana chimatila pagati ya vandu, ndi gavalumili vandu na Vaisilaeli vamahele vafwili. <verse eid="NUM 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7" />Hinu, vandu vamhambalili Musa, vakamjovela, “Tibudili muni timuvembenikili Bambu Chapanga pamonga na veve. Muyupa Bambu Chapanga muni atiwusila mayoka aga.” Ndava yeniyo Musa akavayupila vandu. <verse eid="NUM 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8" />Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa, “Tengenezayi liyoka la shaba, ulikoveka panani ya lipanda. Mundu yeyoyoha mwealumiwi na liyoka, akalilingulila liyoka lila la shaba, yati ilama.” <verse eid="NUM 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9" />Kangi Musa akatenganeza liyoka la shaba na kulipachika panani ya lipanda. Na kila mundu mwealumiwi na liyoka na akalilingulilayi liyoka lenilo la shaba alamili.<verse eid="NUM 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lugendu lwa kuhamba ku Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 21:10" />Vaisilaeli vayendalili na lugendu lwavi, vakavika kambi ku Oboti. <verse eid="NUM 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 21:11" />kangi vakawuka Oboti na kuvika kambi ku Iye Abalimu, kulugangatu lwelulolesana na Moabu upandi wa kwelihumila lilanga. <verse eid="NUM 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 21:12" />Kuhuma penapo vayendalili kulongolo vakavika kambi kulikemba la Zeledi. <verse eid="NUM 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 21:13" />Kuhuma kwenuko vagendili, vakavika kambi kukasikazini ya mfuleni wa Alimoni, wula wewihelesa manji kuhuma mulima wa Vaamoli na kupitila lugangatu. Mfuleni Amoni wavi mumbaka pagati ya Vamoabu na Vaamoli. <verse eid="NUM 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 21:14" />Ndava yeniyo, yiyandikwi muchitabu cha Bambu Chapanga, “Muji wa Vahebu ku mulima wa Sufa, na makemba ga Alimoni, <verse eid="NUM 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 21:15" />na mhelelu wa makemba wihika mbaka muji wa Ali, na kuhamba kum'baka wa Moabu!”<verse eid="NUM 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 21:16" />Kuhuma kwenuko Vaisilaeli vagendili mbaka Beeli, ndi chiliva chila Bambu Chapanga amjovili musa, “Vavika vandu pamonga, nene yati nikuvapela manji.” <verse eid="NUM 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 21:17" />Kangi Vaisilaeli vakayimba lunyimbu ulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:17">“Didiwula manji, vee chiliva!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:17">Muchiyimbila chiliva,<verse eid="NUM 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 21:18" />Chiliva chechagimiwi na vakulu mewa vandu vevamanyikini neju,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">kwa ndonga zavi za ulongosi na mkongojo.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">Kuhuma kulugangatu vagendili mbaka Matana.<verse eid="NUM 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 21:19" />Kuhuma matana mbaka Nahalieli, kuhuma Nahalieli mbaka Bamoti, <verse eid="NUM 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 21:20" />na kuhuma ku Bamoti vakahika kulikemba lelivi ku Moabu, pandu pala pepavii papipi chitumbi cha Pisiga ndi chituvilu chaki chilolesana na lugangatu.<verse eid="NUM 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vaisilaeli vakuvahotola vankosi Sihoni na Ogu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 2:26-3:1">Ukumb 2:26-3:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 21:21" />Vaisilaeli vavatumili vajumbi vahamba kwa Sihoni nkosi wa Vaamoli, vakamujovela ujumbi uwu, <verse eid="NUM 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 21:22" />“Utiyidakila tipita pamulima waku, yati ting'anamuka lepi kuhamba kumuhana na kuyingila mumigunda amala pagati ya migunda ya mizabibu, mewa yati tinywa lepi manji ga viliva vyinu, yati tipita pagati ya njila yikulu ya mbaka petiwuka pamulima waku.” <verse eid="NUM 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 21:23" />Nambu Sihoni avayidakili lepi Vaisilaeli vapita pagati ya mulima waki. Akavakemela manjolinjoli vaki voha pamonga, vakahamba ku Yahasa kulugangatu kuvazangila Vaisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 21:24" />Pamonga na naha, Vaisilaeli vamkomili, vakautola mulima waki tangiya mfuleni Amoni mbaka mfuleni Yaboki, nambu mbaka kuhika mlima wa Vaamoni ndu, ndava muni mibaka yaki yatindiswi luhumba. <verse eid="NUM 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 21:25" />Vaisilaeli vayitolili kwa ngondo miji yoha ya Vaamoni na vene vakatama mumiji yeniyo pamonga na Heshiboni na hijiji hyaki. <verse eid="NUM 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 21:26" />Heshiboni wavi muji wa Sihoni nkosi wa Vaamoli. Heshiboni ndi yula kadeni mweatovini na nkosi wa Moabu, na akatola mulima waki woha mbaka ku Alinoni. <verse eid="NUM 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 21:27" />Ndava yeniyo vatunga nyimbu viyimba, “Bwela Heshiboni na kujenga. Muji wa Sihoni ujengewayi kavili.<verse eid="NUM 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 21:28" />Motu wayakili kuhuma ku Heshiboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">lulimi lwa motu kuhuma muji wa Sihoni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">Wayongomisi muji wa Ali wa ku Moabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">vandu vevatamayi panani ya vitumbi vya mumihana ya mfuleni Alimoni.<verse eid="NUM 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 21:29" />Mwalachikolela nyenye vandu va Moabu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Muyongomiswi, nyenye vandu va chapanga Kemoshi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Uvakitili vana vinu vagosi kuvya vajumbiswa va mulima wa chiyehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">vasikana vinu muvalekili vakamuliwa kungondo mbaka kwa Sihoni, nkosi wa Amoli.<verse eid="NUM 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 21:30" />Nambu hinu chiveleku chavi chiyongomiswi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">kuhuma ku Heshiboni mbaka ku Diboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">kuhuma ku Nashimu mbaka ku Nofa, papipi na ku Medeba.”<verse eid="NUM 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 21:31" />Hinu, Vaisilaeli vakatama pamulima wa Vaamoli. <verse eid="NUM 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 21:32" />Kangi Musa avatumili vandu vaung'omesa muji wa Yazeli, kangi Vaisilaeli vakautola kwa ngondo pamonga na hijiji hyaki, na kuvavinga Vaamoli vevatama penapo.<verse eid="NUM 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 21:33" />Vaisilaeli vang'anamwiki vakalanda njila ya kuhamba ku Bashani. Nkosi Ogu wa ku Bashani ahumili na manjolinjoli vaki na kuvazangila kula ku Edilei. <verse eid="NUM 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 21:34" />Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa, “Kotoka kumyogopa Ogu, ndava nikukiti uvahotola, pamonga na manjolinjoli vaki voha na vandu vaki voha. Mkitila ngati chewamkitili Sihoni nkosi wa Vaamoli, yula mweatalalili ku Heshiboni.” <verse eid="NUM 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 21:35" />Hinu, Vaisilaeli vamkomili Ogu na vana vaki voha, changali kumleka hati mundu mmonga, kangi vakatalalila mlima.<verse eid="NUM 21:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="NUM 22" />
  <para style="s">Balaam ikemelewa na nkosi wa Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 22:1" />Kangi Vaisilaeli vagendili munjila selede ya Moabu na kuvika kambi kuupandi welihumila lilanga wa mfuleni Yoludani, na kulolesana na Yeliko.<verse eid="NUM 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 22:2" />Nkosi Balaki wa ku Moabu mwana wa Sipoli, agayuwini mambu goha gala Vaisilaeli gevavakitili Vaamoli. <verse eid="NUM 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 22:3" />Mwene pamonga na Vamoabu vakavya na wogoyi uvaha kuvavala Vaisilaeli, vavayogwipi neju ndava vavi vamahele. <verse eid="NUM 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 22:4" />Hinu Vamoabu vavajovili vachilongosi va Midiani, “Vandu nyomi ava kanyata yati uhalabisa kila chindu mumuhana yitu ngati ng'ombi yigosi cheyilya manyayi kumgunda.” Ndava yeniyo, Balaki mwana wa Sipoli, mweavi nkosi wa ku Moabu lukumbi lwenulo, <verse eid="NUM 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 22:5" />ndi akapeleka ujumbi kwa Balaamu, mwana wa Beoli, kula ku Peholi, papipi na mfuleni Eufulate, kumulima wa Amawi. Amujovili Balaamu naha, “Kuvi na vandu vamahele kuhumili ku Misili, wene udandasiki kila pandu pamulima, kavili viyogofya kutola mulima wangu. <verse eid="NUM 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 22:6" />Hinu ubwelayi uvapela likoto vandu ava ndava yangu muni vavi na makakala kuliku nene. Pangi yati nikuvahotola na kuvavinga vakotoka kuyingila pamulima wangu, ndava muni nimanyili kuvya veve wakamumotisa mundu imotisiwa na wakamupela likoto mundu ipata likoto.”<verse eid="NUM 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 22:7" />Hinu vachilongosi va Moabu na Midiani vakagega mashonga ga luhuna lwa ulondola, vakawuka kuhamba kwa Balaamu. Pevahikili, vamjovili Balaamu ujumbi wa Balaki. <verse eid="NUM 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 22:8" />Balaamu avajovili, “Kilu yeniyi mgona kunikuni, nene yati nikuvamanyisa gala geakunijovela Bambu Chapanga.” Hinu ndi vilongosi vala va Moabu vakagona kwa Balaamu.<verse eid="NUM 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 22:9" />Kangi Chapanga ambwelili Balaamu, akamkota, “Ndi vayani ava vevavii pamonga na veve?”<verse eid="NUM 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 22:10" />Balaamu amyangwili Chapanga, “Balaki mwana wa Sipoli aniletili ujumbi kuvya, <verse eid="NUM 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 22:11" />kuvi na vandu kuhuma ku mulima wa Misili, vene vadandasiki kila pandu pamulima. Aniyupili nihamba kuvapela likoto vandu venavo muni pangi ihotola kutovana nawu na kuvavinga.”<verse eid="NUM 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 22:12" />Chapanga akamjovela Balaamu, “Kotoka kuhamba pamonga na vandu ava, mewa kotoka kuvapela likoto vandu venavo muni nivamotisiwi.”<verse eid="NUM 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 22:13" />Ndi lukela lwaki Balaamu ayumwiki, akavajovela vachilongosi va Balaki, “Muwuya kumulima winu, ndava muni Bambu Chapanga aganili lepi kuniyidakila kuhamba pamonga na nyenye.” <verse eid="NUM 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 22:14" />Ndi vachilongosi va Moabu vakawuka, kuwuya kwa Balaki, vakamjovela, “Balaamu abelili kubwela pamonga na tete.”<verse eid="NUM 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 22:15" />Kangi Balaki avatumili vachilongosi vangi, vamahele neju na vakulu kuliku vala va kutumbula. <verse eid="NUM 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 22:16" />Hinu venavo vahikili kwa Balaamu, vakamjovela, “Balaki mwana wa Sipoli ijova kuvya, ‘Kotoka kuyidakila chindu chochoha chila chikudivalila hati uleka kubwela kwangu. <verse eid="NUM 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 22:17" />Yati nikupela utopesa uvaha, na chindu chochoha cheukuniyupa yati nikupela. Bwela uvapela likoto vandu ava.’”<verse eid="NUM 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 22:18" />Nambu Balaamu avayangwili vatumisi va Balaki, “Hati ngati Balaki akanipela nyumba yaki ya unkosi kuni yimemili mashonga na dhahabu, nene nakuhotola kudenya mihilu ya Bambu Chapanga wangu kuvala lijambu loloha, yivya lidebe amala livaha. <verse eid="NUM 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 22:19" />Nambu chondi mgona bahapa kilu iyi ngati vala vayinu, na nene nipata kumanya chila cheakunijovela Bambu Chapanga kavili.”<verse eid="NUM 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 22:20" />Hinu kilu yila Bambu Chapanga ambwelili Balaamu akamjovela, “Ndava muni vandu ava vabwelili kukukemela, uhamba pamonga nawu, nambu ukita ndu chila chenikujovela.” <verse eid="NUM 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 22:21" />Ndi lukela Balaamu ayumwiki, akatandika chindu cha kutamila panani ya lipunda laki, akahamba pamonga na vachilongosi vala.<verse eid="NUM 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balaamu na lipunda laki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 22:22" />Nambu Chapanga ayomili neju ndava muni Balaamu avi mulugendu kuhamba kwa Balaki, ndi mtumu wa Chapanga, akamdivalila munjila. Lukumbi lwenulo Balaamu akwelili palipunda laki kuni avi pamonga na vatumisi vaki vavili. <verse eid="NUM 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 22:23" />Hinu lipunda lila lamuwene mtumu wa Chapanga ayimili munjila, akamwili upanga weutendekiwi ndava ya kuutumila. Ndava yeniyo akayileka njila, akahamba pamuhana. Balaamu akamtova punda yula muni awuya munjila. <verse eid="NUM 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 22:24" />Kangi mtumu wa Chapanga mwenuyo akalongolela kulongolo, akayima pandu pepavi na njila ngalingasi, pagati ya migunda yivili ya mizabibu na pandu pa luwumba pandi zivili. <verse eid="NUM 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 22:25" />Punda peamuwene mtumu wa Bambu Chapanga, akajumbalila kuluwumba na kuchihinya chigendelu cha Balaamu penapo. Ndava yeniyo Balaamu amtovili kavili punda mwenuyo. <verse eid="NUM 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 22:26" />Kangi mtumu wa Chapanga yula akalongolela kavili, akayima pandu pangalingasi pangali fwasi ya kupita kulyela amala kumangeya. <verse eid="NUM 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 22:27" />Punda peamuwene yula mtumu wa kunani wa Chapanga, ndi akagona pahi. Balaamu akamema ligoga, akamtova kwa ndonga yaki. <verse eid="NUM 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 22:28" />Penapo Bambu Chapanga akagubukula mlomo wa punda, ndi punda yula akamjovela Balaamu, “Nikukitili kyani hati unitovili mala zidatu?”<verse eid="NUM 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 22:29" />Balaamu akamyangula punda, “Veve unikitili nivya muyimu! Kuvya nivya na upanga nga nikukomili hinu naha!”<verse eid="NUM 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 22:30" />Punda akamjovela Balaamu, “Wu, nene lepi yulayula punda waku mweakugegili wumi waku woha mbaka ligono la lelu? Wu, niyovalili kukukitila namuna yeniyi?” Balaamu akayangula “Lepi.”<verse eid="NUM 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 22:31" />Bahapo Bambu Chapanga akagagubukula mihu ga Balaamu, mwene ndi akamulola mtumu wa kunani wa Bambu Chapanga, ayimili panjila, akamwili upanga weutendekiwi kwa kutumila. Ndi Balaamu akajitaga pahi chakukupama. <verse eid="NUM 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 22:32" />Mtumu wa Chapanga akamjovela Balaamu, “Ndava kyani umtovili punda waku mala zidatu? Nibwelili kukudivalila, ndava muni njila yaku yihakahu. <verse eid="NUM 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 22:33" />Punda waku aniweni na kuniyepa mala zoha zidatu. Ngaikotoka kuniyepa chakaka nganikukomili veve na kumleka mumi punda waku.”<verse eid="NUM 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 22:34" />Balaamu akamjovela mtumu wa kunani wa Chapanga, “Nibudili muni namanyili lepi ngati uyimili panjila na kunidivalila. Hinu ngati yikukuganisa lepi nene kuyendelela na lugendu ulu yati niwuya kunyumba.”<verse eid="NUM 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 22:35" />Nambu mtumu wa kunani wa Chapanga akamjovela Balaamu, “Hamba na vandu ava, nambu yati ujova gala ndu genikujovela.” Hinu Balaamu ndi akayendelela na lugendu pamonga na vachilongosi va Balaki.<verse eid="NUM 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balaki akumkalibisa Balaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 22:36" />“Balaki peayuwini kuvya Balaamu ibwela, akawuka kuhamba kumpokela kumuji wa Ali wewavili mumihana ya mfuleni Alinoni kumbaka wa Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 22:37" />Balaki akamjovela, Balaamu, ndava kyani ubwelili lepi kanyata penakukemili? Wu, waholalili kuvya yati nikukupela lepi mashonga gamahele?”<verse eid="NUM 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 22:38" />Balaamu akamyangula Balaki, “Hinu nibwelili, hinu Balaamu akamyangula Balaki Hinu nibwelili! Nambu wu, nina uhotola wa kujova chocchoa ndu? Lijambu leakunijovela Chapanga ndi lenijova.” <verse eid="NUM 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 22:39" />Hinu, Baalamu akahamba pamonga na Balaki mbaka kumuji wa Kiliati Husoti. <verse eid="NUM 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 22:40" />Kwenuko Balaki akahinja ng'ombi na limbelele kuvya luteta na nyama zingi akavagavila vilongosi vaki vevavii pamonga nayu na Balaamu.<verse eid="NUM 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulota wa utumbula wa Balaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 22:41" />Chikau yaki Balaki amtolili Balaamu, akahambayu mbaka Bamoti Baali kuhuma kwenuko Balaamu ahotwili kuvawona Vaisilaeli vangi.<verse eid="NUM 22:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="NUM 23" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 23:1" />Balaamu akamjovela Balaki, “Unijengela pandu saba pakuwusila luteta penapa, kangi uniletela ng'ombi zigosi saba pamonga na mambelele gagosi saba.”<verse eid="NUM 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 23:2" />Ndi Balaki akitili ngati chejovili na Balaamu. Hinu vakawusa panani ya kila pandu pa kuwusila teta ng'ombi yigosi yimonga na limbelele ligosi limonga. <verse eid="NUM 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 23:3" />Kangi Balaamu akamjovela Balaki, “Tama bahapa pamuhana ya luteta lwaki lukumbi nene nihamba pamuhana. Pangi Bambu Chapanga yati ibwela kukonganeka na nene. Chochoha cheakunijovela, yati nikukujovela.” Ndi akahamba pandu pamsopi panani chitumbi. <verse eid="NUM 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 23:4" />Chapanga akakonganeka na Balaamu na akamjovela, “Nimali kukujengela pandu saba pa kuwusila teta na kuwusa teta ya ng'ombi yigosi yimonga na limbelele ligoso limonga panani ya kila pandu pa kuwusila teta.”<verse eid="NUM 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 23:5" />Bambu Chapanga akampela Balaamu malovi gakujova na akamjovela malovi aga, “Wuya kwa Balaki ukampelayi ukokoso uwu.” <verse eid="NUM 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 23:6" />Balaamu awuyili, amkolili Balaki ayimili balapala papipi na luteta lwaki lwa kutinyiswa, pamonga na vakulu voha va Moabu.<verse eid="NUM 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 23:7" />Balaamu akajova malovi aga ga ulota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">“Balaki aniletili penapa kuhuma ku Alamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">ena, nkosi wa Moabu aniletili kuhuma kuvitumbi vya kwelihumila lilanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">‘Bwela uvapela likoto vandu va Yakobo ndava yangu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">ena bwela uvapela likoto Vaisilaeli!’<verse eid="NUM 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 23:8" />Nikumpela wuli likoto mundu yula Chapanga angampela likoto?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:8">Nikuvalaumu wuli vandu vala Chapanga angavalaumu?<verse eid="NUM 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 23:9" />Nihotola kuvalola kuhuma kuvituvilu vya matalahu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">Nihotola kuvalingulila kuhuma kunani ya vitumbi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">Nikuvawona vandu vevitama vene ndu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">vamanyili kuvya vamotiswi neju ya vandu vangi.<verse eid="NUM 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 23:10" />Yani mwehitola kuuvalanga umahele wa vandu va Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">amala kuhololela umahele wa Vaisilali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">Nifwayi ngati vevakumganisa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">mwishu wangu uvyayi ngati vene.”<verse eid="NUM 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 23:11" />Penapo ndi Balaki akamjovela Balaamu, “Unihengili chindu kiki? Nikuletili kuni uvapela likoto makoko vangu, nambu pahali paki uvamotisi!”<verse eid="NUM 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 23:12" />Balaamu akamjovela, “Yikunigana kujova malovi gala geanipelili Chapanga ndu.”<verse eid="NUM 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulota wa pili wa Balaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 23:13" />Mwanakandahi Balaki akamjovela Balaamu, “Tihamba pandu pangi pala pewihotola kuvalola, pamonga na ago yati wilola vandu vadebe, na yati wihotola lepi kuvalola voha. Kangi uvapela likoto kwenuko pandu pangu” <verse eid="NUM 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 23:14" />Hinu Balaki akampeleka Balaamu kumgunda wa ku Sofimu, panani ya chitumbi cha Pisiga. Penapo akajenga pandu saba pa kuwusila teta na kuwusa panani ya kila pandu pa kuwusila teta, teta yimonga ya ng'ombi yigosi na limbelele limonga ligosi.<verse eid="NUM 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 23:15" />Balaamu akamjovela Balaki, “Tama bahapa papipi na luteta lwaku lwa kutinyiswa, na nene nihamba kula kumwambu kukonganeka na Chapanga.”<verse eid="NUM 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 23:16" />Chapanga akakonganeka na Balaamu, akamjovela malovi ga kujova na kumjovela, “Wuya kwa Balaki kampela ukokoso uwu.” <verse eid="NUM 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 23:17" />Hinu Balaamu akawuya, akamkolela Balaki ayimili papipi na luteta lwa kutinyisa pamonga na vachilongosi vaki voha va Moabu. Balaki akamukota, “Chapanga akujovili kyani?” <verse eid="NUM 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 23:18" />Ndi Balaamu akamjovela Balaki malovi gaki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:18">“Yinuka Balaki, uyuwanila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:18">niyuwanila veve mwana wa Sipoli.<verse eid="NUM 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 23:19" />Chapanga mundu lepi hati ajova udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">mewa lepi mundu hati ang'anamusa maholo gaki!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">Wu, ihotala kujova chindu na akotoka kukita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">mewa kujova chindu angatimilisa?<verse eid="NUM 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 23:20" />Yuwanila, nipewili muhilu kukumotisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:20">na mwene amotisi nene nihotola lepi kung'anamusa.”<verse eid="NUM 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 23:21" />“Chapanga alolili lepi uhakau kwa vana va Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">mewa ng'ani pa Isilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">Chapanga wavi avi pamonga nawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">Mwene ilumbiwa kwa vilulu pagati yavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">na vene vikokosa kuvya mwene ndi Chapanga wavi.<verse eid="NUM 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 23:22" />Chapanga mweavatolili kuhuma ku Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:22">akuvatovanila kwa makakala ngati makakala ga mbunju.<verse eid="NUM 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 23:23" />Kawaka kulogwa kwa vandu va Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">mewa uhavi ndava ya Vaisilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">Hinu kuvavala vandu va Isilaeli, vandu yati vijova,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">hinu yati yijoviwa ndava ya Yakobo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">‘Mlola makangaso geahengili Chapanga!’<verse eid="NUM 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 23:24" />Yuwanila! Vaisilaeli vayinwiki ngati lihimba lidala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">vayimili ngati lihimba ligosi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">Ndi ngati lihimba langagona mbaka limala kulya cheawindili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">na kunywa ngasi ya chinyama chelikomili.”<verse eid="NUM 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 23:25" />Ndi Balaki akamjovela Balaamu, “Hinu ukotoka kuvapela likoto mewa kotoka kuvamotisa!”<verse eid="NUM 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 23:26" />Nambu Balaamu akamyangula Balaki, “Wu, nakujovili lepi kuvya cheijova Chapanga ndi cheniganikiwa kukita?”<verse eid="NUM 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulota wa datu wa Balaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 23:27" />Balaki akamjovela Balaamu, “Bwela nikupeleka pandu pangi. Manya Chapanga yati iyidakila uvapela likoto vandu avo kuhuma kwenuko ndava yangu.” <verse eid="NUM 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 23:28" />Hinu Balaki akamtola Balaamu mbaka kula kuchituvilu cha Chitumbi Peoli, kula upandi weulolesana na lugangatu. <verse eid="NUM 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 23:29" />“Balaamu akamujovela Balaki, nijengela pandu saba pa kuwusila teta penapa, unitendelekela ng'ombi saba zigosi na mambelele saba gagosi.” <verse eid="NUM 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 23:30" />Balaki akakita ngati cheajoviwi na Balaamu, kangi akawusa panani ya kila pandu pa kuwusila teta ng'ombi yimonga yigosi na limbelele ligosi limonga.<verse eid="NUM 23:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="NUM 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 24:1" />Hinu Balaamu akamanya kuvya Chapanga aganili kuvamotisa Vaisilaeli, ndava yeniyo ahambili lepi kavili kulondola, ndi akavya ilolokesa kulugangatu. <verse eid="NUM 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 24:2" />Balaamu pealolili kuvala na kuvawona Vaisilalei vapumulili, kila likabila pandu paki. Kangi Mpungu wa Chapanga ukambwelili, <verse eid="NUM 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 24:3" />mwene akajova malovi aga ga ulota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">Malovi gangu nene mwana wa Peoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">malovi ga mundu mweagubukulili mihu. <verse eid="NUM 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 24:4" />malovi ga mundu mweayuwini malovi ga Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">mundu mwealolili maono ga Chapanga mweavi na makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">mundu mweafugimi na kugundama mbaka pahi na mihu gaki kulola hotohoto. <verse eid="NUM 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 24:5" />Mandanda gaku gamganisi namuna yoki nyenye vandu va Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:5">ena makao ginu nyenye vandu va Isilaeli! <verse eid="NUM 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 24:6" />Ndi ngati makemba gegihelelesa manji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">ngati lidimba pamuhana ya mfuleni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">ngati masongolelu geapandili Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">ngati mibani pamuhana ya manji. <verse eid="NUM 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 24:7" />Yati vivya na fula za gamahele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">na kumija mbeyu zavi mumigunda yeyina manji gamahele</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">nkosi wavi yati ivya mkulu kuliku Agagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">unkosi waki yati utopeswa neju. <verse eid="NUM 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 24:8" />Chapanga avatolili kuhuma ku Misili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">mwene akuvatovanila neju ngati liyati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">Yati akugayongomesa milima yeyivi makoko ginu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">yati idenyadenya mahupa gavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">yati akuvahoma kwa nduta zavi. <verse eid="NUM 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 24:9" />Yati ihumila na kugona pahi ngati lihimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">yani mweilinga kumuyumusa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">Amotisiwa yeyoha yula mweakuvamotisa nyenye Vaisilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">apewa likoto yeyoha yula mweakuvapela nyenye likoto.<verse eid="NUM 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 24:10" />Balaki akamema ligoga ndava ya Balaamu, akapamanda mawoko gaki kwa ligoga na kumjovela, “Nakukemili uvapela likoto makoko vangu, nambu mala zoha zidatu uvamotisi! <verse eid="NUM 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 24:11" />Hinu! Uwuka kanyata. Nakuhaidili kukupela njombi zamahele, nambu Bambu Chapanga akudivalili kupata njombi zenizo, akunyimili!”<verse eid="NUM 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 24:12" />Balaamu akamjovela Balaki, “Wu, wikumbuka lepi chila chenajovili vajumbi vewavatumili kwangu? Navajovili naha, <verse eid="NUM 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 24:13" />kuvya hati ngati ukunipela nyumba yaku ya unkosi kuni yimemili mashonga na dhahabu, nene nihotola lepi kuyepa lilagizu la Chapanga, kwa kukita lijambu loloha, labwina amala lihakahu kwa kugana kwangu mwene? Najovili chila cheijova Chapanga ndi chenijova.”<verse eid="NUM 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulota wa mwishu wa Balaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 24:14" />“Hinu niwuya kwa vandu vangu, nambu kwakona kuwuka, leka nikujovela mambu gala vandu avo chevakuvakitila vandu vaku magono gegibwela.” <verse eid="NUM 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 24:15" />Kangi Balaamu akajova ujumbi waki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">“Ujumbi wa Balaamu mwana wa Beoli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">ujumbi waki mwene yula lihu laki lilola bwina,<verse eid="NUM 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 24:16" />Chenichi ndi chaajovili mundu mweayuwini malovi ga Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">mundu mweanaumanya kuhuma Chapanga mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">mundu mweifugama mbaka pahi na kuni mihu gaki gadindwiki, mweilola maono ga Chapanga mweana makakala.<verse eid="NUM 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 24:17" />Nikumlola, mweibwela nambu mwanakandahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">nikumlola, nambu avili lepi papipi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Ndondo yati yihumila kwa chivelaku cha Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">yati ihumila nkosi pagati ya Vaisilaeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Kwa ndonga yaki yati akuvatova vachilongosi va Vamoabu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">yati akuvakomekesa vachiveleku voha va Sesi.<verse eid="NUM 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 24:18" />Vaisilaeli yati vakuvahotola Vaedomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:18">Yati akuvabuna mewa Seili veva likoko vaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:18">nambu Isilaeli yati ivya na makakala.<verse eid="NUM 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 24:19" />Chilongosi yati ibwela kuhuma kwa Yakobo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:19">na kuvakomekea vevasigalili pamuji wa Ali.”<verse eid="NUM 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 24:20" />“Kangi Balaamu avawene Vaamaleki, akavajovela ujumbi uwu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">Amaleki vandu vevana makakala neju,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">nambu pamwishu wikomekeswa njwee.”<verse eid="NUM 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 24:21" />“Ndi avawene Vakeni, avajovela ujumbi waki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:21">Makao ginu ndi gavi bwina ngati chisakanilu chijengiwi ku litalahu.<verse eid="NUM 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 24:22" />Nambu nyenye Vakemi yati mwikomekeswa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:22">Pemukamuliwa kungondo na Ashulu?”<verse eid="NUM 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 24:23" />Kangi Balaamu akajova ujumbi uwu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:23">“Mwe! Yani mweisigalila, Chapanga peikita genago?<verse eid="NUM 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 24:24" />Watu yati zibwela kuhuma Kitimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">yati vakuyitova Ashulu na Ebeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">Nambu vene mewa yati vikomakeswa.”<verse eid="NUM 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 24:25" />Hinu Balaamu akawuka kuwuya kunyumba, mewa Balaki akahamba njila yaki.<verse eid="NUM 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="NUM 25" />
  <para style="s">Vandu va Vaisilaeli ku Peoli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 25:1" />Lukumbi Vaisilaeli pevatamili ku Shitimu, vagosi va Isilaeli vatumbwili kugona na vadala va Vamoabu, <verse eid="NUM 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 25:2" />vadala venavo vavagongolili Vaisilaeli vabwela kuhanganila ku matambiku gevatambikili michapanga yavi, na vene Vaisilaeli valili chakulya na kufugamila michapanga yavi. <verse eid="NUM 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 25:3" />Chenicho ndi Vaisilaeli chevahanganili na Baali wa Peoli, na Chapanga akavayomela vene. <verse eid="NUM 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 25:4" />Hinu Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa, “Uvatola vachilongosi voha va Isilaeli uvakoma palongolo yangu pandu pepalangwiki muhi pee, muni ligoga langu ndava yinu liwuka.” <verse eid="NUM 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 25:5" />Ndava yeniyo Musa akavajovela vahamula va Isilaeli, “Kila mmonga winu yikumgana avakoma vala vagosi vinu, vevahanganili kumfugamila Baali wa Peoli.”<verse eid="NUM 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 25:6" />Lukumbi lulolo mundu mmonga akamleta mdala mmonga Mmidiani kulindanda laki. Musa na vandu voha va Isilaeli vavembeneka pala pamlyangu wa Lindanda la kukonganekela ndava ya Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 25:7" />Hinu Finehasi mwana wa Eliazali mwana wa mteta wa Chapanga Aloni peagawene genago, awukili pamngonganu wula akatola mgoha, <verse eid="NUM 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 25:8" />amlandili Muisilaeli yula mbaka mu Lindanda, akavahoma mgoha voha vavili kwa pamonga mumaleme, ukaholota muhiga yaa muisilaeli na muhiga ya mdala yula. Ndi utamu uhakau neju wewavakili Vaisilaeli vafwayi ukawuka. <verse eid="NUM 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 25:9" />Nambu vandu vevafwili ndava ya litovelu lila vavi vandu elufu ishili na mcheche.<verse eid="NUM 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 25:10" />Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 25:11" />“Finehasi mwana wa Eliazali mwana wa mteta wa Chapanga Aloni, alidivalili ligoga langu ndava ya Vaisilaeli, pagati yinu mwene ndu ndi mweavi na wihu ngati chenivi nawu nene. Ndava yeniyo ndi navakomili lepi Vaisilaeli kwa ligoga langu. <verse eid="NUM 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 25:12" />Hinu, mjovela kuvya tivika lilaganu la uteke nene na mwene. <verse eid="NUM 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 25:13" />Mwene pamonga na chiveleku chaki yati vivya na lilaganu la kuvya vamteta wa Chapanga magono goha gangali mwishu, ndava avi na wihu ndava ya utopesa kwa Chapanga waki, na akakita utepulanisa kwa Vaisilaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 25:14" />Liina la Muisilaeli mweakomiwi pamonga na mdala wa chimidiani lavi Zimli mwana wa Salu, monga ya lukolo lwa likabila la Simeoni. <verse eid="NUM 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 25:15" />Mewa liina la mdala wa chimidiani mweakomiwi ndi Kozibi msikana wa Suli, mweavi wa lukolo lumonga lwa likabila la Vamidiani.<verse eid="NUM 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 25:16" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 25:17" />“Uvazangila Vamidiani na uvakomakesa, <verse eid="NUM 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 25:18" />ndava uhakau wevavakitili lukumbi pevavakongili kwa lijambu la Peoli na mlumbu wavi Kozibi msikana wa chilongosi wa Vamidiani, mdala yula mweakomiwi lukumbi lwa utamu uhakau wewahumalili ku Peoli.”<verse eid="NUM 25:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="NUM 26" />
  <para style="s">Vaisilaeli vivalangiwa mala ya pili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 26:1" />Pelamaliki litovelu lila, Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa na Eliazali mwana wa Aloni mweavi mteta wa Chapanga, <verse eid="NUM 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 26:2" />“Mvalanga vandu voha wa Vaisilaeli kila mundu kulandana na vandu va munyumba yaki. Mvalanga vandu voha vevavi na ntanga ya miyaka ishilini na neju veviganikiwa kuhamba kungondo.” <verse eid="NUM 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 26:3" />Hinu, Musa na mteta Eliazali vakalongela na vandu pamulima selede wa Moabu kumwambu ya Yoludani papipi na Yeliko. <verse eid="NUM 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 26:4" />Mvalanga vagosi vevavi na ntanga wa miyaka ishilini na neju, ngati Bambu Chapanga cheavalagizili Musa, venava ndi Vaisilaeli voha vevahumili ku Misili.<verse eid="NUM 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 26:5" />Vevatumbwili kuvavalangiwa Lubeni mwana tumbulanu wa Yakobo, kuhuma mumakabila genago mwavii na lukolo lwa Henoki, na lukolo lwa Palu. <verse eid="NUM 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 26:6" />Kuhuma kwa Hesiloni, na lukilo lwa Kalimi. <verse eid="NUM 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 26:7" />Zenizo ndi lwavii lukolo lwa likabila Lubeni, vandu vala vevavalangiwi vavi elufu alobaini na datu na miya saba na selasini. <verse eid="NUM 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 26:8" />Chiveleku cha Palu chavii Eliabu, <verse eid="NUM 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 26:9" />na vana va Eliabu ndi Nemueli na Datani na Abilamu. Vavili hava Datani na Abilamu ndi vavi vevahaguliwi na Vaisilaeli voha kuvya vachilongosi, nambu vavabelili Musa na Aloni, na kuvya vamulanda va Kola lukumbi pevambelili Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 26:10" />Lukumbi lwenulo ndima yadindwiki yikavamila, vafwili pamonga na Kola na vamulanda vaki motu pewavatinyisi ndi vandu miya zivili na hamusini vevavili vamlanda va kola, vakavya lubeswa lwa vandu voha. <verse eid="NUM 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 26:11" />Pamonga na genago, nambu vana va Kola vafwili lepi.<verse eid="NUM 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 26:12" />Kuhuma likabila la Simeoni ndi vandu va lukolo lwa Nemueli na vandu va lukolo lwa Yamini na vandu va lukolo lwa Yakini. <verse eid="NUM 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 26:13" />Pamonga na lukolo lwa Zela na lukolo lwa Shauli. <verse eid="NUM 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 26:14" />Zenizo ndi lukolo lwa likabila la Simeoni, jumula yavi vagosi elufu ishilini na vavili na miya zivili.<verse eid="NUM 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 26:15" />Viveleku vya likabila la Gadi ndi lukolo lwavi, vavii, lukolo lwa vandu va Sefoni, lukolo lwa vandu Sefoni na lukolo lwa vandu va Hagi na lukolo lwa vandu va Shuni, <verse eid="NUM 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 26:16" />Lukolo lwa vandu va Ozini na lukolo lwa vandu va Eli, <verse eid="NUM 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 26:17" />na vandu va lukolo lwa Alodi na vandu va lukolo lwa Aleli. <verse eid="NUM 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 26:18" />Zenizo ndi lwavi lukolo lwa likabila la Gadi jumula vagosi vevavili na uhotola wa kuhamba kungondo vavi elufu alobaini na miya mhanu.<verse eid="NUM 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 26:19" />Likabila la Yuda kwavili na vana vaki Yuda ndi Eli na Onani. Venava vafwilili kumulima wa Kanani. <verse eid="NUM 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 26:20" />Likabila la Yuda lavili na vandu va munyumba zavi lukolo lwa Shela na Pelesi na Zela. <verse eid="NUM 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 26:21" />Kuhuma kwa Pelesi kwavii lukolo zivili ndi, lukolo lwa Hesiloni na lukolo lwa Hamuli <verse eid="NUM 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 26:22" />Zenizo ndi zavilili lukolo lwa Yuda jumula vavii vagosi vavi elufu sabini na sita na miya mhanu vevahotwili kuhamba kungondo.<verse eid="NUM 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 26:23" />Likabila la Isakali lavii na vandu va lukolo lwa Tola na lukolo lwa Puva, <verse eid="NUM 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 26:24" />na lukolo lwa Yashubu na lukolo lwa Shimloni. <verse eid="NUM 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 26:25" />Zenizo ndi zavili lukolo lwa Isakali, Na vagosi vevavalangiwi kuhuma mu lukolo zenizo vavili vagosi elufu sitini na mcheche na miya zidatu vevahotwili kuhamba kungondo.<verse eid="NUM 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 26:26" />Kuhuma mu likabila la Zebuluni lavii na lukolo za Seledi na lukolo lwa Eloni na lukolo lwa Yaleeli. <verse eid="NUM 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 26:27" />Zenizo ndi zavii lukolo za Zebuluni na vagosi vevavalangiwi kuhuma mulukolo zenizo ndi elufu sitini na miya mhanu.<verse eid="NUM 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 26:28" />Yusufu avii na vana vavili maina gavi Manase na Efulaimu, na kuhumila kwaki gahumalili makabila gavili.<verse eid="NUM 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 26:29" />Kuhuma mulikabila la Manase lavii na lukolo lwa Makili. Makili avi dadi wa Gileadi. <verse eid="NUM 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 26:30" />Venava ndi vavii likabila vya Gileadi, lukolo zavi ndi zavii lukolo lwa Yezeli na lukolo lwa Heleki, <verse eid="NUM 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 26:31" />na lukolo lwa Asilieli na lukolo lwa Shekemu, <verse eid="NUM 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 26:32" />na lukolo lwa Shemida na lukolo lwa Hefe. <verse eid="NUM 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 26:33" />Selofohadi mwana wa Hefeli apatili lepi mwana mgosi nambu vadala vene ndu, vene vavi Mala na Noa na Hogila na Milika na Tiliza. <verse eid="NUM 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 26:34" />Lwenulo ndi lwavi lukolo lwa Menasi, kuhuma mulikabila lenilo vevavalangiwi vavii vagosi elufu hamusini na zivili na miya saba.<verse eid="NUM 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 26:35" />Kuhuma mu likabila la Efulaimu kwavili na lukolo lwa Shutuhela na lukolo lwa Bekeli na lukolo lwa Tahani. <verse eid="NUM 26:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 26:36" />Mewawa kuhuma lukolo lwa Shutuhela kwavili na lukolo lwa Elani. <verse eid="NUM 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 26:37" />Lukolo zenizo zahumili mu makabila gavili ndi Manase na Efulaimu, vevavili vana va Yusufu.<verse eid="NUM 26:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 26:38" />Kuhuma mu likabila la Benjamini kwavili na lukolo lwa Bela na lukolo lwa Ashibeli na lukolo lwa Ahilamu, <verse eid="NUM 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 26:39" />na lukolo lwa Shufamu na lukolo lwa Hufamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 26:40" />mewawa kwavili na lukolo lwa Alidi na lukolo lwa Naamani, lukolo zenizo zahumili kwa Bela. <verse eid="NUM 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 26:41" />Zenizo zoha ndi lwavii lukolo kuhuma mu likabila la Benjamini, kuhuma mulikabila lenilo vagosi vevavalangiwi ndava ya kuhamba ku ngondo vavii elufu alobaini na mhanu na miya sita.<verse eid="NUM 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 26:42" />Kuhuma mu likabila la Dani kwavili na lukolo lwa Shuhamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 26:43" />na vagosi vevavalangiwi kuhuma mulikabila lenilo ndava ya kuhamba kungondo vavii elufu sitini na mcheche na miya mcheche.<verse eid="NUM 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 26:44" />Kuhuma mulikabila la Asheli kwavili na lukolo lwa Imna na lukolo lwa Ishivi na lukolo lwa Belia. <verse eid="NUM 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 26:45" />mewawa kuhuma kwa Belia kwavili na lukolo lwa Hebeli na lukolo lwa Malikieli. <verse eid="NUM 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 26:46" />Asheli avii na msikana mwakemiwi Sela. <verse eid="NUM 26:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 26:47" />Lukolo zenizi zoha ndi zavii viveleku vya lukolo lwa Asheli, jumula yavi vavii vagosi elufu hamusini na zidatu na miya mcheche.<verse eid="NUM 26:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 26:48" />Kuhuma mulikabila la Nafutali kwavi na lukolo lwa Yaseeli na lukolo lwa Guni, <verse eid="NUM 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 26:49" />na lukolo lwa Yeseli na lukolo lwa Shilemu. <verse eid="NUM 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 26:50" />Zenizo zavili lukolo za likabila la Nafutali, vagosi vevavalangiwi vevihotola kuhamba kungondo ndi vavii elufu alobaini na mhanu na miya mcheche.<verse eid="NUM 26:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 26:51" />Vagosi voha va Vaisilaeli vevalangiwi vevavii na uhotola wa kuhamba kungondo vavi laki sita na alufu yimonga na miya saba na selasini.<verse eid="NUM 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 26:52" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 26:53" />“Vandu venavo yati vigaviwa mulima uvya wavi, kulandana na umahele wa mahina wavi. <verse eid="NUM 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 26:54" />Likabila lelinavandu vamahele lipewa pandu pavaha neju, na likabila lelina vandu vadebe yati lipewa pandu padebe, kila likabila yati lipewa pandu paki kuwanangana na umahele wavi amala udebe wavi. <verse eid="NUM 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 26:55" />Pamonga na ago ugavaji wa mulima yati mwigaviwa kwa gudugudu. Kila likabila yati lipewa mulima wavi kuwanangana na maihina ga vagogo vavi. <verse eid="NUM 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 26:56" />Ndima ya kila likabila yati yigaviwa kwa gudugudu kuwanangana na umahele wavi amala udebe wavi.”<verse eid="NUM 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 26:57" />Mulikabila la Valawi kwavili na lukolo zenizi zeziyandikwi, ndi lukolo lwa Gelishoni na lukolo lwa Kohati na lukolo lwa Melali. <verse eid="NUM 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 26:58" />Mewawa kwavili na lukolo lwa Valibini na lukolo lwa Vahebuloni na lukolo lwa Vamahili na lukolo lwa Vamushi na lukolo lwa Vakola. Kohati avili dadi wa Amlamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 26:59" />Amlamu amgegili msikana wa Lawi mweikemiwa Yokobedi, mweavelikwi ku Misili. Mwenuyu ndi yula mweababakisili Amlamu vana vavili vagosi, maiina gavi ndi Aloni na Musa na msikana mmonga liina laki Miliamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 26:60" />Aloni avi na vana vagosi mcheche, Ndi Nadabu na Abihu na Eliazali na Ithamali. <verse eid="NUM 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 26:61" />Nambu Nadabu na Abihu vafwili lukumbi pevamuwusili Chapanga luteta kwa motu wangaganiwa. <verse eid="NUM 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 26:62" />Umahele wa Valawi vagosi vevavi na ntanga wa mwehi umonga na neju yavi vavi elufu ishilini na zidatu. Venava vavalangiwi lepi pamonga na Vaisilaeli vangi ndava vene vepewili lepi pandu pa mulima pavya pavi pa Isilaeli.<verse eid="NUM 26:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 26:63" />Venava ndi vala vagosi va Isilaeli vevavalangiwi na Musa na mteta Eliazali pamulima selede wa Moabu, kumwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani, papipi na ku Yeliko. <verse eid="NUM 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 26:64" />Pagati yavi asigalili lepi hati mmonga pagati ya vala vevavalangwi na Musa na mteta Aloni vevakitili mvalangu wa kutumbula kulugangatu lwa Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 26:65" />Bambu Chapanga amali kujova kuvya voha yati vifwilila kulugangatu, ndi chakaka kawaka hati mmonga mweasigalili mumi, nambu vevasigalili ndi Kalebu mwana wa Yefuni na Yoshua mwana wa Nuni.<verse eid="NUM 26:65" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27" />
  <para style="s">Vasikana va Selofehadi vipewa pandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 27:1" />Ligono limonga vasikana muhanu va Selofehadi vevamuhambili Musa. Mahina ga vasikana venavo ndi, Mala na Noa na Hogla na Milika na Tiliza, dadi wavi ndi Selofahadi mwana wa Hefeli mwana wa Gileadi, mwana wa Makili, Manase avii wa lukolo lwa Manase mwana wa Yusufu. <verse eid="NUM 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 27:2" />Ndi vamuhambalili Musa palongolo ya Lindanda la kukonganekela na kuyima palongolo Musa na mteta Eliazali na vilongosi va Isilaeli na vandu voha va Isilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 27:3" />“Dadi witu afwilalili kulugangatu. Avili lepi pagati ya valanda va Kola mweawungini pamonga kumbela Bambu, nambu afwili kwa uhakahu waki mwene na alekili lepi mwana. <verse eid="NUM 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 27:4" />Ndava kyani lihina la dadi witu liyaga ndava avili lepi na mwana wa chigosi? Tipela pandu pitu pagati ya valongo va dadi witu.”<verse eid="NUM 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 27:5" />Penapo Musa apeliki muhalu wavi palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 27:6" />Bambu Chapanga akaamjovela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 27:7" />“Chevijova vasikana va Selofehadi ndi chakaka, vapela pandu pamonga na valongo va dadi wavi, vautola mulima wavi. <verse eid="NUM 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 27:8" />Kangi uvajovela Vaisilaeli kuvya mundu yoyoha akafwayi changali kuleka mwana mgosi, mwana waki mdala ndi yati ipewa pandu peaganikiwi kupewa dadi waki. <verse eid="NUM 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 27:9" />Ngati avi lepi na mwana mdala, hinu pandu penapo yati vipewa valongo vaki vagosi. <verse eid="NUM 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 27:10" />Ngati avi lepi na valongo vagosi, hinu pandu pavi yati ukuvapela dadi vaki, vavaha na vadebe. <verse eid="NUM 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 27:11" />Ndi ngati dadi waki avili lepi na valongo va chigosi, hinu pandu paki yati pivya pa valongo vaki va papipi, mwene yati pivya paki ngati vindu vyaki. Lenili ndi lilagisu kwa Vaisilaeli pagati ya malagizu goha, ngati nene Bambu Chapanga chenikulagizi.”<verse eid="NUM 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshua ipewa ulongosi pandu pa Musa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 31:1-8">Ukumb 31:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 27:12" />Kangi Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa, “Kwela kunani ya chitumbi ichi cha Abalimu uwulola mulima wenivapelili Visilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 27:13" />Ukamala kuwulola mewa veve yati wifwa ngati muhaja waku Aloni cheafwili, <verse eid="NUM 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 27:14" />ndava wabeli kuniyidakila mihilu yangu kulugangatu lwa Sini. Lukumbi vandu voha pevavembeniki ndava ya nene ku Meliba kula, mwalekili lepi ukulu wangu ulolekana palongolo yavi pevaganili vapewa manji.” (Meliba ndi chinyepa cha manji ga Kadeshi kulugangatu lwa Sini.)<verse eid="NUM 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 27:15" />Musa akamjovela Bambu Chapanga, <verse eid="NUM 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 27:16" />“Veve Bambu Chapanga mweukuvapela vandu wumi, nikuwomba umhagula mundu wa kuyimalila vandu ava voha, <verse eid="NUM 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 27:17" />yula mweilongolela na kuvalongosa mumahengu gavi goha, muni vakoto kuvya ngati limbelele langali mdimaji.”<verse eid="NUM 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18" />Ndava yeniyo Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa, “Mtola Yoshua mwana wa Nuni, mundu mweavi na mpungu wangu mgati yaki mvikila mawako panani yaki, <verse eid="NUM 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:19" />ndi umuyimika palongolo ya mteta Eliazali na vandu voha, ndi umgotolela lihengu lenilo palongolo yavi. <verse eid="NUM 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20" />Umpela hotola waku chidogo muni vandu voha wa Vaisilaeli vamyidakila. <verse eid="NUM 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21" />Mwene yati akumtegemela mteta Eliazali yula mweakummanyisa maganu gangu kwa kukota palongolo ya Bambu kwa kutumila liganga la ulimu na tumimu. Kwa njila iyi, Eliazali yati akumulongosa Yoshua na Vaisilaeli voha pevihoma na peviyingila.” <verse eid="NUM 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22" />Musa akakita ngati Chapanga cheamlagizi. Amtolili Yoshua na kumuyimika palongolo ya mteta Eliazali na vandu voha wa Vaisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23" />Kangi akamvikila mawoko pamutu na kumpela uhotola ngati chealagaziwi na Bambu Chapanga.<verse eid="NUM 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="NUM 28" />
  <para style="s">Luteta zeziwusiwa magono goha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 29:38-46">Kuw 29:38-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 28:1" />Bambu Chapanga amjovilili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 28:2" />“Uvapela Vaisilaeli lilagizu ili. Nyenye yati mukuniletela nene kwa lukumbi lweluvikiwi chakulya ndava ya luteta lwa kutinyiswa kwa motu, zivya unungalilu wabwina wa kuniganisa.<verse eid="NUM 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 28:3" />Uvajovela kuvya teta zevakuniwusila kwa motu ndi izi, Vanalimbelele vavili va mwaka mmonga vangali chilema chochoha ndava ya teta ya kutinyisa ya magono goha. <verse eid="NUM 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 28:4" />Mwanalimbelele mmonga awusiwa lukela na yungi kimii, <verse eid="NUM 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 28:5" />kila mmonga yati iwusiwapamonga na kilo yimonga ya uhembe weuhangisini pamonga na lita yimonga ya mahuta gabwina ga zeituni. <verse eid="NUM 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 28:6" />Yeniyi ndi teta ya magono goha ya kutinyiswa yeyatumbuliwi kuchitumbi Sinai ngati luteta lwa chakulya, yivya unungalila wabwina ya kuniganisa, luteta yeyiwusiwi kwa Bambu kwa motu. <verse eid="NUM 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 28:7" />Kwa kila mwana limbelele yati iwusiwa pamonga na luteta lwa mnyweso lita yimonga ya divayi. Yati wisopa teta yeniyi ya mnyweso uvavanu pandu Pa Msopi, yita ukuyiyitalila luteta lwenulo lwa mnyweso uvavanu kwa Bambu pandu Pamusopi. <verse eid="NUM 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 28:8" />Lukumbi lwa kimii yati umuwusa mwanalimbelele la pili kuvya luteta lwa kutinyiswa pamonga na luteta lwa chakulya na mnyweso ngati chewawusili lukela, yeniyo mewa ndi luteta lwa chakulya, unungalila wabwina wa kumganisa Bambu.”<verse eid="NUM 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luteta ya Ligono la Kupumulila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 28:9" />“Ligono la Kupumulila, yati mwiwusa teta ya mwanalimbelele vavili vagosi va mwaka umonga vangali chilema, teta ya uhembe nyililili kilo zivili weuhangisini na mahuta, na teta yaki ya mnyweso. <verse eid="NUM 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 28:10" />Teta yeniyi ya kutinyiswa yati yiwusiwa kila ligono la Kupumulila pamonga na teta ya magono goha ya kutinyiswa na teta ya mnyweso.”<verse eid="NUM 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luteta ya kila mwehi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 28:11" />“Kila ligono la kutumbula la kila mwehi yati mukumuwisila Bambu Chapanga, teta ya kutinyiswa, ng'ombi zigosi zivili vadebe na limbelele ligosi mmonga vanalimbelele vagosi saba va mwaka umonga, vangali chilema. <verse eid="NUM 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 28:12" />Yati mwiwusa teta ya uhembe nyilili kilo zidatu weuhangisini na mahuta kwa kila ng'ombi yimonga, yati mwiwusa kilo zivili za uhembe kwa kila limbelele mgosi, <verse eid="NUM 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 28:13" />pamonga na kilo yimonga ya uhembe kwa kila mwanalimbelele. Teta zenii za kutinyiswa ndi luteta lwelunaunungalila wabwina wa kumuganisa Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 28:14" />Chipimu cha teta ya mnyeso chechiganikiwa ndi lita zivili za divayi kwa kila ng'ombi yigosi, lita yimonga na yapinga kwa kila mwanalimbelele ligosi na lita yimonga kwa kila mwanalimbelele wa mwaka umonga. Yeniyi ndi teta ya kutinyiswa ya kila mwehi mumyehi yoha ya mwaka. <verse eid="NUM 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 28:15" />Neju ya teta ya magono goha ya kutinyiswa pamonga na teta yaki ya mnyweso, lipongo limonga yati liwusiwa kwa Bambu kuvya teta ya kulekekeswa kubuda.”<verse eid="NUM 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luteta lwa Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:5-14">Vala 23:5-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 28:16" />“Ligono la kumi na mcheche la mwehi wa kutumbula ndi Pasaka ya Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 28:17" />Ligono la kumi na mahanu la mwehi wuwowo ndi mselebuko. Kwa magono saba yati mwilya mabumunda gangali ngemeku. <verse eid="NUM 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 28:18" />Paligono la kutumbula yati kwivya na mngonganu wa kumuyupa Chapanga. Ligono lenilo mkoto kuhenga lihengu. <verse eid="NUM 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 28:19" />Yati mwiwusa teta za kutinyiswa ngati luteta lwa chakulya kwa Bambu Chapanga, ng'ombi yigosi zivili na limbelele ligosi limonga na vanalimbelele saba va mwaka umonga, voha vangali chilema. <verse eid="NUM 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 28:20" />Teta ya uhembe yeyiwusiwa pamonga nayu ndi uhembe wabwina weuhangisini na mahuta, kilo zidatu kwa kila ng'ombi yigosi yimonga na kilo zivili kwa kila limbelele ligosi limonga, <verse eid="NUM 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 28:21" />pamonga na kilo ya uhembe yimonga kwa kila mmonga wa vala vanalimbelele saba. <verse eid="NUM 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 28:22" />Mewa yati mwiwusa lipongo limonga kuvya teta lwa kulekekesa kumbudili Chapanga ndava ya kuvakitila utepulanisi. <verse eid="NUM 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 28:23" />Yati mwiwusa vindu vyenivi changali kuleka kuwusa luteta lula lwa kutinyiswa lwa uyovalelu lweluwusiwa magono goha lukela. <verse eid="NUM 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 28:24" />Mewawa, kwa magono saba, yati mwiwusa teta ya kutinyiswa lwa magono goha ya chakulya cha kutinyisa, yila yeyinungalila bwina ya kumganisa Bambu Chapanga. Muwusa yeniyi changali kuleka kuwusa luteta lwa kutinyiswa lwa magono goha na luteta lwa yaki ya mnyeso. <verse eid="NUM 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 28:25" />Paligono la saba yati mwikonganeka ndava ya kumufugamila Chapanga, na mkoto kuhenga lihengu.”<verse eid="NUM 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mselebuko wa luteta lwa majuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:15-22">Vala 23:15-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 28:26" />“Paligono la kutumbula la mselebuko wa mjuma lukumbi pemukumuwusiala Bambu Chapanga, teta ya mabenu ginu ga kutumbula, yati mwikonganeka ndava ya kumfugamila Chapanga, mkoto kuhengu lihengu. <verse eid="NUM 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 28:27" />Yati mwiwusa luteta lwa kutinyiswa, yivya unungalilu wabwina wa kumganisa Bambu lwa ng'ombi zigosi zivili, limbelele ligosi limonga na vanalimbelele saba vagosi va mwaka umonga. Voha vavya vangali chilema. <verse eid="NUM 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 28:28" />Teta ya uhembe yeyivya pamonga na zenizo yati yivya uhembe kilo zidatu weuhangisini na mahuta kwa kila ng'ombi yigosi, na kilo zivili kwa kila limbelele ligosi, <verse eid="NUM 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 28:29" />na kilo yimonga kwa kila vanalimbelele saba vala. <verse eid="NUM 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 28:30" />Mewa yati mwiwusa lipongo limonga kwa kuvya luteta lwa kulekekesa kumbudila Chapanga ndava ya kukitiwa utepulanisi. <verse eid="NUM 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 28:31" />Tendekehayi luteta pamonga na luteta zaki za minyweso, changali kuleka kuwusa luteta lula lwa magono goha lwa kutinyiswa, pamonga na teta zaki za uhembe. Vinyama vyenivyo vikotoka kuvya na chilema.”<verse eid="NUM 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="NUM 29" />
  <para style="s">Mselebuko wa utumbulanu wa mwaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:23-25">Vala 23:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 29:1" />Ligono la kutumbula la mwehi wa saba, yati mwivya mngonganu ndava ya kumfugamila Bambu mkoto kuhenga lihengu. Ligono lenilo ndi ligono la kupyula mapenenga. <verse eid="NUM 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 29:2" />Ndi yati mwiwusa teta ya kutinyiswa, yivya na unungalila bwina wa kumganisa Bambu Chapanga, ng'ombi yigosi, limbelele ligosi limonga pamonga na vamambelele vagosi saba va mwaka umonga voha vakoto kuvya na chilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 29:3" />Mewa yati mwiwusa teta yaki ya uhembe wabwina weuhangisini na mahuta, Kilo zidatu kwa kila ng'ombi yigo na kilo zivili kwa kila limbelele ligosi, <verse eid="NUM 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 29:4" />pamonga na kilo yimonga kwa kila mwanalimbelele. <verse eid="NUM 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 29:5" />Kangi yati mwiwusa lipongo limonga kwa kila teta ya kulekekesa kumbudila Chapanga ndava ya kukitiwa utepulanisi. <verse eid="NUM 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 29:6" />Chenichi ndi chiyonjokesu cha teta za kutinyiswa za kila mwehi na kila ligono pamonga na teta zaki za uhembe na teta za minyweso ngati chayiganikiwa. Changali kuleka teta zeziwusiwa kwa Bambu kwa motu, zivya unungalilu wabwina.<verse eid="NUM 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Teta za ligono la utepulanisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:26-32">Vala 23:26-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 29:7" />“Ligono la kumi la mwehi wa saba yati mwikita mngonganu ndava ya kumfugamila Bambu. Ligolo lenilo yikuvagana kujihinisa chakulya na mkoto kuhenga lihengu. <verse eid="NUM 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 29:8" />Mewa yati mukumuwusila Bambu Chapanga teta ya kutinyiswa kwa motu, yivya unungalila wa kumganisa Bambu Chapanga, Mpapakasi mmonga, limbelele ligosi limonga vanalimbelele saba va mwaka umonga. Voha vakoto kuvya na chilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 29:9" />Pamonga na ng'ombi zigosi mtendekeha teta ya mabenu pandu pa lilundu la datu la kumi za uhembe nyilili weuhangasini na mahuta, Pamonga na limbelele ligosi, na pandu pa zivili za kumi za uhembe nyilili, <verse eid="NUM 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 29:10" />na kilo yimonga kwa kila mwanalimbele pagati ya vala saba. <verse eid="NUM 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 29:11" />Mewa yati mwiwusa lipongo limonga kuvya luteta lwa kulekekesa kumbudila Chapanga ya kukitiwa utepulanisa, pamonga na teta ya uyovelu wa kutinyiswa na teta yaki ya uhembe na teta zaki za mnyweso.”<verse eid="NUM 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Teta ya mselebuko wa vindanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:33-43">Vala 23:33-43</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13-17">Ukumb 16:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 29:12" />Ligono la kumi na mhanu ya mwehi wa saba, yati mwikita mngonganu ndava ya kumfugamila Bambu Chapanga. Mkoto kuhenga lihengu ligono lenilo. Ndi ya mselebuko ndava ya Bambu Chapanga kwa magono saba. <verse eid="NUM 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 29:13" />Yati mwiwusa teta ya kutinyiswa kwa motu, unungalila bwina yeyikumganisa Bambu Chapanga, ng'ombi zigosi kumi na vadatu, mambelele gagosi gavili vanalimbelele kumi na mcheche va mwaka umonga. Voha vakoto kuvya na chilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 29:14" />Pamonga na ng'ombi zigosi kumi na zidatu, kila yimonga yitendekewa na teta ya pandu pa datu pa kumi za uhembe nyilili weuhangasini na mahuta, kwa mambelele gavili gagosi, kila limonga litendekewa pandu zivili ya kumi za uhembe nyilili, <verse eid="NUM 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 29:15" />na kilo yimonga kwa kila limbelele ligosi. <verse eid="NUM 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 29:16" />Mewa yati mwiwusa lipongo limonga kuvya teta ya kulekekesa kumbudila Chapanga yivya teta ya magono goha ya kutinyiswa, changali kuleka kuwusa teta yaki ya uhembe na teta yaki ya mnyweso.<verse eid="NUM 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 29:17" />“Paligono la pili yati muwusa, ng'ombi zigosi kumi na vavili na mambelele magosi gavili na vanalimbelele kumi na mchehe, va mwaka umonga vangali chilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 29:18" />Mewa yati mwiwusa teta ya uhembe na teta za mnyweso pamonga na vala ng'ombi zigosi na mambelele na vanalimbelele va mwaka umonga, kuwanangana na umahele wavi. <verse eid="NUM 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 29:19" />Mewawa yati mwiwusa lipongo limonga kuvya teta ya kulekekesa kumbudila Chapanga, changali kuleka teta ya kutinyiswa ya magono goha pamonga na teta yaki ya uhembe na teta yaki ya mnyweso.”<verse eid="NUM 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 29:20" />“Ligono la datu yati mwiwusa, Ngombi zigosi kumi na yimonga mambelele gagosi gavili, vanalimbelele kumi na mcheche va mwaka umonga, vangali chilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 29:21" />Yati mukuvawusila pamonga na teta ya uhembe na teta ya mnyweso ngati cheyilagiswi kuwanangana na umahele wavi. <verse eid="NUM 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 29:22" />Mewawa yati mwiwusa lipongo limonga kwa teta ya kulekekesa kubuda, changali kuleka teta ya magono goha za kutinyiswa, na teta yaki ya uhembe na teta yaki ya mnyweso.”<verse eid="NUM 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 29:23" />“Ndi ligono la mcheche yati mwiwusa, Ng'ombi zigosi kumi na mambelele magosi gavili na vanalimbelele kumi na mcheche va mwaka umonga, voha vangali chilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 29:24" />Mewa yati mwiwusa teta ya uhembe na teta za minyweso pamonga na ng'ombi zigosi zila na mambelele na vanalimbelele, kuwanangana na umahele wavi, ngati cheiganikiwa. <verse eid="NUM 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 29:25" />Kangi yati mwiwusa mewa lipongo limonga kwa teta ya kulekekesa kubuda changali kuleka teta ya magono goha ya kutinyiswa, pamonga na teta ya uhembe na teta yaki ya mnyweso.”<verse eid="NUM 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 29:26" />“Paligono la mhanu, yati mwiwusa ngombi zigosi tisa na mambelele gavili na vanalimbelele magosi kumi na mcheche va mwaka mumonga voha vavya vangali chilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 29:27" />Mewawa yati mwiwusa teta ya uhembe na teta za mnyweso pamonga na ngombi zigosi zila na mambelele na vanalimbelele, kuwanangana na umahele wavi ngati cheyilagiswi. <verse eid="NUM 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 29:28" />Kangi yati mwiwusa mewa lipongo limonga kwa teta ya kulekekesa kubuda, changali kuleka teta ya magono goha kutinyiswa, pamongana na teta yaki ya uhembe na teta yaki ya mnyweso.”<verse eid="NUM 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 29:29" />“Paligono la sita yati mwiwusa ng'ombi zigosi nane na mambelele gagosi gavili pamonga na vanalimbelele gagosi kumi na mcheche va mwaka umonga voha vavya vyangali chilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 29:30" />Mewa yati mwiwusa teta ya uhembe na teta za mnyweso pamonga na ng'ombi zigosi zila na mambelele gagosi na vanalimbelele kumi na mcheche va mwaka umonga kuwanangana na umahele wavi, ngati cheyilagiswi. <verse eid="NUM 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 29:31" />Yati mwiwusa lipongo limonga kuvya teta ya kulekekesa kubuda, changali kuleka teta yaki ya uhembe na teta zaki za mnyweso.”<verse eid="NUM 29:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 29:32" />Paligono la saba yati mwiwusa ng'ombi zigosi saba na mambelele gagosi gavili vanalimbelele gagosi kumi na mcheche va mwaka umonga, goha vangali chilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 29:33" />Mewawa yati mwiwusa teta ya uhembe na teta za mnyweso pamonga na ng'ombi zigosi zila, na mambelele gagosi na vanalimbelele na kuwanangana na umahele wavi, ngati cheyilagiswi. <verse eid="NUM 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 29:34" />Mewa yati mwiwusa lipongo limona kuvya teta ya kulekekesa kubuda, changali kuleka teta ya magono goha ya kutinyiswa, pamonga na teta yaki ya uhembe na teta yaki ya mnyweso.<verse eid="NUM 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 29:35" />“Paligono la nane yati mwivya na mngonganu uvaha wa kumfugamila Chapanga. Mkoto kuhenga ligono lenilo. <verse eid="NUM 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 29:36" />Mewa yati mwiwusa teta ya kutinyiswa yeyinungalila bwina ya kumganisa Bambu Chapanga, Ng'ombi yigosi yimonga na limbelele ligosi limonga na vanalimbelele saba va mwaka umonga voha vangali chilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 29:37" />Mewawa yati mwiwusa teta ya uhembe na teta za mnyweso pamonga na ng'ombi yigosi yeniyo na limbelele ligosi na vanalimbelele vagosi saba va mwaka umonga vala kuwanangana na umahele wavi, ngati cheyilagiswi. <verse eid="NUM 29:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 29:38" />Mewa yati mwiwusa lipongo limonga kuvya teta ya kulekekesa kubuda, changali kuleka teta ya magono goha ya kutinyiswa pamonga na teta yaki ya uhembe na teta ya mnyweso.”<verse eid="NUM 29:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 29:39" />“Genaga ndi malagizu kuvala luteta lwa kutinyiswa luteta lwa uhembe na luteta lwa uteke zemukumuwusila Bambu Chapanga lukumbi lwa miselebuko zinu zezihamuliwi. Pamonga na zenizo zoha, mewa zivili teta za kutinyiswa na teta ya uhembe na teta ya mnyweso zemukumuwusila Bambu Chachapa muni kutimisa nazili zinu na teta zinu za magono goha.”<verse eid="NUM 29:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 29:40" />Hinu Musa avajovili Vaisilaeli kila chindu ngati Bambu Chapanga cheavalagizi.<verse eid="NUM 29:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="NUM 30" />
  <para style="s">Mihilu kuvala nazili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 30:1" />Kangi Musa akalongela na vachilongosi va makabila ga Isilaeli, akavajovela, “Bambu Chapanga, ilagisa naha. <verse eid="NUM 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 30:2" />Mundu akavika nazili kwa Bambu amala akajovayi mwene kwa kulapa kuvya akumpela Chapanga chindu yati ivya ajikungili mwene, yiganikiwa akotoka kung'anamusa linenu laki ndi iganikiwa akita goha geagajovili mwene.”<verse eid="NUM 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 30:3" />“Msikana mweakona itama kunyumba ya dadi waki akavikayi nazili kwa Bambu Chapanga kuvya yati akumupela chindu ndi iganikiwa ayitimilisa, <verse eid="NUM 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 30:4" />na dadi waki amali kuyuwana ahadi yeniyo, na akotoka kumbelalela, hinu iganikiwa kutimilisa nazili yaki kwa kuwusa kila chindu cheavikili. <verse eid="NUM 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 30:5" />Nambu ngati dadi waki akammbesayi lukumbi peiyuwana, nazili zenizo na chilapuchenicho kawaka chechikumukunga.”<verse eid="NUM 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 30:6" />“Ngati igegewa lukumbu amali kuvika chilapu amala ajovili ahadi nunuyu changaholalela ndi ivya ajikungili mwene, <verse eid="NUM 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 30:7" />ndi mgosi waki akayuwana lijambo lenilo akotoka kumbesa, hinu chilapu chaki yati chilandana na ahadi zaki yati iganikiwa akita ngati chaajovili. <verse eid="NUM 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 30:8" />Nambu ngati mgosi waki akayuwana lijambu lenilo na akambesa, msikana mwenuyo iganikiwa lepi kukita geajovili ndi Bambu Chapanga yati akumlekekesa.”<verse eid="NUM 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 30:9" />“Ngati lipwela yoyoha amala mdala mwealekiwi akavika nazili amala ahadi yoyoha viganikiwa vawusa chavajovili.”<verse eid="NUM 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 30:10" />“Nambu mdala mweagegiwi na avii kunyumba ya mgwana waki akavika nazili amala ahidi kwa kulapa, <verse eid="NUM 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 30:11" />kangi mngwana waki akayuwana lijambu lenilo nambu akoto kumdivala, amala kumjovela chochoha, hinu iganikiwa mdala mwenuyo akita goha geajovili. <verse eid="NUM 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 30:12" />Nambu ngati mngwana waki yati iyuwana na kumbesa, hinu mdala mwenuyo iganikiwa lepi kukita cheajovili, na Bambu Chapanga yati akumlekekesa mdala mwenuyo. <verse eid="NUM 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 30:13" />Mngwana waki ihotola kumbesa amala kumyidakila mdala waki kukitagala geajovili akugakita kwa Bambu. <verse eid="NUM 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 30:14" />Nambu ngati mngwana waki ijova lepi chochoa kuhumila peayuwini kuvala nzili amala ahadi yeavikili mdala waki, yati ivya ayidakili kuwusa goha geahaidi mdala waki. <verse eid="NUM 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 30:15" />Nambu ngati mngwana waki akumbesa lepi pala peayuwini hinu lawama zenizo yati zivya za mnganawaki.”<verse eid="NUM 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 30:16" />Genaga ndi malagizu gala Bambu chapanga amlagizi Musa kuvala mambu ga mngwana na mdala waki, na pagati ya dadi na msikana waki yula mweakona angagegewa.<verse eid="NUM 30:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="NUM 31" />
  <para style="s">Vaisilaeli vitovana ngondo na Vamidiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 31:1" />Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 31:2" />“Uvawuyisila mambu gahakau gala Vamidiani gevavakitili Vaisilaeli, kangi veve yati wifwa.”<verse eid="NUM 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 31:3" />Hinu Musa akalongela na Vaisilaeli akavajovela, “Muvatendekela vandu kwa ngondo vahamba kuvazangila Vamidiani kuvawuyisila ndava ya Bambu Chapanga gala gevatikitili tete. <verse eid="NUM 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 31:4" />Kuhuma kila likabila la Isilaeli, yati mwipeleka vandu elufu yimonga kungondo.”<verse eid="NUM 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 31:5" />Hinu vandu elufu yimonga vawusiwi kuhuma mukila likabila pagati ya maelufu ya Vaisilaeli, mvalangu wavi wavivagosi elufu kumi na zivili vevavi na vindu vya kukomanila ngondo. <verse eid="NUM 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 31:6" />Musa avapeliki kungondo vandu elifu yimonga kuhuma mukila likabila kwa uyimalila wa Finehasi mwana wa mteta Eliazali, kuni avi na vindu vya pandu pa kumufugamila Chapangana mapenenga ga ulangisu. <verse eid="NUM 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 31:7" />Vauzangili mulima wa Midiani, ngati Bambu Chapanga cheamlagizi Musa, ndi vakavakoma vagosi voha. <verse eid="NUM 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 31:8" />Pagati ya vandu venavo vevakomiwi, kwavili va nkosi mhanu wa Midiani, vene ndi Evi na Lekemu na Suli na Huli pamonga na Leba. Mewawa vamkomili Balaamu mwana wa Beoli.<verse eid="NUM 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 31:9" />Vaisilaeli vavakamwili kungondo vadala va chimidiani pamonga na vana vavi vatolili kwa makakala misambi ya ng'ombi na mambelele na vindu vyoha vya Vamidiani. <verse eid="NUM 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 31:10" />Vayochili motu miji yavi yoha yila Vamidiani yevatamili, pamonga na kambi zavi zoha. <verse eid="NUM 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 31:11" />Vatolili vindu vyoha, mewa vavakamwili kwa makakala vandu pamonga na hinyama, <verse eid="NUM 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 31:12" />vakampelekela Musa na Eliazali, na vandu Vaisilaeli voha vevatamayi kukambini ku mulima wa selede wa Moabu, kumwambu ya papipi na Yeliko.<verse eid="NUM 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manjolinjoli viwuya kuhuma ku kungondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 31:13" />Musa na mteta Eliazali pamonga na vachilongosi voha va Vaisilaeli vahumili kukambi na kuhamba kuvapokela manjolinjoli. <verse eid="NUM 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 31:14" />Musa avayomili vakulu va vandu va ngondo, ndi vala vakulu wa vandu maelufu na vakulu va vandu miya va ngondo, vala vevawuyili kuhuma kungondo. <verse eid="NUM 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 31:15" />Musa akavakota, “Ndava kayani muvalekili vadala ava muni? <verse eid="NUM 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 31:16" />Mukumbukayi kuvya vadala ndi vevalandili mpangu wa Balaamu. vakavakita Vaisilaeli vambela Bambu Chapanga ku Peoli hati matamu gahakau gakavakolela vandu va Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 31:17" />Ndava yeniyo muvakoma vana voha vagosi kila mdala mweamali kugona na mgosi. <verse eid="NUM 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 31:18" />Nambu mkoto kuvakoma vasika voha vangagona na vagosi, muvaleka mumi ndava yinu mwavene. <verse eid="NUM 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 31:19" />Voha vala vevavii pagati yinu vala vevakomili mundu amala kupamisa mundu mweafwili ndi yiganikiwa vatama kuvala ya kambi kwa magono saba, mujinyambisa na vavanda vinu paligono la datu na la saba. <verse eid="NUM 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 31:20" />Mchapa nyula zinu bwina pamonga na kila chindu chechitenganizwi kwa chikumba cha mene amala mkongo.”<verse eid="NUM 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 31:21" />“Kangi mteta Eliazali akavajovela vagosi vevawuyili kungondo, Yeniyi ndi mihilu yila Bambu Chapanga ampelili Musa. <verse eid="NUM 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 31:22" />Zahabu na hipandi ya madini ga feza na lyuma na bati na madini ga lisasi, <verse eid="NUM 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 31:23" />ndi vindu vyoha vila vyevisindimala motu, yati vinyambiswa kwa kupitila kumoto, hati vyenivyo, ndi yiganikiwa vinyambiswa kwa manji ga unyambiso. Vindu vingi vyoha vila vyangasindimala moto yati vinyambiswa kwa manji ga unyambiso. <verse eid="NUM 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 31:24" />Paligono la saba ndi yiganikiwa muchapa nyula zinu, ndi yati bwina na kuyidakiliwa kuyingila kukambi.”<verse eid="NUM 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugavana vindu vyevikamuliwi kungondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 31:25" />Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 31:26" />“Veve na mteta Eliazali pamonga na vachilongosi va makabila ga Vaisilaeli, mvalanga vandu voha na hinyama vala vemvatolili kungondo. <verse eid="NUM 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 31:27" />Mgava vindu vyemtoli kungondo malundu gavili, lilundu limonga ndava ya msambi wa vandu va ngondo vevahambi kungono na lilundu lingi ndava ya vandu voha. <verse eid="NUM 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 31:28" />Kangi tola lilundu limonga pagati ya kumi kwa vandu vevahambili kungondo, ndava ya Bambu Chapanga, chindu chimonga kuhuma muvindu miya mhanu, yivya vandu amala ng'ombi amala punda amala limbelele amala mene, <verse eid="NUM 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 31:29" />umpela mteta Eliazali kuvya teta kwa Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 31:30" />Kuhuma mulilundu lila la vandu voha, tola lilundu limonga pagati ya hamusini, yikavya vandu amala ng'ombi amala punda amala limbelele amala mene. Vyenivyo yati ukuvapela Valawi vala vevikita lihengu mu Lindanda la kukonganeka na Bambu. <verse eid="NUM 31:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 31:31" />Musa na mteta Eliazali vakakita ngati Bambu Chapanga cheamlagizi Musa.”<verse eid="NUM 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 31:32" />Vindu vyevanyagili Vaisilaeli ku ngondo vyavili, mambelele laki sita na elufu sabini na mhanu, <verse eid="NUM 31:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 31:33" />ng'ombi elufu sabini na zivili, <verse eid="NUM 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 31:34" />punda elufu sitini na yimonga, <verse eid="NUM 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 31:35" />na vasikana vangagona na vagosi elufu selasini na vavili. <verse eid="NUM 31:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 31:36" />Yapinga ya lilundu ya vala vevahambi kutovana ngondo yavi mambelele laki zidatu na selasini na saba na miya mhanu. <verse eid="NUM 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 31:37" />Mumambelele ago, mambelele miya sita sabini na muhanu gawusiwi kwa Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 31:38" />Ng'ombi zevapewili manjolinjoli zavili elufu selasini na sita, ndi pagati ya zenizo sabini na zivili zawusiwi ndava ya Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 31:39" />Punda zavili elufu selasini na miya muhanu, pagati ya zenizo sitini na yimonga zawusiwi luteta ndava ya Bambu Chapanga <verse eid="NUM 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 31:40" />Vandu vavi elufu kumi na sita, na pagati ya avo lilundu la Bambu Chapanga yavi vandu selasini na vavili. <verse eid="NUM 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 31:41" />Hinu Musa akampela mteta Eliazali mawusilu genago gegawusiwi ndava ya Chapanga, ngati Bambu Chapanga cheamlagizi Musa.<verse eid="NUM 31:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 31:42" />Kavili yapinga yevapewi Vaisilaeli, yila Musa yeaibagwili na yapinga yila vapewili misambi wa vandu va ngondo vevahambili kungondo. <verse eid="NUM 31:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 31:43" />yapinga yeyavili ya vandu yavii mambelele laki zitadu na elufu selasini na saba na miya muhanu, <verse eid="NUM 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 31:44" />na ng'ombi elufu selasini na sita, <verse eid="NUM 31:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 31:45" />na punda elufuselasini na miya muhanu, <verse eid="NUM 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 31:46" />na vandu elufu kumi na sita. <verse eid="NUM 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 31:47" />Kuhuma yapinga yeniyo yeyavi ya Vaisilaeli, Musa ahagwili yimonga pagati ya hamusini ya vandu na hinyama, ngati Bambu Chapanga cheamlagizi, mwene akavapela Valawi, vala vevikita lihengu la kuyangalila Lindanda la Bambu Chapanga.<verse eid="NUM 31:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 31:48" />Kangi vakulu vala vevavi vavaha va manjolinjoli, vakulu va msambi wa vandu maelufu na vakulu va misambi ya vandu miya, vamhambili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 31:49" />vakamjovela, “Vatumisi vaku tavavalingi manjolinjoli voha vevavi pahi ya uyimalila witu tiloli kuvya kawaka hati mmonga mweapungwiki. <verse eid="NUM 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 31:50" />Hinu tiletili yombo ya zahabu na vikuku na bangili na pete na vipuli na shanga ndi kila mundu apatili. tiviwusili muni kukita utepulanisu palongolo ya Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 31:51" />Musa na mteta Eliazali vapokili vindu vyoha vyevyanyaliwi zahabu. <verse eid="NUM 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 31:52" />Jumula ya zahabu yoha yevamuwusili Bambu Chapanga yavi papipi kilo miya zivili. <verse eid="NUM 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 31:53" />Kila linjolinjoli ajitolili vindu vyevatolili kungondo kuvya vyaki mwene. <verse eid="NUM 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 31:54" />Musa na mteta Eliazali vapokili zahabu kuhuma kwa vakulu va manjolinjoli na kuyipeleka ku Lindanda la mngonganu muni yivya ukumbuso wa Vaisilaeli palongolo ya Bambu.”<verse eid="NUM 31:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="NUM 32" />
  <para style="s">Makabila ga kwelihumila lilanga ya Yoludani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 3:12-22">Ukumb 3:12-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 32:1" />Makabila ga Lubeni na Gadi vavii na mifuya yamahele neju. Hinu, pevawene kuvya pandu pa Yezeli na pandu pa Gadi pabwina kwa mifuya, <verse eid="NUM 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 32:2" />Ndi vamhambili Musa na mteta Eliazali na vachilongosi va Vaisilaeli, vakavajovela, <verse eid="NUM 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 32:3" />“Miji ya Ataloni na Diboni na Yazeli na Nimla na Heshiboni na Eleale na Sebamu na Nebo pamonga na Beoni, <verse eid="NUM 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 32:4" />mulima wenuo Bambu Chapanga auhotwili ndava ya vandu va Isilaeli, ndi mulima wabwina kwa mifuya, tete tivi na mifuya yamahele neju. <verse eid="NUM 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 32:5" />Hinu ngati mukutiyidakila, tikuvayupa mulima uwu uvya witu, mkoto kutikupusa kumwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani.”<verse eid="NUM 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 32:6" />Musa akavayangula vandu va makabila ga Lubeni na Gadi, “Wu, mwigana kusigalila bahapa kuni valongo vinu Vaisilaeli vihamba kungondo? <verse eid="NUM 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 32:7" />Ndava kyani mukuvatotokisa Vaisilaeli vakato kuhamba kumlima wula Bambu Chapanga avapelili? <verse eid="NUM 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 32:8" />Chenicho ndi chevakitili vagogo vinu pala penavatumili kuhuma Kadeshi Balinea kuhamba kuung'omesa mulima. <verse eid="NUM 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 32:9" />Vene vahambili mbaka kulikemba la Eshikoli, vauwene mulima nambu pevawuyili vavatotokisi wa Vaisilaeli, muni vakoto kuyingila ku mulima wevapewili na Bambu Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 32:10" />Ligono lenilo Bambu Chapanga akamema ligoga, ndi akalapa akajova, <verse eid="NUM 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 32:11" />‘Chakaka kawaka mundu yeyoha pagati ya vandu vevahumili ku Misili mweavi na miyaka ishilini na neju mweakuuwona mulima wenalapili kuvapela Ibulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo. Nambu vene vaniyuwanili lepi.’ <verse eid="NUM 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 32:12" />Voha vakuyilola lepi, nga Kalebu mwana wa Yefune mundu kuhuma lukolo lwa Kenizi, na Yoshua mwana wa Nuni, muni vene vaniyuwanili njwe. <verse eid="NUM 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 32:13" />Bambu Chapanga akamema ligoga ndava ya Vaisilaeli, ndi akavakita valyungalyunga kulugangatu kwa miyaka alobaini, mbaka chivelaku chila choha chechambudili palongolo yaki chafwili. <verse eid="NUM 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 32:14" />Ndi hinu nyenye cheveleku cha Leubeni na Gadi ndi mukita galagala gevakitili Vagogo vinu na kumkita Bambu Chapanga avayoma. <verse eid="NUM 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 32:15" />Ngati nyenye mwibela kumlanda, mwene yati akuvaleka kavili kulugangatu, na nyenye yati mwikita vandu ava voha voyongomela.”<verse eid="NUM 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 32:16" />“Hinu vachilongosi vakamhambila Musa, vakamjovela, Utiyidakila hoti tivajengela mifuya yitu vivaya na miji yeyina ngomi ndava ya vana na vadala vitu. <verse eid="NUM 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 32:17" />Nambu tete tijitendelekili kutola vindu vitu vya kukomanila ngondo, kulongolela kulongolo ya Vaisilaeli mbaka petukuvahikisa pandu pevitama. Lukumbi ulo Vadala na vana vitu vitama pamiji yeyivi ngomi, ndava ya kujivikila ulonda kwa vakolonjinji va mulima. <verse eid="NUM 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 32:18" />Yati tiwuya lepi kunyumba mbaka kila Muisilaeli italalila pandu paki peagaviwi. <verse eid="NUM 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 32:19" />Yati titola lepi ndima yoyoha kumwambu ya mfuleni Yolodani, ndava tete tipatili pandu pitu kuni upandi welihumila lilanga.”<verse eid="NUM 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 32:20" />Kangi Musa akavajovela, “Ngati chakaka yati mwikita ngati chamjovili, ndi bahapa palongolo ya Bambu Chapnga mtola vindu vunu vya ngondo na kuhamba kungondo. <verse eid="NUM 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 32:21" />Kila mundu winu wa ngondo yati ikupuka mfuleni Yoludani kuni muvi pahi ya ulongosi wa Bambu Chapanga, yati mukuvatova makoko vitu mbaka Bambu Chapanga avahotola, <verse eid="NUM 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 32:22" />na kutalali mulima. Mkamala kukita chenicho yati mwiwuya, muni yati mwivya mumali lihengu linu, kwa Bambu Chapanga na valongo vinu Vaisilaeli. Kangi Bambu Chapanga yati iyidakila mulima uwu wa kwelihumila lilanga wa ku Yoludani kuvya utalalila winu. <verse eid="NUM 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 32:23" />Nambu nikuvalangisa kuvya ngati mtikitili lepi gemukugajova, yati mukumbudili Bambu Chapanga, chakaka mmumanya kuvya yati mwibuniwa. <verse eid="NUM 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 32:24" />Hinu muvajengela miji vadala na vana vinu na vivaya mifuya yinu, nambu mkita ngati chemuahidi.”<verse eid="NUM 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 32:25" />Kangi vandu va makabila ga Gadi na Lubeni vakamjovela Musa, “Tete tavatumisi vaku yati tikita ngati cheutilagizi. <verse eid="NUM 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 32:26" />Vadala vitu na vana vitu pamonga na misambi ya mene na mambelele na ngo'mbi zitu yati visigalila bahapa pamiji ya Gileadi. <verse eid="NUM 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 32:27" />Nambu tete tavatumisi vaku tijitendekili kuhamba kungondo pahi ya ulongosi wa Bambu Chapanga. Yati tikupuka mfuleni Yoludani na kutovana, ngati cheutijovili.”<verse eid="NUM 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 32:28" />Kangi Musa akavalagiza mteta Eliazali na Yoshua mwana wa Nuni na vachilongosi va vandu va makabila ga Vaisilaeli kuvavala vandu va. <verse eid="NUM 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 32:29" />Musa akavajovela, “Ngati vandu va Gadi na Valubeni vakakupuka mfuleni Yolodani pamonga na nyenye kuni vagegi vindu vyavi vya kumanila ngondo, pahi ya ulongosi wa Bambu Chapanga, mukahotola na kutola mulima wenuwo, ndi yati mukuvapela mulima wa Vageleadi uvya wavi. <verse eid="NUM 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 32:30" />Nambu ngati vakupwiki lepi mfuleni Yoludani na kuwungana na nyenye kuhamba kutovana ngondo pamonga na nyenye, ndi yati vitalalila mulima wa Kanaani pamonga na nyenye.”<verse eid="NUM 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 32:31" />Vandu va likabila la Gadi na Valubeni vakayangula, “Bambu, tete yati tikita ngati Bambu Chapanga cheatijovili tete tavatumisi vaku. <verse eid="NUM 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 32:32" />Pahi ya ulongosi waki Bambu Chapanga, yati tikupuka na vindu vya ngondo vitu mbaka mulima wa Kanaani, nambu mulima wetipewili penapa kwelihumila lilanga mwa mfuleni Yoludani yati yivya witu.”<verse eid="NUM 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 32:33" />Hinu Musa akavapela vandu va makabila ga Gadi na Lubeni na yapinga ya likabila la Manase mwana wa Yosefu, mulima woha wa nkosi Sihoni wa Vaamoli na mulima wa nkosi Ogu wa Bashani pamonga na miji yeyivili mumuhana ya mulima yeniyo. <verse eid="NUM 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 32:34" />Vandu va likabila la Gadi vajengili miji ya Diboni na Ataloti na Aloeli, <verse eid="NUM 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 32:35" />pamonga na Atoti Shofani na Yazeli na Yogobeha, <verse eid="NUM 32:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 32:36" />na Beti Nimla na Beti Halani, miji yetindiwi luwumba ngangali, yeyina vivaya vya mene na mambelele. <verse eid="NUM 32:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 32:37" />Vandu va likabila la Lubeni vajengilli miji ya Heshiboni na Eleale na Kiliataimu, <verse eid="NUM 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 32:38" />Nebo na Baal Meoni, mahina ga miji yeniyo gabadilishwi, na Sibina. Miji yevajengili vayipeli mahina gangi.<verse eid="NUM 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 32:39" />Vachiveleku va Makili, mwana wa Manase, vauzangili mulima wa Gileadi, vakatola na kuvavinga Vaamoli vevatamayi penapo. <verse eid="NUM 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 32:40" />Ndava yeniyo, Musa akavapela vandu va lukolo lwa Makili mwana wa Manase, mulima wa Gileadi na vene vakatama penapo. <verse eid="NUM 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 32:41" />Yaili wa likabila la Manase, azangili na kuvitola hijiji ya Gileadi na kuvikemela liina Hawoti Yaili mana yaki hijiji ya Yaili. <verse eid="NUM 32:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 32:42" />Mwene Noba azangili na kuyitola Kenati na hijiji yaki, na mwene akaukemela mulima wenuwo Noba ndi liina laki mwene.<verse eid="NUM 32:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="NUM 33" />
  <para style="s">Lugendu lwa kuhuma misili kuhamba Moabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 33:1" />Vyenivi ndi pandu pavavikili kambi pavahumili ku Misili kuni vavi mumisambi ya makabila gavi pahi ya uyimalila wa Musa na Aloni. <verse eid="NUM 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 33:2" />Kwa malagizu ga Bambu Chapanga, Musa ayandiki lihina kila pandu pavavikili kambi mulugendu lwavi. Zenivi ndi zavili kambi mulugendu lwavi.<verse eid="NUM 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 33:3" />Vaisilaeli vakawuka muji wa Lamesisi muligono la kumi na mhanu ya mwehi wa kutumbula ligono limonga peyamaliki Pasaka. Vakawuka kwa ukekesi uvaha palongolo ya Vamisili voha, <verse eid="NUM 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 33:4" />lukumbi ulo Vamisili vazikayi vavelekwa vavi va kutumbula vagosi vevakomiwi na Bambu Chapanga, muni Bambu Chapanga amukubuna hati michapanga yavi.<verse eid="NUM 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 33:5" />Hinu, Vaisilaeli vawukili Lamesisi na kuvika kambi kwenuko Sukoti. <verse eid="NUM 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 33:6" />Kuhuma Sukoti, vakavika kambi kwenuko Etamu pamuhana ya lugangatu. <verse eid="NUM 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 33:7" />Vakawuka Etamu, vakang'anamuka vakauwuya Pi Hahiloti mbaka kwelihumila lilanga la Baali Sefoni, vakavika kambi papipi na Migidoli. <verse eid="NUM 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 33:8" />Vawukili Pi Hahiloti, vapitili nyanja ya Shamu mabaka lugangatu lwa Etamu, vagendili kulugangatu lugendu lwa magono gadatu, vakavika kambi ku Mala. <verse eid="NUM 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 33:9" />Vakawuka Mala vakagenda mbaka ku Elimu, pandu pepavi na vinyepa kumi na vivili vya manji na mavali sabini, kwenuko ndi vakavika kambi penapo.<verse eid="NUM 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 33:10" />Vakawuka ku Elimu na kuvika kambi pamuhana ya Nyanja ya Shamu. <verse eid="NUM 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 33:11" />Vawukili pamuhana ya Nyanja ya Shanu na kupumulila kulugagantu lwa Sini. <verse eid="NUM 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 33:12" />Vakawuka lugangatu lwa Sini, vakavika kambi ku Dofika. <verse eid="NUM 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 33:13" />Kuhuma Dofika vakavika kambi kula ku Alushi. <verse eid="NUM 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 33:14" />Kuhuma Alushi, vakavika kambi yavi kula Lefidimu, pandu pepavi lepi na manji ga kunywa.<verse eid="NUM 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 33:15" />Vawukili Lefidimu, vakavika kambi kulugangatu lwa Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 33:16" />Vakawuka kulugantu lwa Sinai na kuvika kambi kula Kibiloti Hataava. <verse eid="NUM 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 33:17" />Vakawuka Kibiloti Hataava, vakavika kambi kula Haseloti. <verse eid="NUM 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 33:18" />Vakawuka kula Haseloti na kuvika kambi Litima. <verse eid="NUM 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 33:19" />Vakawuka kula Litima na kuvika kambi Limoni Pelesi. <verse eid="NUM 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 33:20" />Vakawuka Limoni Pelesi na kuvika kambi yavi ku Libina. <verse eid="NUM 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 33:21" />Kuhuma Libina vakavika kambi ku Lisa. <verse eid="NUM 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 33:22" />Kuhuma ku Lisa vakavika kambi ku Kehelata. <verse eid="NUM 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 33:23" />Kuhuma ku Kehelata, vakavika kambi Kuchitumbi cha Shefeli. <verse eid="NUM 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 33:24" />Vawukili Kuchitumbi cha Shefeli na vakavika kambi ku Halada. <verse eid="NUM 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 33:25" />Kuhuma Halada, vakavika kambi ku Makeloti. <verse eid="NUM 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 33:26" />Kuhuma Makeloti, vakavika kambi ku Tahati. <verse eid="NUM 33:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 33:27" />Vawukili kula Tahati na vakavika kambi yavi ku Tela. <verse eid="NUM 33:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 33:28" />Vawukili ku Tela na kuvika kambi ku Mitika. <verse eid="NUM 33:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 33:29" />Vawukili ku Mitika, vakavika kambi ku Hashimona. <verse eid="NUM 33:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 33:30" />Kuhuma Hashimona, vakavika kambi ku Moseloti. <verse eid="NUM 33:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 33:31" />Vawukili ku Moseloti na kuvika kambi ku Bene Yakani. <verse eid="NUM 33:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 33:32" />Kuhuma Bene Yakani, vakavika kambi ku Holi Hagidigadi. <verse eid="NUM 33:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 33:33" />Vawukili Holi Hagidigadi na kuvika kambi ku Yotibata. <verse eid="NUM 33:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 33:34" />Vakawuka Yotibata na kuvika kambi Abilona. <verse eid="NUM 33:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 33:35" />Kuhuma Abilona, vakavika kambi ku Esioni Gebeli. <verse eid="NUM 33:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 33:36" />Vawukili ku Esioni Gebeli, vagendili na kuvika kambi kulugangatu lwa Sini, mewa yimanyikana Kadeshi. <verse eid="NUM 33:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 33:37" />Kuhuma Kadeshi, vakavika kambi Kuchitumbi cha Holi, mumbaka wa mulima wa Edomu.<verse eid="NUM 33:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 33:38" />Kwa malagizu ga Bambu Chapanga, mteta Aloni akweli kunani ya Chitumbi cha Holi, na kwenuko ndi afwili, muligono la kutumbula mwehi wa mhanu mwaka wa alobaini tangiya Vaisilaeli pevahumili ku Misili. <verse eid="NUM 33:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 33:39" />Aloni afwili kunani ya Chitumbi cha Holi kuni avi na miyaka miya yimonga na ishili na yidatu.<verse eid="NUM 33:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 33:40" />Nkosi wa Aladi, Mkanaani mweatamayi upandi wa kusini ya mulima wa Kanaani, ayuwini kuvya Vaisilaeli vibwela.<verse eid="NUM 33:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 33:41" />Vawukili kula Kuchitumbi cha Holi na vakavika kambi yavi ku Salimona. <verse eid="NUM 33:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 33:42" />Kuhuma Salimona, vakavika kambi ku Punoni. <verse eid="NUM 33:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 33:43" />Vakawuka ku Punoni na kuvika kambi ku Oboti. <verse eid="NUM 33:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 33:44" />Kuhuma kula Oboti, vakavika kambi ku Iye Abalimu, mumbaka wa mulima wa Moabu. <verse eid="NUM 33:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 33:45" />Vawukili Iye Abalimu na kuvika kambi ku Diboni Gadi. <verse eid="NUM 33:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 33:46" />Kuhuma Diboni Gadi vagendili na kuvika kambi ku Alimoni Dibilataimu. <verse eid="NUM 33:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 33:47" />Kuhuma Alimon Dibilataimu, vagendili na kuvika kambi ku Vitumbi vya Abalimu, papipi na Chitumbi Nebo. <verse eid="NUM 33:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 33:48" />Kuhuma Vitumbi vya Abalimu, vagendili na kuvika kambi kuselede za Moabu kumwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani papipi na Yeliko. <verse eid="NUM 33:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 33:49" />Kwenuko kuselede za Moabu vakavika kambi pamuhana ya Mfuleni Yoludani, kutumbula Beti Yeshimoti mbaka Abeli Shitimu.<verse eid="NUM 33:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizu kwakona kuyomboka mfuleni Yolodani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 33:50" />Kuselede za ku Moabu, mwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani papipi na ku Yeliko, Bambu Chapanga amjovili Musa, <verse eid="NUM 33:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 33:51" />“Vajovela Vaisilaeli kuvya pemwikupuka mfuleni Yoludani na kuyingila ku mulima wa Kanaani, <verse eid="NUM 33:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 33:52" />muvavinga vakolinjinji voha va mulima weuvi palongolo yinu. Mgwisa vimong'ong'o vyavi vyoha vya kuhongola na zezikitiwi lufumbu na kupagwisa kila pandu pavi pa pakugundamila. <verse eid="NUM 33:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 33:53" />Yati mukuutola mulima wenuwo kuvya wavi na kutama mwenumo ndava muni nivapelili nyenye yivya yinu. <verse eid="NUM 33:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 33:54" />Yati mukuugava mulima wenuwo kwa njila ya gudugudu, kulandana na lukolo lwinu, likabila livaha muligavila pandu pavaha na pandu padebe kwa likabila lidebe. <verse eid="NUM 33:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 33:55" />Nambu ngati muvavingi lepi vakolonjinji va mulima wenuwo, hinu vala vemukuleka yati vivya ngati lungoda pamihu ginu amala minga pandi zoha, yati vakuvang'aha. <verse eid="NUM 33:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 33:56" />Ngati mukuvavinga lepi nene yati nikuvakita nikuvayongomesa ngati chanagana kuvayongomesa vene.”<verse eid="NUM 33:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="NUM 34" />
  <para style="s">Mibaka ya Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 34:1" />Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 34:2" />“Valagiza Vaisilaeli ujova. Pemwiyingila ku Kanaani, mulima wenikuvapela uvyayi winu, mibaka ya mulima winu woha yati yivya naha. <verse eid="NUM 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 34:3" />Upandi wa kusini mmbaka winu yati wivya kuhuma lugangatu la Sini kulanda mbaka wa Edomu. Yati utumbula kwelihumila lilanga upandi wa kusini kumwishu wa nyanja ya mwinyu. <verse eid="NUM 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 34:4" />Kangi ung'anamukila kusini mwa ndila ya Akilabimu, yendelelayi kupitila lugangatu ku Sini na kuhamba kusini ya Kadeshi Balinea. Kangi m'baka wenuwo yati uhamba mbaka ku Hasali Adali mbaka ku Azimoni, <verse eid="NUM 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 34:5" />kuhuma Azimoni ya ung'anamuka kuyelekela kapela ya Misili kwekuvi na mmbaka wa Vamisili ma kumalisila nyanja ya Meditelania.”<verse eid="NUM 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 34:6" />“Mmbaka winu upandi welitima lilanga yati wivya nyanja ya Meditelania.”<verse eid="NUM 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 34:7" />“Mmbaka winu wa upandi wa kasikazini yati wivya, kuhuma nyanja ya Meditelania, yati muvika chindu cha kulangisa mubaka mbaka kuchitumbi cha Holi. <verse eid="NUM 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 34:8" />Kuhuma chitumbi cha Holi yati mwivika chindu kulangisa mmbaka mbaka njila ya Hamati, na kuyendelela mbaka Sedadi, <verse eid="NUM 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 34:9" />kuyendela mbaka Zifuloni na kumalisila Hazali Enani, wenuwo ndi mbaka winu kukasikazini.”<verse eid="NUM 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 34:10" />“Mmbaka winu wa upandi kelihumila lilanga yati mukuuvika chindu kulangisa mmbaka, kuhuma Hazali Enani mbaka Shefamu. <verse eid="NUM 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 34:11" />Kuhuma Shefanu yati wihamba kusini mbaka Libila, kwelihumila lilanga mwa Aini, kangi mmbaka wenuwo yati wihamba pahi mhelelu kwelihumila lilanga wa nyanja Kineleti, <verse eid="NUM 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 34:12" />kangi yati wihelela kulanda mfuleni Yoludani mbaka nyanja ya Mwinyu, wenuwu ndi mulima waku ngati mmbaka cheuvili.”<verse eid="NUM 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 34:13" />Hinu Musa akavajovela Vaisilaeli, “Wenuwu ndi mulima wemugaviwa kuvya winu kwa gudugudu, mulima wula Bambu Chapanga anilagizi vapewa makabila tisa na yapinga. <verse eid="NUM 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 34:14" />Vandu va kabila la Lubeni na la Gadi na yapinga ya likabila la Manase gapatili kuwanangana na lukolo zavi. <verse eid="NUM 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 34:15" />Makabila gavili na yapinga aga gapewili pandu pavi kumwambu ya mfuleni yoludani, mwambu ya Yeliko kwelihumila lilanga.”<verse eid="NUM 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vachilongosi veviyimamila kugiwiwa kwa mulima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 34:16" />Bambu Chapanga akamjovela Musa, <verse eid="NUM 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 34:17" />“Mteta Eliazali na Yoshua mwana wa Nuni ndi vevakuvagavila vandu mulima kuvya wavi. <verse eid="NUM 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 34:18" />Kangi uhagula chilongosi mmonga kuhuma kila likabila ndava ya kutangatila kugava ndima. <verse eid="NUM 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 34:19" />Genaga ndi mahina gavi, Vandu va likabila la Yuda. Kalebu mwana wa Yefune. <verse eid="NUM 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 34:20" />Kuhuma kabila la Simeoni, ahaguliwi Shemueli mwana wa Amihudi. <verse eid="NUM 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 34:21" />Kuhuma likabila la Benjamini ahaguliwi Elidadi mwana wa Kisiloni. <verse eid="NUM 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 34:22" />Kuhuma likabila la Dani ahaguliwi Buki mwana wa Yogoli. <verse eid="NUM 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 34:23" />Vandu va kabila la Manase ahaguliwi mwana wa Yosefu, Hanieli mwana wa Efodi. <verse eid="NUM 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 34:24" />Kuhuma likabila la Efulaimu, mwana wa Yosefu, Kemueli mwana wa Shifutani. <verse eid="NUM 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 34:25" />Vandu va kabila la Zebuluni, Elisafani mwana wa Palinaki. <verse eid="NUM 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 34:26" />Kuhuma likabila la Isakali, ahaguliwi Palitieli mwana wa Azani. <verse eid="NUM 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 34:27" />Kuhuma likabila la Asheli, ahaguliwi Ahihudi mwana wa Shelomi <verse eid="NUM 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 34:28" />Kuhuma likabila la Nafutali ahaguliwi Pedaheli mwana wa Amihudi.<verse eid="NUM 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 34:29" />Venava ndi vandu vala Bambu Chapanga avalagizi vavagavila Vaisilaeli mulima wa Kanaani kuvya mulima wavi.”<verse eid="NUM 34:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="NUM 35" />
  <para style="s">Miji yevapewi Valawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 35:1" />Bambu Chapanga alongili na Musa kumitambu ya Moabu, kumwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani papipi na Yeliko, akamjovela, <verse eid="NUM 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 35:2" />“Valagiza Vaisilaeli kuvya kulandana na uhali wevitalalilayi, vavapela Valawi miji ya kutama na pandu pa kudimila mifuya mumihana ya miji yeniyo. <verse eid="NUM 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 35:3" />miji yeniyo yati yivya yavi na vene yati vitama mwenumo na malishu yati givya ndava ya ng'ombi zavi pamonga na mene na mambelele pamonga na mifuya yavi yingi yoha. <verse eid="NUM 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 35:4" />Pandu pakulisila mifuya yemukuvapela Valawi kutindila miji yeniyo yati gidandasika mita miya mcheche na hamusini kuhuma ku luwumba lwa miji yeniyo. <verse eid="NUM 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 35:5" />Kuvala ya muji, pimayi mita miya tisa upandi kwelihumila lilanga na upandi wa kusini piamayi mita miya tisa na upandi kwalitipama lilanga pimayi mita miya tisa na upandi wa kasikazini pimayi mita miya tisa, na muji yati wivya pagati. Pandu apo yati pivya ndava ya kulisila mifuya. <verse eid="NUM 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 35:6" />Yati mukuvapela Valawi miji sita ya kutilalila pala mundu akamukoma muyaki changagana yati ihotola kutilila. Pamonga na yeniyo, yati mukuvapela miji yingi alobaini na yivili. <verse eid="NUM 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 35:7" />Jumula yikuvagana kuvapela Valawi miji alobaini na miya nane, pamonga na pandu pakudimila mifuya yavi. <verse eid="NUM 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 35:8" />Mvalangu wa miji yemukuvapela Valawi kuuhali wa Vaisilaeli yati yitegemela uvaha wa kabila, likabila livaha yati liwusa miji yamahele na likabila lidebe yati liwusa padebe. Kila likabila yati liwusa miji yaki ndava ya Valawi kuwanangana na pandu pevapewili.”<verse eid="NUM 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miji ya kutilila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 19:1-13">Ukumb 19:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1">Yosh 20:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 35:9" />Bambu Chapanga akalongela na Musa, akamjovela, <verse eid="NUM 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 35:10" />Uvajovela Vaisilaeli kuvya lukumbi pevikupuka mfuleni Yoludani na kuyingila mulima wa Kanaani, <verse eid="NUM 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 35:11" />yati mwihagula miji yeyivya ya kutilila kula mundu akamkoma muyaki changagana yati ikutilila. <verse eid="NUM 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 35:12" />Miji yeniyo yati yivya pandu pa kutilila bwina muni mkomaji akotoka kukomiwa na yula mweilipisa, muni akoto kufwa kwakona angahamuliwa palibanji la mihalu. <verse eid="NUM 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 35:13" />Mjivikila miji sita ndava ya kutilila. <verse eid="NUM 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 35:14" />Ku mulima wa Kanaani yemuyitenga, yidatu yivya upandi kwelihumila lilanga wa Yoludani na yidatu yingi yivya pagati ya mulima wa Kanaani. <verse eid="NUM 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 35:15" />Miji yeniyi sita yati yivya pandu pa kutilila ndava ya Vaisilaeli na vayehe na vangi voha vevitama pagati yinu, muni kuvya mundu yeyoha yula mweamkomili mundu yungi changagana ihotola kutilila mwenumo.<verse eid="NUM 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 35:16" />“Nambu mundu akamtova muyaki kwa chindu cha lyuma, mundu mwenuyo akafwa, ndi mkomaji mwenuyo iganikiwa akomiwa. <verse eid="NUM 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 35:17" />Mundu yoyoha akamtova myaki kwa liganga na kumkita afwayi, mundu mweuyo iganikiwa akomiwa. <verse eid="NUM 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 35:18" />Ngati akamtova muyaki kwa limbikiti na kumkita myaki afwayi, mundu mwenuyo mewa akomewa. <verse eid="NUM 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 35:19" />Mulongo wa mundu mweakomiwi yati ilipisa chila cheahengiwi mlongo waki. Mwenuyo peikonganeka na mkomaji yula yati akumkoma.”<verse eid="NUM 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 35:20" />“Kagati mundu akumhakalila muyaki kangi akamkang'a amala kumjugumila chindu kwa kugana na kufwa, <verse eid="NUM 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 35:21" />amala kwa kumtova ngumi na kufwa, hinu mundu mwenuyo mwamtovili myaki ndi mkomaji ndi iganikiwa akomiwa. Mlongo wa mundu mwenuyo yati akumlipisa kwa kumkoma peikonganeka nayu.”<verse eid="NUM 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 35:22" />“Nambu ngati mundu akamkang'a muyaki chigafula changamhakalila amala kumjugila chindu changambajamila, <verse eid="NUM 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 35:23" />amala ngati mundu akajugumila liganga lelihotola kumkita afwayi, akamkoma mundu changamanya, pamonga avi lepi likoko waki mewa nakugana kumlemasa, <verse eid="NUM 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 35:24" />hinu vandu yati vihamula pagati yula mkomaji na mlongo wa mundu mweakomiwi mweaganili kulipisa geakitili, kuwanangana na malagizu aga. <verse eid="NUM 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 35:25" />Libanji la muhalu yati vakumsangula mwakomi mwenuyo mumawoko ga vandu va mlongo wa mweakomiwi, ma kumuwuyisa kumuji wa matililo kweatilalili. Yati itama kwenuko mbaka lifwa la mteta mkulu wa lukumbi lwenulo mweahaguliwi lukumbi lwenulo kwa kunyalwa mahuta ga kumkita avya mteta wa Chapanga. <verse eid="NUM 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 35:26" />Nambu ngati yula mweakomili akahuma kuvala ya muji weatilili lukumbi lwolwoha lula, <verse eid="NUM 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 35:27" />kangi mlongo wa mundu mweakomiwi akamkolela kuvala ya mibaka ya muji wa matililo na akamkoma, mwenuyo ndi ivya lepi na mhalu wa kukoma. <verse eid="NUM 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 35:28" />Mweatakiwi yikumgana atama pamuji wa matililo mbaka peifwa Mteta Mkulu, na peifwa Mteta Mkulu yati iwuya kunyumba. <verse eid="NUM 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 35:29" />Malagizu aga yati gihengeka muviveleku vinu vyoha, pandu popoha pemwitama.”<verse eid="NUM 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 35:30" />“Mundu yeyoha mweikoma mundu, yati ihamuliwa lifwa ndava usahidi wa vandu vavili amala neju vevauwene ukomaji, nambu mundu yeyoha ihotola lepi kuhamuliwa lifwa ndava mundu mmonga kumuwona ukomaji. <verse eid="NUM 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 35:31" />Mkoto kupokela fidiya yoyoha kusangula wumi wa mkomaji mweiganikiwa lifwa, mundu mwenuyo yikumgana akomiwa. <verse eid="NUM 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 35:32" />mkoto kupokela amala kuyidakila fidiya yeyoha kuhuma kwa mundu mweatilili muji wa matililo muni kumyidakila awuya kutama kunyumba yaki kwakona Mteta Mkulu angafwa. <verse eid="NUM 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 35:33" />Mkotoka kukita mulima wemutama niubela. Kukoma vandu kukita Chapanga aubela mulima, na kawaka luteta lweluhotola kuunyambisa mulima, nambu kwa kumkoma mkomaji yula ndu. <verse eid="NUM 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 35:34" />Mkoto kuukita mulima wemutama niubela muni nene nitama mumomo, nene Bambu Chapanga nitama pagati ya Vaisilaeli.”<verse eid="NUM 35:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="NUM 36" />
  <para style="s">Ndima wevapewili vadala vevagegiwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 36:1" />Vachilongosi wa vandu va likolo lwa Gileadi, mwana wa makili na mwana wa Manase na mwana wa Yosefu, vahambili kulongela na Musa na vachilongosi vangi wa lukolo lwa Vaisilaeli. <verse eid="NUM 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 36:2" />Vakajova, “Bambu witu, Bambu Chapanga akulagizi kuvagavila vandu va Isilaeli mulima kwa nchuva, kuvya uhali wavi, mewa akulagizi uvapela vasikana va Selofehadi mlongo witu pandu wa dadi wavi. <verse eid="NUM 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 36:3" />Hinu ngati vene yati vigegewa na vandu va makabila gangi ga Vaisilaeli, uhali wavi yati uwusiwa kuhuma uhali wa vagogo vitu na kuyonjokeseka kuvya uhali wa likabila lila levagegiwi valumbu. Hinu mulima witu yati wipungula. <verse eid="NUM 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 36:4" />Kuligono la mselebuko wa kuwuyisa ndima kwa vene, uhali wavi yati uvalangiwa pamonga wula wa likabila levigegewa na ndi likabila litu yati lipata lepi uhali wenuo kavili.”<verse eid="NUM 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 36:5" />“Hinu Musa akavalagiza Vaisilaeli lilagizu ili kuhuma kwa Bambu Chapanga, akavajovela, Vandu va lukolo lwa kabila la Yosefu, vajovili chakaka. <verse eid="NUM 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 36:6" />Chenichi ndi Bambu Chapanga cheilagiza kuvavala vasikana va Selofehadi. Vihotola kugegewa na mundu yeyoha mwevakumgana, nambu vagegewa pagati ya lukolo lwa kabila la dadi waki ndi likabila Manase ndu. <verse eid="NUM 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 36:7" />Ndima yevapewili likabila limonga likoto kupewa likabila lingi, kila Muisilaeli yati iyangalila ndima ya likabila laki. <verse eid="NUM 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 36:8" />Mdala mweahali ndima mulikabila loloha la Isilaeli ndi yikumgana agegewa na mundu wa likabila la lukolo lwa dadi waki, muni kila Muisilaeli atalalila ndima vagogo waki. <verse eid="NUM 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 36:9" />Ndi kawaka ndima ya likabila limonga lelitalilwa na likabila lingi. Kila likabia la Vaisilaeli yati likamulila uhali waki.”<verse eid="NUM 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 36:10" />Chenichi ndi vasikana va Selofehadi chavakitili ngati Bambu Chapanga cheamalagizi Musa. <verse eid="NUM 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 36:11" />Voha, Mala na Tiliza na Hogila na Milika na Noa vagegiwi na valongo va dadi wavi. <verse eid="NUM 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 36:12" />Vagegiwi kwa vandu va lukolo lwa Manase mwana wa Yosefu, na ndima yavi yasigalili mulikabila la dadi wavi.<verse eid="NUM 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 36:13" />Yeniyo ndi mihilu na malagizu gala Bambu Chapanga avapeli Vaisilaeli kupitila Musa muselede za Moabu, kumwambu ya mfuleni Yoludani papipi na muji wa Yeliko.<verse eid="NUM 36:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 36" />
</usx>